b43c97de28cf251de8921e4ec9b6a7d20b467e9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T23:00:14Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T23:36:16Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"message":"fleet-onboard: backport four repos (surfaces 6-8), chain founding → onboarding, file TD-010/011/012\n\nFollow-through from the daily-logger silent-sweep RCA (daily-logger #280).\n\nBackport (surfaces 6–8): lego-village-pipeline, play-well-library, dealdesk,\nfoundry-recipes added to the CLAUDE.md ecosystem table and both\nframe-standup REPOS lists.\n\nFounding is onboarding: all four repos were founded inside agentic sessions\n(handoff founding acts, `chore: repo init`, a hand bootstrap) and none\nsurfaced /scaffold-app or /fleet-onboard. Against the main catalog the four\nreal founding prompts score fleet-onboard 0; with the new triggers\n(\"founding acts\", \"gh repo create\", \"repo init\", \"bootstrap a new repo\", …)\nit ranks first on all four, and it now also chains after scaffold-frame-app.\nscaffold-app / scaffold-frame-app instruct the agent to invoke it; the\nfleet-onboard gotchas record the incident.\n\nSurface matrix: row 2 (daily-logger sweep) is AUTO — derived from\n`gh repo list` in daily-logger #280; row 3 is one REPO_NOTES entry.\n\nTechdebt: TD-010 (founding bypasses the skills; deterministic hook still\nmissing), TD-011 (dealdesk/foundry-recipes have no northstar; seven older\norg repos now swept-but-unnoted — operator ruling each), TD-012 (surface 9\ninstall-agents never run for three repos; live worker agents, so\noperator-scheduled). TD-007 updated with what is now derived.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6f354f31f3853bdd584cdd0c324b10df675bc2a1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/core/git/trees/6f354f31f3853bdd584cdd0c324b10df675bc2a1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/core/git