reply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"message":"techdebt: TD-009 — worktrees inherit local main, publishing \"do not push\" commits\n\nFiled from two realized incidents on 2026-08-08 (PRs #433 and #435) of a\nhazard already logged on 2026-08-03 and left in place. Session worktrees\nbranch off local `main`, which carries operator commits the ledger marks\ndo-not-push; a one-file PR opened from such a worktree silently carries\nthem. #433 was caught only because core''s rebase-only merge policy\ncollided with inherited merge commits; #435 was not caught, and 9 such\ncommits are now on public origin/main.\n\nAlso records the contributing gap: the rebase-only merge policy is\nundocumented, so sessions discover it by failed merge calls.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e61e5ea21a9d527aa6afacff4fca9382b57f8501","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/core/git/trees/e61e5ea21a9d527aa6afacff4fca9382b57f8501"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/core/git/commits/3a60387a383772f97d0a74797d0bd0eb340541e0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type