areness (solution-aware buyers get build-shaping questions\nanchored to their brief, never pain-excavation) then routes support through\n/mece and structure through /minto, closing with an explicit ask. Both Tier-1s\nindependently callable. All user-scoped, catalog v1.25, methodology-meta.\n\nCanonical understanding lives in the selfco vault (wiki/concepts/\nminto-pyramid-principle.md, mece.md, scqa.md — authored same day); knowledge/\nfiles are self-contained for dealdesk''s headless SKILL.md reads.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0d7dd6da879cf2431c33cc1e1a8801a7a0b55f36","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/core/git/trees/0d7dd6da879cf2431c33cc1e1a8801a7a0b55f36"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/core/git/commits/724cb04c10b7f43ba866960ddfa72bde51a029ac","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/core/commit/724cb04c10b7f43ba866960ddfa72bde51a029ac","node_id":"C_kwDORWW6tdoAKDcyNGNiMDRjMTBiN2Y0M2JhODY2OTYwZGRm