yle LangGraph coupling declined\nand parked as fog. Frontier: Smallest de-freezing slice for Lab 1, Template-pack\nprovenance, Lab artifact & telemetry boundary.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"635634210d03d68d21e7727855358fde7631caa2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/core/git/trees/635634210d03d68d21e7727855358fde7631caa2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/core/git/commits/b8bf5693d992a02cf0d2cb6d22e5ed9ab3386883","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/core/commit/b8bf5693d992a02cf0d2cb6d22e5ed9ab3386883","node_id":"C_kwDORWW6tdoAKGI4YmY1NjkzZDk5MmEwMmNmMGQyY2I2ZDIyZTVlZDlhYjMzODY4ODM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/core/commit/39c0f931a53dfcdd5a1e2bb7246e079b8a54aba2","sha":"39c0f931a53dfcdd5a1e2bb7246e079b8a54aba2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/core/commits/39c0f931a53dfcdd5a1e2bb7246e079b8a54aba2"}],"sha":"b8bf5693d992a02cf0d2cb6d22e5ed9ab3386883","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/core/commits/b8bf5693d992a02cf0d2cb6d22e5ed9ab3386883"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/core/commits/39c0f931a53dfcdd5a1e2bb7246e079b8a54aba2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-14T03:55:10Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-14T03:56:14Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"message":"wayfinder(459): record the lab-surface ruling — terminal-side, mock-default, TS first\n\nLabs execute in the operator''s terminal, not in-page. Decided on fidelity, not\ncost: the zero-dependency ruling had just made the in-page CodeMirror strip\ncheap and it still lost, because in-browser Python cannot run stock SDK code\n(APIConnectionError; a real response needs the dangerous-direct-browser-access\nheader the exam never mentions) and Batches is CORS-blocked from every browser\norigin. Both dissolve in a terminal.\n\nGrading follows Exercism''s file contract (results.json, exit 0 regardless of\npass/fail, per-assertion tests[]); scaffolds are Python-Koans-shaped. Execution\ndefaults to a base_url mock for deterministic grading, live API one unset env\nvar away. Slice one is TypeScript, with the per-language command table present\nso Python-via-uv is a later config row. The app emits results.json but does not\ningest it — that hop has no prior art in any surveyed runner.\n\nMap bookkeeping for the grilling ticket \"Lab-surface selection\":\n- gist appended under Decisions so far\n- Tickets-table row flipped to closed\n- frontier line rewritten (now #454, #455 — the survey is fully consumed)\n- reshaped-tickets note extended to #455, #458 and #461\n- new fog recorded: who authors lab scaffolds. Statable, therefore\n  ticket-shaped by the placement litmus — parked with an explicit note rather\n  than projected, since this was a work session and not a charting one\n\nOpen unknowns appended to decisions/open-unknowns.md; four deviations logged to\nimplementation-notes.md covering both tickets in this sitting.\n\nThe cca-prep-lab-execution-locus ADR stub was drafted in-loop and left for the\noperator to apply.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a77019754ead0060885c7fdf2b6d9a74f7707a21","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/core/git/trees/a77019754ead0060885c7fdf2b6d9a74f7707a21"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/core/git/commits/39c0f931a53dfcdd5a1e2bb7246e079b8a54aba2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","or