b9fd04451ae1d87afd8a08915cb52ee77dfb0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-14T03:41:53Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-14T03:43:03Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"message":"wayfinder(456): record the zero-dependency ruling — fleet app stack adopted\n\ncca-prep retires the zero-dependency rule and adopts the standard fleet app\nstack: pnpm workspace, committed lockfile, dependency audit on, TypeScript,\nReact + Vite permitted, mirroring Morning Cockpit''s packages/renderer. Carbon\nstays rejected — that was always the objection, never React — so the GroupThink\ndesign language and spec lines 43-47 stand, with the trailing \"no React/Carbon\nruntime\" clause narrowed to \"no Carbon\".\n\nMap bookkeeping for the grilling ticket \"Zero-dependency rule: sidecar vs\nrevise\":\n- gist appended under Decisions so far\n- Tickets-table row flipped to closed\n- frontier line rewritten (now #454, #455, #459 — lab-surface selection is\n  unblocked, both its blockers done)\n- Destination amended: \"the drill engine''s zero-dep core\" is no longer listed\n  untouchable, since the rule it named is retired\n- new fog charted: whether the drill client keeps an exam-eve runtime guarantee\n  once it is a Vite build artifact\n- tickets the ruling reshapes flagged (#455 workbench home, #458 template-pack\n  provenance)\n\nOpen unknowns from the grill appended to decisions/open-unknowns.md.\n\nThe CLAUDE.md:24 diff and the cca-prep-managed-dependencies ADR stub were\ndrafted in-loop and deliberately left for the operator to apply.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"34a0bbc3bda5897ee79fb23ecbb4d66578973c03","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/core/git/trees/34a0bbc3bda5897ee79fb23ecbb4d66578973c03"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/core/git/commits/a22b9fd04451ae1d87afd8a08915cb52ee77dfb0","verification