"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-13T20:07:34Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"message":"research(457): executable-lab surface survey — findings + map bookkeeping\n\nResolves wayfinder #457 (map cca-prep-workbench). ONE deep-research cycle:\n5 angles, 144 claims, 15 load-bearing claims adversarially verified, 6 refuted.\n\nNames no winner — mechanism selection is #459. What it establishes:\n- The Batches API is CORS-blocked from every origin tested, so no in-browser\n  mechanism can teach it against the live API. That is one of the six required\n  lab topics.\n- Both official SDKs honour a base_url override, measured against a 12-line\n  node:http mock — key-free offline labs are reachable on the current stack.\n- Two host costs the charting brief did not carry: engine/server.mjs has no\n  generic static-file handler, and NOTHING in CI enforces the zero-dependency\n  rule. It is prose in CLAUDE.md, which changes what #456 is ruling on.\n- Three hosted-embed options carry non-technical blockers (StackBlitz paid-only\n  embedding, Replit read-only deprecation, Codespaces account requirement).\n\nAbsolute home paths stripped from the sources section before landing — core is\npublic.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"fa8b36e3dee563f4891d840ada456031eff485f2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/core/git/trees/fa8b36e3dee563f4891d840ada456031eff485f2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/core/git/commits/7fef8d37e7dd641842e50ebb63fecd24c89ccb78","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github