ent but untracked — invisible from CI''s\nvantage\". They are the cca-prep chain: the S1 spec that CLAUDE.md calls the\n\"Spec of record\", the wayfinder workbench brief that the merged map\n(decisions/wayfinder/cca-prep-workbench.md) cites in its Notes, plus the\ndeveloper/professional prep brief, the S1 report, the external-source-registry\naddendum, and the triple-cert roadmap corrections.\n\nUntil now the map''s provenance pointer resolved only on one machine. .handoff/\nis already tracked here (53 files on main), so this is the established pattern,\nnot new exposure — scanned for secrets, emails and absolute paths (clean); the\nonly client string (\"Texas R&R\") is already public on main in\ndecisions/wayfinder/texas-rr-engagement.md.\n\n.claude/launch.json is gitignored instead: machine-local Browser-pane config,\ntracked in no fleet repo.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b439f414fefb06c64be3739ecf2b9d2f733e65bb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/core/git/trees/b439f414fefb06c64be3739ecf2b9d2f733e65bb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/core/git/commits/8b3adcfc859f3522b00a9a982ac4806b17562e78","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.