eferred:\n\n- 20260803-1130 (Newline sitting 6): status ''done'' -> ''closed'' and\n  responding_to wired. The vantage-gap session deferred both because the file\n  existed only in unpushed local-main commits and a branch off origin/main could\n  not reach it. It is on origin/main now, so the repair is finally actionable.\n- 20260803-0140 (Newline sitting 5): responding_to wired, same deferral.\n- The canon brief + report from PR #445 used a loose key: value header instead\n  of a --- frontmatter block, so bead-lint read them as having no frontmatter at\n  all. Wrapped both properly; the report now retires its brief''s hook.\n\nNet: 0 schema errors, open hooks 19 -> 17. Content of every bead is unchanged.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"757afce74b06653c94bf62e0cc0a8b8cc11f89c3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/core/git/trees/757afce74b06653c94bf62e0cc0a8b8cc11f89c3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/core/git/commits/209b9663be141fae59a34f262bd0a7e1b7c8effc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://a