e projection'' was\nmissing for each.\n\n- cockpit-northstar-conversation (#333) — charted 2026-08-01, 7 tickets, unchanged.\n- neistat-ai-bulletin (#422) — charted 2026-08-08. Destination: Camera Program\n  Bulletin AI/04 with Van Neistat as nearest living precedent, fed by a tracker that\n  tags captures for bulletin-relevance rather than merely archiving. Two tickets\n  already closed: #423 (disclosure seam) and #426 (scheduler split).\n\nteach-persistence.md is deliberately absent — it is already upstream in 24647cf and\nonly appeared untracked because local main is 2 commits behind.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4656f075fdcc6f3673a9214d23ba1b406d4de436","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/core/git/trees/4656f075fdcc6f3673a9214d23ba1b406d4de436"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/core/git/commits/69714cb5e42301d02acc6b916d2b3d78f957dea2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/core/commit/69714cb5e42301d