epo list is a hand-maintained cache of it.\nscripts/fleet-manifest.mjs reconciles the machine-readable surfaces from the\nfleet-onboard surface matrix against the registry and emits fleet.json, the\ngenerated view the caches will later be derived from (S5).\n\nShadow per ADR-0086: report-only, exit 0 on drift; --check exists but is NOT\nwired in CI. Promotion to blocking is the S6 RIDM decision after a clean shadow\nperiod. Sibling-repo surfaces degrade to UNREACHABLE from a core-only vantage\n(same posture as northstar-lint); prose surfaces report as MANUAL, never\nsilently skipped.\n\nParse identity with the seven existing registry consumers is by construction:\nthe reconciler loads the registry through scripts/lib/northstar-fm.mjs rather\nthan reparsing.\n\nFirst live run already catches real drift: f1-learning-studio on the CLAUDE.md\ntable with no directory on disk, gcgcca (pre-rename) still in daily-logger\nbuild-api.ts, and fieldwork-1 registered but absent from every complete surface.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"74826eccdd2d221757b73fad79af6f23bfb35588","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/core/git/trees/74826eccdd2d221757b73fad79af6f23bfb35588"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/core/git/commits/695bb3c48de22ef8340a7a28f643305562c235e5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api