9Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-08T21:40:07Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"message":"fix(diagram): deliver one self-contained HTML page, not bare SVGs\n\nPrinciple 6 kept mmdc rendering as the parse check but bare SVGs sent\nvia file delivery render as raw attachments for the operator\n(2026-08-08 session). Delivery unit is now a single self-contained HTML\npage: each SVG inlined into a styled card with title + prose caption,\ndark-mode-aware, no external assets.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d8c16f23b752cbcf37ab096f238445c9cc0afd11","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/core/git/trees/d8c16f23b752cbcf37ab096f238445c9cc0afd11"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/core/git/commits/afd6cfac7983b4d2b40f16c503953374f1f80d95","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/core/commit/afd6cfac7983