pocock/skills engineering/wizard at pin 84fdeff). Per\nADR-0083 nothing is vendored: scripts/wizard-template.sh re-authors the stage\nlibrary locally against the upstream helper contract (banner/stage/say/step/\nopen_url/ask/ask_secret/write_env/set_secret/set_var/pause/confirm/finish,\nTOTAL_STAGES progress, per-stage screen clears, idempotent .env upserts,\nhidden secret entry, WSL-aware URL open, closing summary), with local\nhardening upstream lacks: stock-macOS bash 3.2 safety (empty-array guards\nunder set -u — unguarded expansion verifiably fails on /bin/bash 3.2.57),\na Ctrl-C trap that prints a partial summary and resumability note, quoted\n.env round-trip for values with whitespace/#, gh-variable to-do fallback,\nand a runtime TOTAL_STAGES overrun warning.\n\nVerified: bash -n (5.x + 3.2), shellcheck clean, and a scripted smoke run on\n/bin/bash 3.2 with gh off PATH — capture, upsert idempotence, Enter-keeps-\nsaved re-run default, and the set_secret manual-to-do fallback all observed.\n\nCatalog v1.23: registered scope:[\"user\"] (deviation logged — D39 left scope\nunspecified; both first use cases, buddy-check aws-sso and selfco Pi deploy\nkeys, live outside core).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"86e603c411935f222ac6564a627b68abc361a5a9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/core/git/trees/86e603c411935f222ac6564a627b68abc361a5a9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/core/git/commits/a264bb7a068eae7117bce2b636853e93b5d3f69f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html