batim and\nupgraded from a posture to a calibration protocol; U8 promoted mapped -> ingested,\nclosing the curriculum''s last genuinely uncovered topic. 13 of 18 courses now full.\n\nLoRA contradiction NOT adjudicated — both candidate tiebreakers checked directly,\nneither carries r/alpha. U14 M8 is the last plausible source.\n\nThree deviations logged, one of which overturns a standing assumption: video-only\nlessons DO have auto-generated transcripts, so \"U17 and the Harness Engineering\nDSPy/GEPA lecture are not ingestible\" is unverified rather than true.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"98094eda9d8b49d47a6f2d151a611945cecfd43c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/core/git/trees/98094eda9d8b49d47a6f2d151a611945cecfd43c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/core/git/commits/4177740d9d1de1a8f01e5625d1c6ff8ac4ba0b95","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/core/commit/4177740d9d1de1a8f01e5625d1c6ff8ac4ba0b95","