on contains '': '' (\"schema v2: sections\"), which strict YAML parsers reject as a nested mapping. Claude Code tolerates it today, but a loader that rejects the block drops every frontmatter field and the skill falls back to its directory name and first body line.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqw/HECRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA0aAQAGACwbKc1BM29WMXP+39Wnbl\ntUfvqNQRvbXZK8uNwUt8VXGN0uy1pSey9MDCvqDuhC5LZRLq+B5rW0X0TmHWccrM\n7Vm5Pyy3iTkK0Ws1FNM5zn6WC04KAhyIWxtDh2+GQzQ8B5MHRCkUb5trwIVpPQy1\nTHJfojq4K/WlYGkvuWpxRS1hbTNj+RISg+AeV7C4+y6ilScjtJTgKbqegGelmsOS\neFqKNnFEQEWsbJMTJb6EeuWz8tJOzASMm9EjtasV8+2MnmnsK9joEgYnP8lDujuV\n9ZUjSq3oIw8n5AsrGKNpYcxgfW+8nU2Bue4oUECE8LvulxYLOTluuShLJb59BkXD\nTw+54OHkH9mrU9GYFaihHTN/Y/uD3TEvjy3lS7mJRaZW5bgOs9se1p4yPCK8ZVRa\nXFcfghmz6+0t60OwWxAIf36jd7N9/houLuVnH/LeSOxP+JfYdLMnfiOjUPWAhcrM\nxe/RBD6/vTjZRdW37L6PvjwxthuV8fSLRORXv9wKgaBGW1683zJdSCFAC1kreAnb\nF9ng6RvkIFv9tSrFyM8mLJhzNMGnTjDCnt5N7CWDul6Gij6CT/BvbxFR2raJ19OB\nq5qsLG1MTiYMn4OpnWQKTyRFmtFbK+P7kj6QXqELYsR6DmURWjGWi+lDvZ6EW+j/\nb7cicUmm8z0v+MF/BrXc\n=1cIv\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-05T18:51:48Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Huitzo-Inc/pack-claude-env/commit/053d5669431d7acd2522c8c779773f04dc825608","node_id":"C_kwDORWgBlNoAKDA1M2Q1NjY5NDMxZDdhY2QyNTIyYzhjNzc5NzczZjA0ZGM4MjU2MDg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Huitzo-Inc/pack-claude-env/commit/3515ae80e31cd895ecad84fed3af111aa66fa507","sha":"3515ae80e31cd895ecad84fed3af111aa66fa507","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Huitzo-Inc/pack-claude-env/commits/3515ae80e31cd895ecad84fed3af111aa66fa507"}],"sha":"053d5669431d7acd2522c8c779773f04dc825608","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Huitzo-Inc/pack-claude-env/commits/053d5669431d7acd2522c8c779773f04dc825608"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/93721212?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/esola-thomas/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/esola-thomas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/esola-thomas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/esola-thomas/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/esola-thomas","id":93721212,"login":"esola-thomas","node_id":"U_kgDOBZYSfA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/esola-thomas/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/esola-thomas/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/esola-thomas/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/esola-thomas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/esola-thomas/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/esola-thomas","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Huitzo-Inc/pack-claude-env/commits/3515ae80e31cd895ecad84fed3af111aa66fa507/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-28T03:23:39Z","email":"93721212+esola-thomas@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ernesto Sola-Thomas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T03:23:39Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(claude): min_sdk_version is the Hub mount contract; document the bundled listing (2.1.1) (#19)\n\nThe dashboard-manifest rule said `min_sdk_version` declares the minimum\n`@huitzo/dashboard-sdk-react` version. The Hub actually compares it with the\nmount-context (HuitzoContext) version it provides, which follows the core\n`@huitzo/dashboard-sdk` line, and refuses to mount a dashboard that asks for\nmore. A dashboard that followed the rule (`min_sdk_version: \"7.0.0\"`) showed\n\"Incompatible Dashboard ... this Hub provides 0.5.0\". The rule now says what\nthe field means, drops the invented `1.0.0` default, and carries a ❌ example.\n\nIt also gains a \"Catalog listing\" section: the Hub fills the catalog page\nfrom `huitzo-dashboard.json` at the bundle root (ship it via `public/`), not\nfrom the YAML; an invalid `listing` is dropped without failing the publish;\nasset type, size and SVG limits. The rule now also loads when editing\n`public/huitzo-dashboard.json`.\n\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_011mwyo5mEWwQ3BBgRrVgAdQ\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ca7cf3ac869fb95c4a84d213ed1e037b03c4d2e8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Huitzo-Inc/pack-claude-env/git/trees/ca7cf3ac869fb95c4a84d213ed1e037b03c4d2e8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Huitzo-Inc/pack-claude-env/git/commits/3515ae80e31cd895ecad84fed3af111aa66fa507","verification":{"payload":"tree ca7cf3ac869fb95c4a84d213ed1e037b03c4d2e8\nparent 99635ddccbffd69fbf5a6e68dedd1f3a3c679ceb\nauthor Ernesto Sola-Thomas <93721212+esola-thomas@users.noreply.github.com> 1790565819 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790565819 -0400\n\nfix(claude): min_sdk_version is the Hub mount contract; document the bundled listing (2.1.1) (#19)\n\nThe dashboard-manifest rule said `min_sdk_version` declares the minimum\n`@huitzo/dashboard-sdk-react` version. The Hub actually compares it with the\nmount-context (HuitzoContext) version it provides, which follows the core\n`@huitzo/dashboard-sdk` line, and refuses to mount a dashboard that asks for\nmore. A dashboard that followed the rule (`min_sdk_version: \"7.0.0\"`) showed\n\"Incompatible Dashboard ... this Hub provides 0.5.0\". The rule now says what\nthe field means, drops the invented `1.0.0` default, and carries a ❌ example.\n\nIt also gains a \"Catalog listing\" section: the Hub fills the catalog page\nfrom `huitzo-dashboard.json` at the bundle root (ship it via `public/`), not\nfrom the YAML; an invalid `listing` is dropped without failing the publish;\nasset type, size and SVG limits. The rule now also loads when editing\n`public/huitzo-dashboard.json`.\n\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_011mwyo5mEWwQ3BBgRrVgAdQ\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqud27CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAk7IQAHw7ahvnFabHOYSAr2DYGMXp\nEw5IE7n/Garxyzs1spgynmkQP5qRNeIRA0Ans7MvB2GYV+/il7WmW7tf6TIcxtwF\nNYy/T2PSvnid+0M1eg5QCAqKHYgG9/a+88aBU3JGcoHtaGSZMdMc/O6xnif0Royn\nQubDEvAdViQWWtq5Hhvcn3CwjCv4I6+hzt8hwGfobrVtCxhjsLMGAFVEARxm5oDC\n6XO3CFgngjr/buLNjihzK3Q/o0+sJZurAKMUGQx0243qLk7QHzgcAsIYumXpfj9h\nhDRk0Sx7iYaSjWvHy/JQjDKzyQ/xiSPl15mechS+wLO0Da1c8ACKSVJuWSLWAqml\n/TYvAp60r4Ky7T8+MbqNp+856Oa8TY7xOkfihhUD1ARNDXnEgyS0Ll6+Fgl/I+Pn\n0g0ji8JpAEvWBetliMpztJULk82K8CU0FX8TL006kyVdk9/YnkGqepN/E9sOhJvQ\nB8ZroaFE0VpAiFLpE9ruYRXz1FOjccRWI+gYZ2HJ3R/3Bd206AmZHaQG8FHHxsuu\nZNh4MWQhBar0bQ9gRsut/aN+C3daFeK9JCOEe7imX8ICSKEMOQMGWe/LWqdWhkd1\nXSkFQ/+Mpjs4C9S7gmZYel4ZDb8NbDJ5WRJR4sp+/YfMBWJ2OChs0x284IKR63D2\ntY/pMey5zE17XGM8Liln\n=iDUk\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-28T03:23:40Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.co