thub.com/users/esola-thomas/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/esola-thomas/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/esola-thomas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/esola-thomas/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/esola-thomas","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Huitzo-Inc/pack-claude-env/commits/99635ddccbffd69fbf5a6e68dedd1f3a3c679ceb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T04:52:32Z","email":"93721212+esola-thomas@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ernesto Sola-Thomas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T04:52:32Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"docs(claude): dashboard SDK reference for dashboard-sdk-react 7.0.0 (release 2.1.0) (#18)\n\n* docs(claude): dashboard SDK reference catches up to dashboard-sdk-react 6.0.0 / dashboard-sdk 0.7.0\n\nHuitzoProvider now reads the token per request through the client''s getToken\naccessor instead of copying it at mount; the skill and hub-contract rule still\ndescribed the mount-time snapshot. Documents the TokenAccessor option as the\npreferred standalone form, accessor-mode auth.refresh()/logout() rejections,\nthe empty-token isAuthenticated() rule, the >=0.7.0 peer, and the core\nexports authors reach for (TokenAccessor, isTerminalTaskStatus, ErrorCode).\ncheck_api_surface.py pins the new versions and now asserts core exports too.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_011mwyo5mEWwQ3BBgRrVgAdQ\n\n* docs(claude): dashboard SDK reference for dashboard-sdk-react 7.0.0 and primitives 0.2.4\n\nuseCommand and useTemplateCommand take a poll option (CommandPollOptions) for\n202-receipt commands that outlast the 5 minute default, and execute() now\nresolves Promise<T | undefined> without ever rejecting. Documents both, the\nPromise<void> wrap migration, the unchanged TemplateCommandAdapter.execute\ncontract, the Form submit row moving into the form (.hz-form__actions), and\nthe hz-form primitive''s onSubmit widening to (values) => unknown. Adds a\nlong-running-commands note and two anti-pattern rows, updates the useCommand\ntest mock, and pins 7.0.0 in check_api_surface.py.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_011mwyo5mEWwQ3BBgRrVgAdQ\n\n* chore: release 2.1.0 (dashboard SDK reference for dashboard-sdk-react 7.0.0)\n\nBump plugin.json and marketplace.json to 2.1.0 and add the CHANGELOG entry\nfor the dashboard reference update verified against dashboard-sdk-react\n7.0.0, dashboard-sdk 0.7.0 and dashboard-primitives 0.2.4.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_011mwyo5mEWwQ3BBgRrVgAdQ\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"235213fbd048dfc7d0a9ab522ca9612dd8910d97","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Huitzo-Inc/pack-claude-env/git/trees/235213fbd048dfc7d0a9ab522ca9612dd8910d97"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Huitzo-Inc/pack-claude-env/git/commits/99635ddccbffd69fbf5a6e68dedd1f3a3c679ceb","verification":{"payload":"tree 235213fbd048dfc7d0a9ab522ca9612dd8910d97\nparent 8d2b9d1de5672e588f4864e29023089e801ab3a4\nauthor Ernesto Sola-Thomas <93721212+esola-thomas@users.noreply.github.com> 1790139152 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790139152 -0400\n\ndocs(claude): dashboard SDK reference for dashboard-sdk-react 7.0.0 (release 2.1.0) (#18)\n\n* docs(claude): dashboard SDK reference catches up to dashboard-sdk-react 6.0.0 / dashboard-sdk 0.7.0\n\nHuitzoProvider now reads the token per request through the client''s getToken\naccessor instead of copying it at mount; the skill and hub-contract rule still\ndescribed the mount-time snapshot. Documents the TokenAccessor option as the\npreferred standalone form, accessor-mode auth.refresh()/logout() rejections,\nthe empty-token isAuthenticated() rule, the >=0.7.0 peer, and the core\nexports authors reach for (TokenAccessor, isTerminalTaskStatus, ErrorCode).\ncheck_api_surface.py pins the new versions and now asserts core exports too.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_011mwyo5mEWwQ3BBgRrVgAdQ\n\n* docs(claude): dashboard SDK reference for dashboard-sdk-react 7.0.0 and primitives 0.2.4\n\nuseCommand and useTemplateCommand take a poll option (CommandPollOptions) for\n202-receipt commands that outlast the 5 minute default, and execute() now\nresolves Promise<T | undefined> without ever rejecting. Documents both, the\nPromise<void> wrap migration, the unchanged TemplateCommandAdapter.execute\ncontract, the Form submit row moving into the form (.hz-form__actions), and\nthe hz-form primitive''s onSubmit widening to (values) => unknown. Adds a\nlong-running-commands note and two anti-pattern rows, updates the useCommand\ntest mock, and pins 7.0.0 in check_api_surface.py.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_011mwyo5mEWwQ3BBgRrVgAdQ\n\n* chore: release 2.1.0 (dashboard SDK reference for dashboard-sdk-react 7.0.0)\n\nBump plugin.json and marketplace.json to 2.1.0 and add the CHANGELOG entry\nfor the dashboard reference update verified against dashboard-sdk-react\n7.0.0, dashboard-sdk 0.7.0 and dashboard-primitives 0.2.4.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_011mwyo5mEWwQ3BBgRrVgAdQ\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqs1sQCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA3cgQADSU/C/nuzkrxIscE+9+42hL\nCq0iHJZfVPcUaLqSF8ggOH3YYtcj41S9WgJZXGVAhy2S+X/hVD5MIItrNb0hwg0t\nxtm60T/bPGDfEAJlYmjkC0xnFy+c6JWO9ywrOQHbZSc8tiOzpUywfluxewoDY3p6\nnCeKy9rSsvMswfxoYRx/X45m1A3P+wRhh41x0lIElKBKUPyyvjR1lHJPie