itzo-Inc/pack-claude-env/commits/00b0451e2121797cb9aa8fc825bd1ff91b230d07"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/93721212?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/esola-thomas/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/esola-thomas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/esola-thomas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/esola-thomas/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/esola-thomas","id":93721212,"login":"esola-thomas","node_id":"U_kgDOBZYSfA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/esola-thomas/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/esola-thomas/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/esola-thomas/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/esola-thomas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/esola-thomas/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/esola-thomas","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Huitzo-Inc/pack-claude-env/commits/18dc0ee94c77c71664622008567308fba27b738a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-12T23:15:30Z","email":"93721212+esola-thomas@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ernesto Sola-Thomas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-12T23:15:30Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: v2 — installable Claude Code plugin + verified developer context (SDK, manifest, CLI, platform, dashboards) (#13)\n\n* chore(env): add plugin manifests, CI and validation scaffolding (WIP)\n\nAdds the Claude Code plugin + marketplace manifests, a structural/accuracy/\ninformation-boundary validator, a CLI seeding simulator, hook behaviour tests\nand the CI workflow that wires them together. Content refresh follows in\nsubsequent commits.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Xei3bnGRNiy8KkrBRrwoqz\n\n* feat(env): always-on core rule, plugin wiring, profiles, validators and public README (WIP)\n\n- claude/rules/00-huitzo-core.md: the single always-on context (detection, loop,\n  twelve rules, ctx services, where to get more context)\n- claude/CLAUDE.md: thin pointer that survives CLI overwrites\n- profiles: updated include/exclude sets for the v2 file layout\n- scripts: check_api_surface.py (asserts documented API facts against the\n  published packages), check_links.py, simulate_seed.py, test_hooks.sh\n- plugin manifest: hooks moved out of claude/, no plugin-level MCP server\n- README/CHANGELOG/CONTRIBUTING rewritten for the public repo; private links removed\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Xei3bnGRNiy8KkrBRrwoqz\n\n* feat(env): manifest reference, pack workflow skills and CLI reference verified against source\n\n- huitzo-manifest skill + pack-manifest rule: schema v2, policy card, the 14\n  permission tokens and their backing services, queues, pipelines, sync\n- add-command / draft-docs / validate-pack / test-pack / lint-and-fix prefer\n  the real CLI and drop stale manifest fields\n- pack-developer / pack-reviewer agents with frontmatter, tools and checklists\n- cli-non-interactive rewritten against the current CLI surface; sandbox and\n  publish skills refreshed\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Xei3bnGRNiy8KkrBRrwoqz\n\n* feat(env): huitzo-sdk reference and Python rules verified against huitzo-sdk 1.7.0\n\n- huitzo-sdk skill: exact @command signature, every ctx service, real error\n  hierarchy, demo mode, three testing patterns, anti-patterns\n- sdk-patterns / error-handling / testing rules rewritten with path scoping\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Xei3bnGRNiy8KkrBRrwoqz\n\n* docs(sdk-skill): mark the TimeoutError contrast as an anti-pattern line\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Xei3bnGRNiy8KkrBRrwoqz\n\n* feat(env): dashboard SDK reference, rules, skills and agents verified against 5.1.1\n\n- huitzo-dashboard-sdk skill: mount contract, HuitzoMountContext, all hooks\n  (polling status), Templates, exact tokens and hz-* primitives\n- hub-contract / react-patterns / dashboard-design / dashboard-manifest rules\n  rewritten with path scoping; hz-arch removed\n- scaffold/test/validate/dev/e2e dashboard skills refreshed\n- dashboard-developer / dashboard-reviewer agents with frontmatter\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Xei3bnGRNiy8KkrBRrwoqz\n\n* feat(env): platform and methodology references, docs/spec agents, constitution links\n\n- huitzo-platform skill: REST API, API keys and scopes, task polling, hosted\n  MCP endpoint and client configs, MCP inside packs, webhooks, secrets model\n- huitzo-methodology skill: deterministic-first design, four pillars, command\n  sizing, composition, testing pyramid, quality gates, learning path\n- draft-spec refreshed; docs-writer / spec-architect agents with frontmatter\n- CONSTITUTION.md: private link removed\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Xei3bnGRNiy8KkrBRrwoqz\n\n* docs: use the documented launcher install script and tap; skip authenticated API URLs in link check\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Xei3bnGRNiy8KkrBRrwoqz\n\n* feat(env): hooks, seed settings, huitzo-init skill and plugin hook wiring\n\n- claude/hooks: shared gate library, session-start context, blocking secrets\n  scan, non-blocking post-edit nudges, pre-stop summary, docs-mcp launcher\n  (local-first, uvx only on opt-in, exits 1 with a clear message without docs/)\n- hooks/hooks.json for the plugin channel; claude/settings.json for the seed\n  channel (hooks + permission allowlist, no mcpServers)\n- huitzo-init skill with managed-block templates for CLAUDE.md, AGENTS.md\n  and the pack-docs .mcp.json entry\n- repo-level contributor instructions moved to .claude/CLAUDE.md so strict\n  plugin validation passes; seed simulation expectations updated\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Xei3bnGRNiy8KkrBRrwoqz\n\n* fix(env): review round — hook precision, kill switch, validator rules, profile and README fixes\n\n- secrets-scan: allowlist matches absolute docs/*secret* paths, prose files skip\n  JWT/generic sk- shapes, HUITZO_SECRETS_SCAN=warn|off switch\n- post-edit: ruff reports only on failure; hex colour regex limited to 3/6/8 digits\n- docs-mcp: honest exit 1 outside a Huitzo project; session-start floor hint explains why\n- validator: reserved skill names, workflow skills must disable model invocation,\n  vendored legal script no longer exempt (its header no longer names internal docs)\n- check_api_surface: bare hz-form asserted\n- dashboard-only profile ships draft-docs; README aligns validation list, documents\n  the two docs servers, workspace trust and the scan switch\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Xei3bnGRNiy8KkrBRrwoqz\n\n* wip(huitzo-init): channel detection via substituted plugin placeholders (review BLK-1/IMP-6, in progress)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Xei3bnGRNiy8KkrBRrwoqz\n\n* fix(env): review round — content corrections verified against source\n\n- huitzo-init: channel detection via substituted ${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT} /\n  ${CLAUDE_SKILL_DIR}; copies docs-mcp.sh + _lib.sh in every channel and writes\n  the verified ./.claude/hooks/docs-mcp.sh entry\n- huitzo-platform / cli-non-interactive: drop non-existent `huitzo mcp` subcommands,\n  teach ctx.mcp discovery per the public docs, distinguish the two docs servers\n- traceability rule / validate-pack: headers are checked by hooks and grep, not the CLI\n- pack-developer: ctx.mcp is backed by mcp_servers + mcp:call, not services.mcp\n- error-handling: response_body is truncated, not redacted\n- add-command template braces; hz-form bare class; provider fetch order;\n  ctx.http parameter groups; visibility guidance; docs-writer fallback; rule wording\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Xei3bnGRNiy8KkrBRrwoqz\n\n* fix(env): re-review nits — MCP error wording, warn-mode message, prose-only docs allowlist, recursive header greps\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Xei3bnGRNiy8KkrBRrwoqz\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7ef9ac3b6a5d870e01cc9f8555f308439fb29636","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Huitzo-Inc/pack-claude-env/git/trees/7ef9ac3b6a5d870e01cc9f8555f308439fb29636"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Huitzo-Inc/pack-claude-env/git/commits/18dc0ee94c77c71664622008567308fba27b738a","verification":{"payload":"tree 7ef9ac3b6a5d870e01cc9f8555f308439fb29636\nparent d931eff316967845624a3147e90dac7a1e049391\nauthor Ernesto Sola-Thomas <93721212+esola-thomas@users.noreply.github.com> 1789254930 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789254930 -0400\n\nfeat: v2 — installable Claude Code plugin + verified developer context (SDK, manifest, CLI, platform, dashboards) (#13)\n\n* chore(env): add plugin manifests, CI and validation scaffolding (WIP)\n\nAdds the Claude Code plugin + marketplace manifests, a structural/accuracy/\ninformation-boundary validator, a CLI seeding simulator, hook behaviour tests\nand the CI workflow that wires them together. Content refresh follows in\nsubsequent commits.\n\nCo-Author