 and writes\n  the verified ./.claude/hooks/docs-mcp.sh entry\n- huitzo-platform / cli-non-interactive: drop non-existent `huitzo mcp` subcommands,\n  teach ctx.mcp discovery per the public docs, distinguish the two docs servers\n- traceability rule / validate-pack: headers are checked by hooks and grep, not the CLI\n- pack-developer: ctx.mcp is backed by mcp_servers + mcp:call, not services.mcp\n- error-handling: response_body is truncated, not redacted\n- add-command template braces; hz-form bare class; provider fetch order;\n  ctx.http parameter groups; visibility guidance; docs-writer fallback; rule wording\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Xei3bnGRNiy8KkrBRrwoqz\n\n* fix(env): re-review nits — MCP error wording, warn-mode message, prose-only docs allowlist, recursive header greps\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Xei3bnGRNiy8KkrBRrwoqz\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqpd0SCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAqL0QAKi87hU2ZiboxdVpdzLNy8o8\nK/UohmnB3q1whikieeBGVs/A7kF0JQoLeGF+ofLHG1HJZZxQiwDJuvP1IuBH99bF\n9uqqROovJXLC2z+LHCidZqX0DVlrccf2+FQIC8zQjo5Zd5CdefIHPEQwYaYIGi9J\nebYreFLaQHKPCZLEabBC9dtAgpp63JpGiX38MYbWTwhZDAIMvtLZSLy8UMTLM81Y\nw8zH5ECoyPQyPeTQaldqIbSm2hiUbVNJqQmWk6QByY/zW14QTxp8EoY2QG6CHv9n\nvpGTMDoLMx6nsXCgTayfXomgwyjw936WSK3Ufm8N6Jn+qckEoEDsAi629T2iRUjA\nrsySs/VviQXfrLWcXH6h55yvOGuwQgS6sNDQCerxxMrqrl/sEqpgJArSuGMdHONa\nFtY6JEtxZFvOAY0+awqI9DPca2OV8BXll1hAygAod6/m2KIT1ENjS+fYUoKKjqF8\n3qg8a/WhsO6uc04J5M2UDeZ0zb0Ku5eQ23EXArlbpJIQukdNvESCqdPZ6yBXq17g\npvLWV//lnfh76dIoB55Gm5SmTaRx7lezJ4eV4n7Wvt66M1xgZqE1PaVL2IIW+7pm\ndSHdBRb1AVCWg2h//vNfwZd6yuTb0PDd73h+4H7oSXlcGJmZQghy0wKJARWL4yeX\nXSzIU4P6z6Pvx4wfr8T9\n=jJ7F\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-12T23:15:31Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"