ate-dashboard, /test-dashboard, /dashboard-dev, /draft-spec\nNew profiles: pack-only, dashboard-only, full-stack\n\nCLAUDE.md rewritten under 200 lines covering both pack and dashboard workflows.\nCONSTITUTION.md gains §5 Display What Is True for dashboard data fidelity.\nExisting rules updated: testing (Vitest), documentation (component/page templates),\ntraceability (TypeScript @implements format), sdk-patterns (path-scoped).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"17458a0bc8d1c7b07fe6bd77b4d904cec076f1eb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Huitzo-Inc/pack-claude-env/git/trees/17458a0bc8d1c7b07fe6bd77b4d904cec076f1eb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Huitzo-Inc/pack-claude-env/git/commits/a2d2a674329d6ae8a0b48412ed7b05428716c0c2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Huitzo-Inc/pack-claude-env/commit/a2d2a674329d6ae8a0b48412ed7b05428716c0c2","node_id":"C_kwDORWgBlNoAKGEyZDJhNjc0MzI5ZDZhZThhMGI0ODQxMmVkN2IwNTQyODcxNmMwYzI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Huitzo-Inc/pack-claude-env/commit/3fe8bcc47a7870cb554c3473657e9a624e7eceb2","sha":"3fe8bcc47a7870cb554c3473657e9a624e7eceb2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Huitzo-Inc/pack-claude-env/commits/3fe8bcc47a7870cb554c3473657e9a624e7eceb2"}],"sha":"a2d2a674329d6ae8a0b48412ed7b05428716c0c2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Huitzo-Inc/pack-claude-env/commits/a2d2a674329d6ae8a0b48412ed7b05428716c0c2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/93721212?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/esola-thomas/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/esola-thomas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/esola-thomas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/esola-thomas/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/esola-thomas","id":93