ttps://api.github.com/users/platex-rehor-bot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/platex-rehor-bot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fleetshift/fleetshift-poc/commits/47d44463e242c5a14bd25639dd32fa70400bec00/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-09T08:00:36Z","email":"platform-experience-services@redhat.com","name":"Řehoř"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-09T08:00:36Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(addon): create-or-verify targets + Connect compensation (#181)\n\n* fix(addon): replace blind ErrAlreadyExists skip with create-or-verify\n\nOME-291\n\nconnectTargets silently continued when target creation returned\nErrAlreadyExists without verifying the existing target matched. A\nrestart with different target configuration left stale targets in\nplace.\n\n- Add VerifyTargetMatch to domain layer comparing semantic fields\n  (type, name, state, accepted manifest types, properties, labels)\n  while treating nil/empty as equivalent.\n- Add TargetService.RegisterOrVerify: tries atomic Register, on\n  ErrAlreadyExists verifies both the target row and its\n  registrar-derived inventory item (\"target:<id>\") exist and match.\n  Missing half or field drift is fatal (ErrInvalidArgument).\n- Add TargetService.Deregister for compensation cleanup.\n- Replace the blind continue in connectTargets with RegisterOrVerify.\n- Add Connect preflight: validate all schema inputs (ownership,\n  capabilities) before any mutation.\n- Add connectCompensation tracker: records type defs created, schemas\n  activated, agent registrations, and targets created during a single\n  Connect call. On failure, rollback undoes mutations in reverse\n  without deleting preexisting rows.\n- Close the partial-mutation TODO in Connect.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(targets): address review feedback on compensation and deregister\n\nOME-291\n- activateSchema: only record genuinely new activations for rollback;\n  pre-existing schema activations survive failed reconnect.\n- Deregister: tolerate ErrNotFound on target delete, matching the\n  existing inventory-delete behavior so orphaned inventory gets cleaned.\n- Remove unused callCount + empty Lock/Unlock (SA2001 lint fix).\n- Add TestVerifyTargetMatch_LabelsDrift for labels branch coverage.\n- Add TestAddonManager_ConnectDisconnectReconnectPreservesSchema.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* test(targets): consolidate duplicate Connect target tests\n\nOME-291\nRemove ConnectRegistersTargets (subsumed by ConnectTargetFreshAtomicCreation)\nand ConnectDuplicateTargetIsIdempotent (subsumed by\nConnectTargetExactRestartIdempotent). Add addon state assertion to\nConnectTargetFreshAtomicCreation to retain coverage from the removed test.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4e2d82983f8bcb82b3fe446e087407c8e2664cc0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fleetshift/fleetshift-poc/git/trees/4e2d82983f8bcb82b3fe446e087407c8e2664cc0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fleetshift/fleetshift-poc/git/commits/47d44463e242c5a14bd25639dd32fa70400bec00","verification":{"payload":"tree 4e2d82983f8bcb82b3fe446e087407c8e2664cc0\nparent c117b613e098a318f7503ab99b69847c4864ece3\nauthor Řehoř <platform-experience-services@redhat.com> 1788940836 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788940836 +0200\n\nfix(addon): create-or-verify targets + Connect compensation (#181)\n\n* fix(addon): replace blind ErrAlreadyExists skip with create-or-verify\n\nOME-291\n\nconnectTargets silently continued when target creation returned\nErrAlreadyExists without verifying the existing target matched. A\nrestart with different target configuration left stale targets in\nplace.\n\n- Add VerifyTargetMatch to domain layer comparing semantic fields\n  (type, name, state, accepted manifest types, properties, labels)\n  while treating nil/empty as equivalent.\n- Add TargetService.RegisterOrVerify: tries atomic Register, on\n  ErrAlreadyExists verifies both the target row and its\n  registrar-derived inventory item (\"target:<id>\") exist and match.\n  Missing half or field drift is fatal (ErrInvalidArgument).\n- Add TargetService.Deregister for compensation cleanup.\n- Replace the blind continue in connectTargets with RegisterOrVerify.\n- Add Connect preflight: validate all schema inputs (ownership,\n  capabilities) before any mutation.\n- Add connectCompensation tracker: records type defs created, schemas\n  activated, agent registrations, and targets created during a single\n  Connect call. On failure, rollback undoes mutations in reverse\n  without deleting preexisting rows.\n- Close the partial-mutation TODO in Connect.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(targets): address review feedback on compensation and deregister\n\nOME-291\n- activateSchema: only record genuinely new activations for rollback;\n  pre-existing schema activations survive failed reconnect.\n- Deregister: tolerate ErrNotFound on target delete, matching the\n  existing inventory-delete behavior so orphaned inventory gets cleaned.\n- Remove unused callCount + empty Lock/Unlock (SA2001 lint fix).\n- Add TestVerifyTargetMatch_LabelsDrift for labels branch coverage.\n- Add TestAddonManager_ConnectDisconnectReconnectPreservesSchema.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* test(targets): consolidate duplicate Connect target tests\n\nOME-291\nRemove ConnectRegistersTargets (subsumed by ConnectTargetFreshAtomicCreation)\nand ConnectDuplicateTargetIsIdempotent (subsumed by\nConnectTargetExactRestartIdempotent). Add addon state assertion to\nConnectTargetFreshAtomicCreation to retain coverage from the removed test.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqoRIkCRC1aQ7uu5