.github.com/repos/fleetshift/fleetshift-poc/commits/617bf823999dbaa0c278a4863b0a8b24c3da7d87/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-08T22:04:41Z","email":"97869221+mshort55@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Matthew Short"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-08T22:04:41Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"OME-329: Quiet AIO default logs and print a readiness-gated welcome (#180)\n\n* Quiet AIO default logs and print a readiness-gated welcome.\n\nLOG_LEVEL=error is the image default for FleetShift, Dex, and s6; e2e and GitHub Actions set debug. An aio-welcome oneshot waits for public /readyz before printing the sandbox URL and Dex credentials.\n\n* Stop pinning welcome-script poll duration in packaging tests.\n\n* Align AIO LOG_LEVEL trim with ResolveLogLevel and lock welcome curl --max-time.","tree":{"sha":"d3fb99cbbe08c832d336d3dc8b0d98e2f8e9a288","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fleetshift/fleetshift-poc/git/trees/d3fb99cbbe08c832d336d3dc8b0d98e2f8e9a288"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fleetshift/fleetshift-poc/git/commits/617bf823999dbaa0c278a4863b0a8b24c3da7d87","verification":{"payload":"tree d3fb99cbbe08c832d336d3dc8b0d98e2f8e9a288\nparent 0e045a9899a638e0151bb31686d526be0fd88ff8\nauthor Matthew Short <97869221+mshort55@users.noreply.github.com> 1788905081 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788905081 -0700\n\nOME-329: Quiet AIO default logs and print a readiness-gated welcome (#180)\n\n* Quiet AIO default logs and print a readiness-gated welcome.\n\nLOG_LEVEL=error is the image default for FleetShift, Dex, and s6; e2e and GitHub Actions set debug. An aio-welcome oneshot waits for public /readyz before printing the sandbox URL and Dex credentials.\n\n* Stop pinning welcome-script poll duration in packaging tests.\n\n* Align AIO LOG_LEVEL trim with ResolveLogLevel and lock welcome curl --max-time.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqoIZ5CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAACRcQAB