eply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"OME-302: Fix AIO empty CMD and simplify Nx image tags (#175)\n\n* fix: omit CMD [] from AIO image so OpenShift CI does not run /bin/sh -c null\n\nENTRYPOINT [\"/init\"] already clears inherited CMD; CMD [] is serialized as\nshell-form CMD null by OpenShift imagebuilder and the container exits 127.\n\n* Simplify Nx image targets to localhost tags and retag on push.\n\nBuild no longer loads .env or extra registry names; image:push retags to DEV_REGISTRY.\n\n* remove redundant pull=missing flag","tree":{"sha":"d318f76f1d000b015c64d5bd1a1b7c97efd88c3e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fleetshift/fleetshift-poc/git/trees/d318f76f1d000b015c64d5bd1a1b7c97efd88c3e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fleetshift/fleetshift-poc/git/commits/0bf9c70afa501da1a171d760c70866e3725a423c","verification":{"payload":"tree d318f76f1d000b015c64d5bd1a1b7c97efd88c3e\nparent 8bb5ba0f3fd361fddc6347282b0db0afa59fdcc4\nauthor Matthew Short <97869221+mshort55@users.noreply.github.com> 1788213715 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788213715 -0700\n\nOME-302: Fix AIO empty CMD and simplify Nx image tags (#175)\n\n* fix: omit CMD [] from AIO image so OpenShift CI does not run /bin/sh -c null\n\nENTRYPOINT [\"/init\"] already clears inherited CMD; CMD [] is serialized as\nshell-form CMD null by OpenShift imagebuilder and the container exits 127.\n\n* Simplify Nx image targets to localhost tags and retag on push.\n\nBuild no longer loads .env or extra registry names; image:push retags to DEV_REGISTRY.\n\n* remove redundant pull=missing flag","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqlfnTCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAKAQQAEM4c+XymCMMluICm/9YOl6n\nvaYdwsqOf33H5M4vmnywjSdOK3haVhQiIi6BqXrndGbhctDae72o5ZsFn9nfEPcG\n3g0juD6PxZgso/TUY1CnMm/wcE89wj5eTtTy8K1x2kZya/Wq0Kpnl8Rn5Zw07inq\nFY0mWE65a87dGZdXIVgRG0LkXFpIlU2bVZhKEwxdZ7518u4Vj1jLKKuytVrrGkbL\nsfv5mtBtl/TtrB6VfG7BPkw1GSMSIetBV1VYlAvO31QC5AdHMquWjly478r1K5Wa\nPms4/V//O+r5Q