vatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33311905?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sherine-k/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sherine-k/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sherine-k/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sherine-k/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sherine-k","id":33311905,"login":"sherine-k","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzMzExOTA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sherine-k/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sherine-k/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sherine-k/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sherine-k/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sherine-k/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sherine-k","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fleetshift/fleetshift-poc/commits/0ebb452ddcff36479139a6846f21aaf8d4477450/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-18T15:12:44Z","email":"skhoury@redhat.com","name":"sherine-k"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-31T15:47:03Z","email":"skhoury@redhat.com","name":"sherine-k"},"message":"feat(OME-288): scripted delivery add-on (--addons scripted)\n\nAdd the scripted delivery add-on at internal/addon/scripted/, registered\nwhen \"scripted\" is included in the --addons list (e.g. --addons\nkind,kubernetes,scripted). The add-on provides one resource type\n(scripted.fleetshift.io/ScriptedResource) whose spec declaratively\ncontrols delivery and removal behavior -- latency, outcomes, and\ninventory projection -- without an imperative control API.\n\nPackage structure:\n- descriptor.go: D31 fixed identifiers, embedded proto, Descriptor/Schema\n- scripted_resource_spec.proto: v1 schema with buf.validate annotations\n  (constant latency 0-300s, constant/sequence outcomes, inventory spec)\n- spec.go: Codec with cached descriptor + protovalidate validator,\n  strict protojson unmarshal, normalization to immutable Go structs\n- behavior.go: Operation/Phase/OutcomeValue types, LatencyDecider and\n  OutcomeDecider interfaces (ConstantLatency, ConstantOutcome,\n  SequenceOutcome with final-value repeat)\n- planner.go: narrow planning seam (AttemptKey -> PhaseDecision) with\n  atomic per-key cursors, exported for PR #114 stress adapter\n- agent.go: DeliveryAgent implementation with target/manifest validation,\n  spec decode, (deliveryID,UID,gen,op) arbitration, ack/completion\n  phases, async completion with inventory projection, cancellation-aware\n  close-gated lifecycle\n\nCross-cutting changes:\n- Add AddonScripted (\"scripted\") to known addon names\n- Add Close field to AddonSpec for shutdown hooks\n- Rename AddonDeps.IndexCtx to AppCtx (general application context)\n- Wire scripted add-on in assembleProductionAddons when enabled\n- enableAndConnectAddons returns close hooks; shutdown invokes them in\n  reverse order before workflow/persistence teardown\n\nTests:\n- Unit: descriptor identifiers, schema compilation, validate annotations,\n  planner sequences/reset/namespaces, spec codec decode/defaults/rejection,\n  agent deliver/remove/retry/latency/close/inventory\n- Integration: full managed-resource-creation through orchestration\n  workflow to scripted agent delivery with inventory projection,\n  including ack-failure retry exercising the platform retry machinery\n\nDeferred to separate subtasks:\n- OME-289: inventory retry with deterministic backoff\n- OME-290: startup recovery via ListActiveDeliveries\n- OME-291: fix connectTargets blind ErrAlreadyExists skip\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4 (Anthropic) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5ba3caf803d63df246724459491f93eecf54dab5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fleetshift/fleetshift-poc/git/trees/5ba3caf803d63df246724459491f93eecf54dab5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fleetshift/fleetshift-poc/git/commits/0ebb452ddcff36479139a6846f21aaf8d4477450","verification":{"payload":"tree 5ba3caf803d63df246724459491f93eecf54dab5\nparent 8bb5ba0f3fd361fddc6347282b0db0afa59fdcc4\nauthor sherine-k <skhoury@redhat.com> 1787065964 +0200\ncommitter sherine-k <skhoury@redhat.com> 1788191223 +0200\n\nfeat(OME-288): scripted delivery add-on (--addons scripted)\n\nAdd the scripted delivery add-on at internal/addon/scripted/, registered\nwhen \"scripted\" is included in the --addons list (e.g. --addons\nkind,kubernetes,scripted). The add-on provides one resource type\n(scripted.fleetshift.io/ScriptedResource) whose spec declaratively\ncontrols delivery and removal behavior -- latency, outcomes, and\ninventory projection -- without an imperative control API.\n\nPackage structure:\n- descriptor.go: D31 fixed identifiers, embedded proto, Descriptor/Schema\n- scripted_resource_spec.proto: v1 schema with buf.validate annotations\n  (constant latency 0-300s, constant/sequence outcomes, inventory spec)\n- spec.go: Codec with cached descriptor + protovalidate validator,\n  strict protojson unmarshal, normalization to immutable Go structs\n- behavior.go: Operation/Phase/OutcomeValue types, LatencyDecider and\n  OutcomeDecider interfaces (ConstantLatency, ConstantOutcome,\n  SequenceOutcome with final-value repeat)\n- planner.go: narrow planning seam (AttemptKey -> PhaseDecision) with\n  atomic per-key cursors, exported for PR #114 stress adapter\n- agent.go: DeliveryAgent implementation with target/manifest validation,\n  spec decode, (deliveryID,UID,gen,op) arbitration, ack/completion\n  phases, async completion with inventory projection, cancellation-aware\n  close-gated lifecycle\n\nCross-cutting changes:\n- Add AddonScripted (\"scripted\") to known addon names\n- Add Close field to AddonSpec for shutdown hooks\n- Rename AddonDeps.IndexCtx to AppCtx (general application context)\n- Wire scripted add-on in assembleProductionAddons when enabled\n- enableAndConnectAddons returns close hooks; shutdown invokes them in\n  reverse order before workflow/persistence teardown\n\nTests:\n- Unit: descriptor identifiers, schema compilation, validate annotations,\n  planner sequences/reset/namespaces, spec codec decode/defaults/rejection,\n  agent deliver/remove/retry/latency/close/inventory\n- Integration: full managed-resource-creation through orchestration\n  workflow to scripted agent delivery with inventory projection,\n  including ack-failure retry exercising the platform retry machinery\n\nDeferred to separate subtasks:\n- OME-289: inventory retry with deterministic backoff\n- OME-290: startup recovery via ListActiveDeliveries\n- OME-291: fix connectTargets blind ErrAlreadyExists skip\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4 (Anthropic) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgNpBiXcVzSLxB1KM19/UKn40J6U\nNkbI2pesh1zU4ggaQAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQBdkI9b1cDSNa/yY6V4doflzKmXFOcCEKLmYhkqbfsG4ajNEJayoTXTcRVrKbtIlzv\nWtHYZ7vyciWpBeguWrtgY=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-31T16:01:39Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33311905?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sherine-k/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sherine-k/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sherine-k/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sherine-k/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sherine-k","id":33311905,"login":"sherine-k","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzMzExOTA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sherine-k/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sherine-k/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sherine-k/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sherine-k/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"http