"2026-08-26T21:22:09Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"OME-256: split backend e2e scenarios and add testing guide (#172)\n\n* feat(e2e): assert resource query indexing in the Kind cluster lifecycle\n\n* feat(e2e): split backend scenarios and log long setup/teardown waits\n\nAdd shared Kind pool, fan-out, gateway, persona, and resource-query\nscenarios with testdox step names. Heartbeat AIO image builds and Kind\ncleanup on stderr so the suite does not look frozen. Move orchestration\nstress docs under docs/testing.\n\n* docs(e2e): add a guide for writing backend, UI, and CI tests\n\n* improved kindClusterPresent to check error type instead of assuming cluster did not exist on any error","tree":{"sha":"a7885b6f30aac8a44e6a0cf39165d70db92f5a6b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fleetshift/fleetshift-poc/git/trees/a7885b6f30aac8a44e6a0cf39165d70db92f5a6b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fleetshift/fleetshift-poc/git/commits/8bb5ba0f3fd361fddc6347282b0db0afa59fdcc4","verification":{"payload":"tree a7885b6f30aac8a44e6a0cf39165d70db92f5a6b\nparent de9cfa0340637eea6c2a14419d14b3ae9674d252\nauthor Matthew Short <97869221+mshort55@users.noreply.github.com> 1787779329 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787779329 -0700\n\nOME-256: split backend e2e scenarios and add testing guide (#172)\n\n* feat(e2e): assert resource query indexing in the Kind cluster lifecycle\n\n* feat(e2e): split backend scenarios and log long setup/teardown waits\n\nAdd shared Kind pool, fan-out, gateway, persona, and resource-query\nscenarios with testdox step names. Heartbeat AIO image builds and Kind\ncleanup on stderr so the suite does not look frozen. Move orchestration\nstress docs under docs/testing.\n\n* docs(e2e): add a guide for writing backend, UI, and CI tests\n\n* improved kindClusterPresent to check error type instead of assuming cluster did not exist on any error","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqj1kBCR