mshort55","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fleetshift/fleetshift-poc/commits/d8ea19a4be07ae08566140b5df7d31e359b5c7e4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-18T23:21:28Z","email":"97869221+mshort55@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Matthew Short"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-18T23:21:28Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"OME-292: fix(aio): do not send Dex UI scopes to external OIDC issuers (#167)\n\nKeycloak rejects audience:server:client_id:fleetshift with invalid_scope, which loops the SPA login. Dex-off now defaults to openid profile email.","tree":{"sha":"f8e5280bf068a99653a0e226c5bad84b6bd45ebe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fleetshift/fleetshift-poc/git/trees/f8e5280bf068a99653a0e226c5bad84b6bd45ebe"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fleetshift/fleetshift-poc/git/commits/d8ea19a4be07ae08566140b5df7d31e359b5c7e4","verification":{"payload":"tree f8e5280bf068a99653a0e226c5bad84b6bd45ebe\nparent 05ca459e9d663bf098fac0dfb1367d871273be65\nauthor Matthew Short <97869221+mshort55@users.noreply.github.com> 1787095288 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787095288 -0700\n\nOME-292: fix(aio): do not send Dex UI scopes to external OIDC issuers (#167)\n\nKeycloak rejects audience:server:client_id:fleetshift with invalid_scope, which loops the SPA login. Dex-off now defaults to openid profile email.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqhOj4CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAKAcQAFkF8snk1CopHsK21uj9OAVl\n7e00qwdD7Q0IBB/EkxyxvW7AV1ILVkD+I2mjeDO0NBKI5JBmLm3sKW7JEMRw3/+e\n5IdmeVrU5wiR3dt0x0cfcLBhrOe3gP1+EH5S13OY1JxKKUHDDrDQXCmKkB7wWhk4\nTmsh8D3UMbgFkK8qQUPkfUcewmSSzcVNgeD65WEIHooDrXy42cGwIfM55VOlUJ4d\nPemBcpJ50qKHPPsUceck2rf2hsPclR0Uf9HxW/RKH2S58FO16Tcmf9o0FYj8rBM1\n3n3HaGagwpEw5lWzdtiX3qGsbktR2kx40lH2RyNqn4rsccprwjBzhD8xK7eTPgF0\nXWcIS5Bs+rlCvtu8RqjBm/CvwnUUq/OqCtpuM7CcceNjHlaA0LaL4Ke17m2nBw84\nUc35QHA9WoLzJ5DzrPLI+DarSxyZ+bo3D25RraZrgnAOc+OFOL0YmV