hYzBkZmIxMzY3ZDg3MTI3M2JlNjU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/fleetshift/fleetshift-poc/commit/43e9f97f999d4903c94ee2644acfbe8bd8ea00a3","sha":"43e9f97f999d4903c94ee2644acfbe8bd8ea00a3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fleetshift/fleetshift-poc/commits/43e9f97f999d4903c94ee2644acfbe8bd8ea00a3"}],"sha":"05ca459e9d663bf098fac0dfb1367d871273be65","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fleetshift/fleetshift-poc/commits/05ca459e9d663bf098fac0dfb1367d871273be65"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/97869221?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mshort55/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mshort55/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mshort55/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mshort55/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mshort55","id":97869221,"login":"mshort55","node_id":"U_kgDOBdVdpQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mshort55/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mshort55/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mshort55/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mshort55/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mshort55/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mshort55","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fleetshift/fleetshift-poc/commits/43e9f97f999d4903c94ee2644acfbe8bd8ea00a3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-14T21:31:54Z","email":"97869221+mshort55@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Matthew Short"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-14T21:31:54Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"OME-253: AIO packaging and kind peer-Dex loopback forward (#162)\n\n* OME-253: Add bootstrap restart-skip and token middleware tests\n\nProve nonempty-store restart keeps persisted AuthMethod, and middleware\naccepts oidctest tokens while rejecting wrong aud/issuer/signature.\n\n* OME-253: Add AIO packaging and kind peer-Dex node route\n\nIntroduce the all-in-one image (aio-init, s6-overlay, Dex-on/off) and\nKIND_NODE_ROUTE_BACKEND DNAT so kind control-planes can reach peer Dex.\n\n* OME-253: Clarify AIO sandbox PKI naming and drop packaging CA pre-check\n\nRename sandbox PKI APIs for Dex-on clarity, fix macOS unix socket tests via short /tmp paths, and let fleetshift serve validate OIDC_CA_FILE.\n\n* OME-253: Let serve enforce OIDC invariants instead of aio-init\n\nApplyServeDefaults only fills packaging defaults and forwards argv; issuer/CA/registry rules stay in fleetshift serve.\n\n* OME-253: Harden AIO kind override, renderer timeout, and PKI key match\n\nRespect KIND_NODE_ROUTE_BACKEND overrides, bound RENDER_GCPHCP_CONFIG, and reject or regenerate mismatched sandbox CA/leaf key pairs.\n\n* OME-253: Harden AIO shell quoting, s6 finish modes, and bad-signature test\n\nAlways single-quote serve argv in exec-serve, chmod s6 finish scripts, and mutate decoded JWT signature bytes in the middleware test.\n\n* OME-253: Assert sandbox leaf cert reuse in EnsureSandboxPKI test\n\n* Use localhost/ tags in image:aio so Fedora Podman does not prompt for a registry.\n\n* Document Linux rootless Podman socket setup for AIO kind runs.\n\n* Replace kind loopback DNAT with a systemd TCP proxy to the fleetshift alias.\n\n* Rename kind node-route names to loopback forward.\n\nThe control-plane hook is a TCP proxy, not DNAT. Drop redundant --user 0:0 from kind launches.\n\n* Time out loopback-forward dials and replace the running helper via rename.\n\nHung dest dials were blocking OIDC discovery, and rewriting the active binary on re-ensure failed with ETXTBSY.","tree":{"sha":"5737ce933afe7d38df6d7a2efb1819d343629a9a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fleetshift/fleetshift-poc/git/trees/5737ce933afe7d38df6d7a2efb1819d343629a9a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fleetshift/fleetshift-poc/git/commits/43e9f97f999d4903c94ee2644acfbe8bd8ea00a3","verification":{"payload":"tree 5737ce933afe7d38df6d7a2efb1819d343629a9a\nparent 7ca01126b88d8f22b2aa11647c92f890aa409687\nauthor Matthew Short <97869221+mshort55@users.noreply.github.com> 1786743114 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1786743114 -0700\n\nOME-253: AIO packaging and kind peer-Dex loopback forward (#162)\n\n* OME-253: Add bootstrap restart-skip and token middleware tests\n\nProve nonempty-store restart keeps persisted AuthMethod, and middleware\naccepts oidctest tokens while rejecting wrong aud/issuer/signature.\n\n* OME-253: Add AIO packaging and kind peer-Dex node route\n\nIntroduce the all-in-one image (aio-init, s6-overlay, Dex-on/off) and\nKIND_NODE_ROUTE_BACKEND DNAT so kind control-planes can reach peer Dex.\n\n* OME-253: Clarify AIO sandbox PKI naming and drop packaging CA pre-check\n\nRename sandbox PKI APIs for Dex-on clarity, fix macOS unix socket tests via short /tmp paths, and let fleetshift serve validate OIDC_CA_FILE.\n\n* OME-253: Let serve enforce OIDC invariants instead of aio-init\n\nApplyServeDefaults only fills packaging defaults and forwards argv; issuer/CA/registry rules stay in fleetshift serve.\n\n* OME-253: Harden AIO kind override, renderer timeout, and PKI key match\n\nRespect KIND_NODE_ROUTE_BACKEND overrides, bound RENDER_GCPHCP_CONFIG, and reject or regenerate mismatched sandbox CA/leaf key pairs.\n\n* OME-253: Harden AIO shell quoting, s6 finish modes, and bad-signature test\n\nAlways single-quote serve argv in exec-serve, chmod s6 finish scripts, and mutate decoded JWT signature bytes in the middleware test.\n\n* OME-253: Assert sandbox leaf cert reuse in EnsureSandboxPKI test\n\n* Use localhost/ tags in image:aio so Fedora Podman does not prompt for a registry.\n\n* Document Linux rootless Podman socket setup for AIO kind runs.\n\n* Replace kind loopback DNAT with a systemd TCP proxy to the fleetshift alias.\n\n* Rename kind node-route names to loopback forward.\n\nThe control-plane hook is a TCP proxy, not DNAT. Drop redundant --user 0:0 from kind launches.\n\n* Time out loopback-forward dials and replace the running helper via rename.\n\nHung dest dials were blocking OIDC discovery, and rewriting the active binary on re-ensure failed with ETXTBSY.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqf4lLCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAuJkQAFrG2k9Mm6i7zis3HytW6b/8\ndeRm57kqG44fYEQaGhDDxVfHc0BpOutP705H8bP+1WeAwhPzB/7Rjmz8VhnTXbCw\nifyQPhmA1+DwgnPsnzNcQtshwubOqGetKjkOlSI0KwcPL8e9a9/ryOmaSRm9xVYt\nSviCqHa5srnyOaaHyZbQXietQK7I4rya0GvC//vNnmrcJmy4z2/aVeO23bUeuYBc\nRAnrmtiRh/CsPuYx9DJnHm5xJNZmZGHEYFT5+i09W9+mpmE6ZFsQYLADsnjaqg24\nBgyl5KQF3potz5/aLMmdGb5k7wRY1xTI9kgmq5yOVaa4zlwdPvd4lYkJEjdgWvnX\niOFhsmTOODqd99vmP+znZsR/HpqCRh0JN21pCMwiJ5WXRnsJJLOpwQwMYT/Sel0a\nx4E51cTjv4/fAWlaUyfYG1vjwlbAnV3WIyiBvDSvo0bIkE9CTe9eqZMa0AzR39+5\niWHBUpyI1taEAviTaf1/k+EV8nvo4XZrRVgZU1JSSnZFHZgrIb2JBRGuJ0NO6HK1\nDdoitlG3KR+Bx0c/bYfWHYPLo+jMFH0igbSmMD0U2Rl8fuqObQIxyCKZOgWhM/Vi\nAlzwF1qY/RDiubBS0GH4ppHBRlrPxIrn8H14Bmrnt9rI4SnxFonnKydVV8ih7zd1\nPNO7LojpOL8V2bOdNHL4\n=CqHj\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-14T21:31:55Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/fleetshift/fleetshift-poc/commit/43e9f97f999d4903c94ee2644acfbe8bd8ea00a3","node_id":"C_kwDORXFOSdoAKDQzZTlmOTdmOTk5ZDQ5MDNjOTRlZTI2NDRhY2ZiZThiZDhlYTAwYTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/fleetshift/fleetshift-poc/commit/7ca01126b88d8f22b2aa11647c92f890aa409687","sha":"7ca01126b88d8f22b2aa11647c92f890aa409687","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fleetshift/fleetshift-poc/commits/7ca01126b88d8f22b2aa11647c92f890aa409687"}],"sha":"43e9f97f999d4903c94ee2644acfbe8bd8ea00a3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fleetshift/fleetshift-poc/commits/43e9f97f999d4903c94ee2644acfbe8bd8ea00a3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3496559?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alechenninger/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alechenninger/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alechenninger/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alechenninger/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alechenninger","id":3496559,"login":"alechenninger","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0OTY1NTk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alechenninger/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alechenninger/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alechenninger/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alechenninger/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alechenninger/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alechenninger","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fleetshift/fleetshift-poc/commits/7ca01126b88d8f22b2aa11647c92f890aa409687/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-13T17:12:29Z","email":"ahenning@redhat.com","name":"Alec Henninger"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-13T17:12:29Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"docs: initial platform IdP bootstrap design (#151)\n\n* docs: capture initial platform IdP bootstrap design\n\nRecord the agreed model: first IdP from runtime authority before the public API opens, sandbox as packaging over that path, and later IdP changes through the authenticated API.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* Clarify some aspects of IdP bootstrap\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"74e2d79bd9b291d7dfa68229676e17bf10ad8967","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fleetshift/fleetshift-poc/git/trees/74e2d79bd9b291d7dfa68229676e17bf10ad8967"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fleetshift/fleetshift-poc/git/commits/7ca01126b88d8f22b2aa11647c92f890aa409687","verification":{"payload":"tree 74e2d79bd9b291d7dfa68229676e17bf10ad8967\nparent 51ec0ce43899b1cd11ba4e5bc1d7dcb7f3f2f066\nauthor Alec Henninger <ahenning@redhat.com> 1786641149 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1786641149 -0700\n\ndocs: initial platform IdP bootstrap design (#151)\n\n* docs: capture initial platform IdP bootstrap design\n\nRecord the agreed model: first IdP from runtime authority before the public API opens, sandbox as packaging over that path, and later IdP changes through the authenticated API.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* Clarify some aspects of IdP bootstrap\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqffr9CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAGocQAGVMvfLG3G2QXH29kCiYdOqS\nwl3RWiSLuu6pvZ87Xwj0jcGKiH78E9TJd4UyvCXt06DPSk/WEob4t+9fJRoMZMHT\ngzm7Z5YvxQxs8BytlZamLCWKnknqrpZr85LPAIanvhHPFXRn4NV50roXCuJ2Udo5\n5f5mM8qr42hRP/5TWi5iEYdXDsG5d1UTR6K9HCNy2Rglxov+2aD2cUHM0NAHWsqy\nuOum6IFyMb3RGirpPIxLIp7nUR4v9VhXv2cEDPR79z9ZLG2irVBHml5n2KmbFcFZ\nkUhmkuI9WR1Y4gw+45mX6jDoBJ1ZdySfdunN8Ba4pIE9g