":"https://api.github.com/users/Hyperkid123/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hyperkid123/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hyperkid123/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Hyperkid123","id":22619452,"login":"Hyperkid123","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNjE5NDUy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hyperkid123/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hyperkid123/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hyperkid123/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hyperkid123/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hyperkid123/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hyperkid123","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fleetshift/fleetshift-poc/commits/badc17acdacedab613004b27440d8ed108a795c6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-13T14:41:43Z","email":"marvusm.mmi@gmail.com","name":"Martin Marosi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-13T14:41:43Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"chore(nx-cache): add nx proxy cert (#161)\n\n* chore(nx-cache): add nx proxy cert\n\n* fix(nx-cache): use externalCertificate so route cert auto-renews\n\nCopying the issued cert into spec.tls froze it at deploy time, so\ncert-manager renewals never reached the Route and the proxy would\neventually serve an expired cert. Reference the Secret via\nspec.tls.externalCertificate instead: the router reads it directly and\npicks up renewals automatically. Grant the openshift-ingress router\nserviceaccount scoped read access to just that Secret (mirrors the\nexisting grpc-route-cert pattern). Drops the python3 dependency.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ed03b62ded1dc09a66d8837a9e26643c19932074","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fleetshift/fleetshift-poc/git/trees/ed03b62ded1dc09a66d8837a9e26643c19932074"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fleetshift/fleetshift-poc/git/commits/badc17acdacedab613004b27440d8ed108a795c6","verification":{"payload":"tree ed03b62ded1dc09a66d8837a9e26643c19932074\nparent 4b319999a0bcd4f203c30ef18e67efe87876ccfe\nauthor Martin Marosi <marvusm.mmi@gmail.com> 1786632103 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1786632103 +0200\n\nchore(nx-cache): add nx proxy cert (#161)\n\n* chore(nx-cache): add nx proxy cert\n\n* fix(nx-cache): use externalCertificate so route cert auto-renews\n\nCopying the issued cert into spec.tls froze it at deploy time, so\ncert-manager renewals never reached the Route and the proxy would\neventually serve an expired cert. Reference the Secret via\nspec.tls.externalCertificate instead: the router reads it directly and\npicks up renewals automatically. Grant the openshift-ingress router\nserviceaccount scoped read access to just that Secret (mirrors the\nexisting grpc-route-cert pattern). Drops the python3 dependency.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqfdenCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAfaAQAESbT1YuJaTGGwPMQw/Q2gza\nh8NkBo4IS/hdP+O/DhUDHEY+TW5kYK6MrdA1dbNdOWzeA48dw1MPMNxJhvq/ghh4\nZuORB3SV9tgqcLKR3iKAaqm+A1/YkT/id5mJY8EnB/Gs0tGrjtoklQiEt6QhYgV7\nNDIzyjp7AuNyCVqvegG2V6ENOsDKi5OVc3KTfRRxmwrGYnSdCQp98EkgimMPso19\nW3w/hoD9AhR15R4w/jCoBC6SFIK3oqfYyhtshjWdyC38ghfkg0ijOA+hj/ra5y81\novXblmIP2fiZ3c0hxlnpUXJYiSfVXXIhaxOyTL492E/ruDOGV57JSQRrT8zqVclk\ngkyJ2/Jr3ZYi6yWg6VMWrRm0AWSC1H3hnIG3sOHLslv/QmzOCSDV73eIbAzRoEUm\npabRWlb8f9zPqKy41BNNAXSXJpqjdBGPUomdCpbiAaoGlRw7kdWb1O4nDEVP+QNb\nIz+6yoics3ragbtcck1ID5orPp2oeJsox+Ii2NXi+OTzJ4wNMwORuoPnVuRidfOe\nMPpJzy3zjAwhaRXzWsD5e5TXwFOzXBGMkvs6/rXF9HjjjOignD+RcFghIZ+d7HOq\nMVZgNh9bX+twizx68A/HZFHF1JobullnqF3ycYr4X5RFi9bmrU3XHbBi//dfY9UC\nbGJSkm6r9A9XaRkCmYP3\n=DzWJ\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-13T14:41:46Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/fleetshift/fleetshift-poc/commit/badc17acdacedab613004b27440d8ed108a795c6","node_id":"C_kwDORXFOSdoAKGJhZGMxN2FjZGFjZWRhYjYxMzAwNGIyNzQ0MGQ4ZWQxMDhhNzk1YzY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/fleetshift/fleetshift-poc/commit/4b319999a0bcd4f203c30ef18e67efe87876ccfe","sha":"4b319999a0bcd4f203c30ef18e67efe87876ccfe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fleetshift/fleetshift-poc/commits/4b319999a0bcd4f203c30ef18e67efe87876ccfe"}],"sha":"badc17acdacedab613004b27440d8ed108a795c6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fleetshift/fleetshift-poc/commits/badc17acdacedab613004b27440d8ed108a795c6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33311905?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sherine-k/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sherine-k/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sherine-k/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sherine-k/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sherine-k","id":33311905,"login":"sherine-k","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzMzExOTA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sherine-k/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sherine-k/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sherine-k/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sherine-k/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sherine-k/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sherine-k","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fleetshift/fleetshift-poc/commits/4b319999a0bcd4f203c30ef18e67efe87876ccfe/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-13T14:06:55Z","email":"skhoury@redhat.com","name":"Sherine Khoury"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-13T14:06:55Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"OME-284: fix: add SELinux :z flag to podman bind-mount volumes (#155)\n\nOn Fedora CSB (and other SELinux-enforcing systems), podman bind mounts\ninherit the host file''s SELinux context. Without an explicit relabel\nflag, the container''s confined domain cannot read the mounted files.\n\nAppend :z (shared relabel) to all project-local bind mounts in\nlocal-keycloak.yaml and local-web.yaml. System-wide paths (/tmp,\npodman socket) and named volumes are intentionally left unchanged.","tree":{"sha":"e5a07e2864cc92d1cecfa9a1e1405ad34dc32132","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fleetshift/fleetshift-poc/git/trees/e5a07e2864cc92d1cecfa9a1e1405ad34dc32132"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fleetshift/fleetshift-poc/git/commits/4b319999a0bcd4f203c30ef18e67efe87876ccfe","verification":{"payload":"tree e5a07e2864cc92d1cecfa9a1e1405ad34dc32132\nparent 1ae719977d35c81b859b9b15f26f9cba720f3513\nauthor Sherine Khoury <skhoury@redhat.com> 1786630015 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1786630015 +0200\n\nOME-284: fix: add SELinux :z flag to podman bind-mount volumes (#155)\n\nOn Fedora CSB (and other SELinux-enforcing systems), podman bind mounts\ninherit the host file''s SELinux context. Without an explicit relabel\nflag, the container''s confined domain cannot read the mounted files.\n\nAppend :z (shared relabel) to all project-local bind mounts in\nlocal-keycloak.yaml and local-web.yaml. System-wide paths (/tmp,\npodman socket) and named volumes are intentionally left unchanged.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqfc9/CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAZXMQAKjg23MixCtBZ4ORHp2Yv3/x\naOv8DLnLtUZQ+U/lhYj+NlUDYVsn3b2VdJ+UAI6n+PO1kWJ3JLv9XMOlFlrokY1B\n+TnqzBKFAKSJHbjgyeqk3nQFpQNfqC0gCsfQiXQK3G+EeJaxiwh+e0NY2zt2bGej\n9r0UXiuQe87CGRI0qgQtQftNZeUsnqzuWWBX65YmcxZHv1ATxA2bIPjDffQ1vlJi\ng2I34OhY7Ed5knbF4kBOqfs8WXQaK3HcnITeCpU4Q2YiYiGI7bGc+3r18Q+2EWqV\nZZB6Trox81yIQg7GsuAd5DxEUe6cy63O534jhGxorihSvhSJTMwAh1RUVM8Py+p+\nGrctJMU0LcAFvd/hDzpjA1WWPGL5pXtfXg8YmgS+XTyC2scBWPJS0xvYPz6Iui9Y\nZVdg6krZafZoN7oVd2B9x2bF2LON6ml83P+a5Us6EGad7uL5mdP/jmDIKAsUv2px\nr8pEtg2tVDSJXgbH5tR75f55kFn1xrZdwowRRr8DCcp6j464FAugaY76+/VtpIzv\nyAwZ0OGWFQvCw3Rj4gdJjBzN0KtS63fHsa2SYRH6IXQlGniFzAWKg1k07PPDYC/x\nFyO4ZaNrYTfvwf6wJw+6DH3N7U/ITW1mu12QZ98cMjqitwaY3Un2Z9L5XbCArLNF\nPScMFI08WXuZlDinFNes\n=R7Wg\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-13T14:06:57Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.git