gs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alechenninger/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alechenninger/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alechenninger/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alechenninger/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alechenninger","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fleetshift/fleetshift-poc/commits/f77f5e557fce8da1afeb2c7e34f1064d717da695/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-24T13:59:21Z","email":"ahenning@redhat.com","name":"Alec Henninger"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-24T13:59:21Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"OME-214: Fail managed-resource delete clearly when instance has no managed state (#137)\n\n* OME-214: Reject delete of inventory-only extension resources up front\n\nFail Delete before starting the durable workflow when the instance has\nno managed state, matching Resume and avoiding endless mr-mutate-to-deleting retries.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* OME-214: Use memworkflow harness in delete preflight tests\n\nDrop custom workflow stubs; exercise Delete against sqlite + memworkflow\nlike the other application tests.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* OME-214: Seed inventory-only cluster via inventory report path\n\nCreate the undeletable kind Cluster fixture through\nInventoryReporterAdapter.ApplyDeltaBatch, matching how the kind watcher\nproduces inventory-only rows after a Deployment delivery.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* OME-214: Frame delete preflight as a managed+inventory pattern\n\nDrop kind-specific fixture and comments; the same inventory-only row\ncan appear for any addon that manages and reports the same type when\ncreation went through a Deployment instead.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* OME-214: Call InventoryReportService directly from delete preflight tests\n\nDrop the reporter adapter indirection; the harness owns the report\nservice and seeds inventory-only rows through ApplyDeltaBatch.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* OME-214: Bound delete preflight regression test context\n\nFail promptly if a leaked delete workflow path hangs instead of stalling CI.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"cd1f055e58502b011efbc32f0b72d9074addcb5b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fleetshift/fleetshift-poc/git/trees/cd1f055e58502b011efbc32f0b72d9074addcb5b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fleetshift/fleetshift-poc/git/commits/f77f5e557fce8da1afeb2c7e34f1064d717da695","verification":{"payload":"tree cd1f055e58502b011efbc32f0b72d9074addcb5b\nparent ff0745bd2ae64b5fc459756bce215b50140f6a67\nauthor Alec Henninger <ahenning@redhat.com> 1784901561 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784901561 -0400\n\nOME-214: Fail managed-resource delete clearly when instance has no managed state (#137)\n\n* OME-214: Reject delete of inventory-only extension resources up front\n\nFail Delete before starting the durable workflow when the instance has\nno managed state, matching Resume and avoiding endless mr-mutate-to-deleting retries.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* OME-214: Use memworkflow harness in delete preflight tests\n\nDrop custom workflow stubs; exercise Delete against sqlite + memworkflow\nlike the other application tests.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* OME-214: Seed inventory-only cluster via inventory report path\n\nCreate the undeletable kind Cluster fixture through\nInventoryReporterAdapter.ApplyDeltaBatch, matching how the kind watcher\nproduces inventory-only rows after a Deployment delivery.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* OME-214: Frame delete preflight as a managed+inventory pattern\n\nDrop kind-specific fixture and comments; the same inventory-only row\ncan appear for any addon that manages and reports the same type when\ncreation went through a Deployment instead.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* OME-214: Call InventoryReportService directly from delete preflight tests\n\nDrop the reporter adapter indirection; the harness owns the report\nservice and seeds inventory-only rows through ApplyDeltaBatch.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* OME-214: Bound delete preflight regression test context\n\nFail promptly if a leaked delete workflow path hangs instead of stalling CI.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqY2+5CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAACtEQADjUQ6ssI0KN6UzEV8zUCroQ\n+qx9sxcQx8SC6CrNDJdzqBuR73vmF6oRrHG/39gKHotY/6y540NP8jOTfS46JtxZ\nRxFunbB+y1qTJoBvOd11y5GvnTebvTp1mtGfMZmL+OXAai+GM6FRUOtFTAgbQibF\n/voj21LosjkCoMkSDE7BpnXCfDB/cREzvqWxxEPaM+z20S9bP8G7fXF+Q01mFoMv\nVq40QxO3sePstojfA/IypMUtA9hThGHMHwlv8ozsg0P4yfh7jvMJuSujklbwk0hE\nCVOGBGew3MBeh/MXQ83Q5bkk2wOD4wiCsRtX3Gjxv/miKKEI3QReLrAqgPXBHkqh\nm28cxwPQR0NbsirvOob3eHXQmHmVkek1fXPjPqGOwpkXE8bWNpBbWA5bDan9nz94\nRX7swIEiSbVrTmpM8dq1YxQ11og/iJB48uz1xzwvksCknTHb86KV1ZYLE2i5S01F\n0iQuOgl4J1ANfRX/p27jBTvG77AdsV3YhOvveFD9MhzDsEejL2HkkSXTi6mtTCRC\n50ijdIEfDt0DSJAYwVX0jKQU1MLT24jT83t4qAXjB07kl0FmuF/WfOpnaRT5NIOl\nOr4bUOqpxCMnqbzehN2cSS22kmgDr0x0ATjidEu4kAG2f9S4Mgv0Agape51ydeGs\nbAu8zaF8biGJfEJchjZH\n=yRQx\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-24T13:59:22Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.g