nwithout reaching the RESULTS section below.\n\nAlso adds:\n- String method suggestions (.startsWith, .endsWith, .contains) on leaf fields\n- has() macro autocomplete with auto-close in field context\n- Reversed `in` filtering (only container/branch fields suggested)\n- Match field highlighting in search results\n- Keyboard hints bar with conditional ←→ operators hint\n- Comprehensive Playwright CT tests for all keyboard behaviors\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"03bd06179a9fe0762cac456a36995b4c04366175","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fleetshift/fleetshift-poc/git/trees/03bd06179a9fe0762cac456a36995b4c04366175"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fleetshift/fleetshift-poc/git/commits/2edfaac6c598aaf9b3cd50905e9098838430a3b0","verification":{"payload":"tree 03bd06179a9fe0762cac456a36995b4c04366175\nparent 83b693f42db9a2252f2b11266dfff403809caa5e\nauthor Martin Marosi <marvusm.mmi@gmail.com> 1784810873 +0200\ncommitter Martin Marosi <marvusm.mmi@gmail.com> 1784810873 +0200\n\nfeat(search): keyboard navigation across menu groups, string methods, has(), match highlighting\n\nArrow keys now navigate through suggestions, history, AND search results\nseamlessly. Previously ArrowDown would wrap at the suggestion/value boundary\nwithout reaching the RESULTS section below.\n\nAlso adds:\n- String method suggestions (.startsWith, .endsWith, .contains) on leaf fields\n- has() macro autocomplete with auto-close in field context\n- Reversed `in` filtering (only container/branch fields suggested)\n- Match field highlighting in search results\n- Keyboard hints bar with conditional ←→ operators hint\n- Comprehensive Playwright CT tests for all keyboard behaviors\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niHQEABYKAB0WIQSrWw0pRankAm4CMYLQZ6UySYE0+gUCamINfwAKCRDQZ6UySYE0\n+meYAPdWsaee2lJrjtkT61ML005dAMXQ/eX1SIFKrs51gAIIAP4rloEcW9RKP+ag\nc6SjtMF0J6o08nZZVU71R