11266dfff403809caa5e","node_id":"C_kwDORXFOSdoAKDgzYjY5M2Y0MmRiOWEyMjUyZjJiMTEyNjZkZmZmNDAzODA5Y2FhNWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/fleetshift/fleetshift-poc/commit/a3ad9d14160e78d012d2aacdb3f6517e5e37a53e","sha":"a3ad9d14160e78d012d2aacdb3f6517e5e37a53e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fleetshift/fleetshift-poc/commits/a3ad9d14160e78d012d2aacdb3f6517e5e37a53e"}],"sha":"83b693f42db9a2252f2b11266dfff403809caa5e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fleetshift/fleetshift-poc/commits/83b693f42db9a2252f2b11266dfff403809caa5e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/97869221?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mshort55/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mshort55/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mshort55/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mshort55/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mshort55","id":97869221,"login":"mshort55","node_id":"U_kgDOBdVdpQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mshort55/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mshort55/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mshort55/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mshort55/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mshort55/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mshort55","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fleetshift/fleetshift-poc/commits/ff0745bd2ae64b5fc459756bce215b50140f6a67/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-21T22:19:40Z","email":"97869221+mshort55@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Matthew Short"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-21T22:19:40Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"OME-215: Name kubernetes inventory objects with namespace ancestry and versionless GR keys (#138)\n\n* pulled kubernetes addon docs from old branch\n\n* Align kubernetes addon docs with current indexing runtime and harden e2e wait.\n\nUpdate the addon design docs/diagrams for in-process indexing, and wait\nfor Deployment/ReplicaSet status fields before asserting enriched inventory.\n\n* Name kubernetes inventory objects with namespace ancestry and versionless GR keys.\n\nBind discovery ObjectScope through informers/writer, introduce ScopeNamespace for the joint scope/namespace invariant, and retain acknowledged ResourceNames so deletes target the exact inventory path.\n\n* Clarify kubernetes inventory naming and scope comments.\n\nDocument ScopeNamespace/discovery-bound scope accurately, correct schema-vs-watch wording, and fill missing godoc on touched symbols.\n\n* Rename ReportedUIDs to ReportedNames for UID-to-ResourceName maps.\n\nMatch field names to map[string]ResourceName values; rename pendingResync.currentUIDs to currentNames the same way.\n\n* Add regression tests for inventory naming scope and path invariants.\n\nCover scope/namespace mismatches, delete ReportedNames fallback, discovery cluster scope, informer Scope propagation, collection shapes, GR key rejects, versionless keys, and namespace encoding.\n\n* Remove duplicate docs\n\n* Pass discovery ObjectScope explicitly in inventory test helpers.","tree":{"sha":"727c229b262e35917508343eb9a58225a4e2d848","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fleetshift/fleetshift-poc/git/trees/727c229b262e35917508343eb9a58225a4e2d848"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fleetshift/fleetshift-poc/git/commits/ff0745bd2ae64b5fc459756bce215b50140f6a67","verification":{"payload":"tree 727c229b262e35917508343eb9a58225a4e2d848\nparent 853155997e215288a390937e7949bc78f5e1cafe\nauthor Matthew Short <97869221+mshort55@users.noreply.github.com> 1784672380 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784672380 -0700\n\nOME-215: Name kubernetes inventory objects with namespace ancestry and versionless GR keys (#138)\n\n* pulled kubernetes addon docs from old branch\n\n* Align kubernetes addon docs with current indexing runtime and harden e2e wait.\n\nUpdate the addon design docs/diagrams for in-process indexing, and wait\nfor Deployment/ReplicaSet status fields before asserting enriched inventory.\n\n* Name kubernetes inventory objects with namespace ancestry and versionless GR keys.\n\nBind discovery ObjectScope through informers/writer, introduce ScopeNamespace for the joint scope/namespace invariant, and retain acknowledged ResourceNames so deletes target the exact inventory path.\n\n* Clarify kubernetes inventory naming and scope comments.\n\nDocument ScopeNamespace/discovery-bound scope accurately, correct schema-vs-watch wording, and fill missing godoc on touched symbols.\n\n* Rename ReportedUIDs to ReportedNames for UID-to-ResourceName maps.\n\nMatch field names to map[string]ResourceName values; rename pendingResync.currentUIDs to currentNames the same way.\n\n* Add regression tests for inventory naming scope and path invariants.\n\nCover scope/namespace mismatches, delete ReportedNames fallback, discovery cluster scope, informer Scope propagation, collection shapes, GR key rejects, versionless keys, and namespace encoding.\n\n* Remove duplicate docs\n\n* Pass discovery ObjectScope explicitly in inventory test helpers.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqX/B8CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAGC4QAI+6Rj3OUdcwdaLWoxG633Pc\nmMwk1uDBuC4UItQNW9YpLbWU2/MKLh+xpRZorUMmb202DwkRv+crbTtPhoESHNRx\nWxMOXD6JvtIkhAcBqHI6G0+srptRhkaVcWdXluLnKvqxPRGuZCFS/NJ1mNOu/wiQ\n2ownk7kkSHF2892Cwp7KgJWr+o+rFlDuTWEoXYmcb3TJF59buBD8Xf9qvlXuTUam\nqHE245wyVtHL7ZMs4QKWq2E1XIHUfh2VPQNmA4fV9RcBuP63FJ8G/hFuwM+c3dE4\nXIjuEFjh3I4eS30jrozQnbavxvNrpxsgfl+61up4IBsySzXC3ZsBonUWwHmoXThw\nzMr/zvQT2payR1WAnu2V7dUeGvRoPcdLHtDJGTT9tqm/YtLKaxO5HRFKbA9CIwT9\nYqMIrOnIq9m/91jVFA2lczNicV9Bta6S+9Z2qJg9Lgybn43UP06lm0XG5C2E5lDg\nyKZhk7hfwINgEBz18RPD+kd0x/vL8hdl5jSFDQIpfVx8w2lgdjewK3/Qmg/DXRte\nuhKdpvvTDzMMSzrPqNj8WGXWgvJ6++qby/RmLzFwnvDB5Y9h8shn0KBf1cPa