 <platform-experience-services@redhat.com> 1784660684 +0000\n\nfix(kind-plugin): use non-optional type for networking variable\n\nOME-213\nUse KindNetworkingSpec instead of KindClusterSpec[\"networking\"] to\navoid including undefined in the type, satisfying strict TypeScript.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niHUEABYKAB0WIQSoG2zhRLubAWkKO1EKIuJ/MUEv7gUCal/CzAAKCRAKIuJ/MUEv\n7m0qAQDWHUN8XNvp0Iw9+oXmVY0CrKoh3nC7VPCgWOthQuR5QQEAuq5AQRRf1WMy\nJ251vOTTl+aQ919KyDDKC/QB/Pi39gw=\n=Jx4G\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-24T18:02:07Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/273054389?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/platex-rehor-bot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/platex-rehor-bot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/platex-rehor-bot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/platex-rehor-bot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/platex-rehor-bot","id":273054389,"login":"platex-rehor-bot","node_id":"U_kgDOEEZ6tQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/platex-rehor-bot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/platex-rehor-bot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/platex-rehor-bot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/platex-rehor-bot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/platex-rehor-bot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/platex-rehor-bot","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/fleetshift/fleetshift-poc/commit/d179246600d37868567d0d7a41dbc276a7ef46d4","node_id":"C_kwDORXFOSdoAKGQxNzkyNDY2MDBkMzc4Njg1NjdkMGQ3YTQxZGJjMjc2YTdlZjQ2ZDQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/fleetshift/fleetshift-poc/commit/abb231fd7da90c478a2ed1ec6fe306bdc90bcaf3","sha":"abb231fd7da90c478a2ed1ec6fe306bdc90bcaf3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fleetshift/fleetshift-poc/commits/abb231fd7da90c478a2ed1ec6fe306bdc90bcaf3"}],"sha":"d179246600d37868567d0d7a41dbc276a7ef46d4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fleetshift/fleetshift-poc/commits/d179246600d37868567d0d7a41dbc276a7ef46d4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/273054389?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/platex-rehor-bot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/platex-rehor-bot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/platex-rehor-bot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/platex-rehor-bot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/platex-rehor-bot","id":273054389,"login":"platex-rehor-bot","node_id":"U_kgDOEEZ6tQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/platex-rehor-bot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/platex-rehor-bot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/platex-rehor-bot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/platex-rehor-bot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/platex-rehor-bot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/platex-rehor-bot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fleetshift/fleetshift-poc/commits/abb231fd7da90c478a2ed1ec6fe306bdc90bcaf3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-21T18:57:09Z","email":"platform-experience-services@redhat.com","name":"platex-rehor-bot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-21T18:57:09Z","email":"platform-experience-services@redhat.com","name":"platex-rehor-bot"},"message":"fix(kind-plugin): use managed resource API for cluster creation\n\nOME-213\nSwitch kind cluster creation from deployment API (POST /v1/deployments)\nto the kind managed resource API (POST /apis/kind.fleetshift.io/v1/clusters),\nmatching the pattern used by GCP HCP. This aligns create and delete paths\nso clusters can be deleted without \"has no managed state\" errors.\n\n- Add kind-plugin/api.ts with createKindCluster using createApiClient\n- Remove deployment envelope signing (deployment-specific, not applicable\n  to managed resource path)\n- Remove SettingsStep wizard step (contained only signing toggle and\n  static placement note, both deployment-specific)\n- Remove \"Signed\" and \"Placement\" from ReviewStep\n- Add unit tests for the new API client\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"479937ecc5fc01b185658262ed457f5b29dda635","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fleetshift/fleetshift-poc/git/trees/479937ecc5fc01b185658262ed457f5b29dda635"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fleetshift/fleetshift-poc/git/commits/abb231fd7da90c478a2ed1ec6fe306bdc90bcaf3","verification":{"payload":"tree 479937ecc5fc01b185658262ed457f5b29dda635\nparent 4de287196d26e4e7afcac7820506276ccdf98cc0\nauthor platex-rehor-bot <platform-experience-services@redhat.com> 1784660229 +0000\ncommitter platex-rehor-bot <platform-experience-services@redhat.com> 1784660229 +0000\n\nfix(kind-plugin): use managed resource API for cluster creation\n\nOME-213\nSwitch kind cluster creation from deployment API (POST /v1/deployments)\nto the kind managed resource API (POST /apis/kind.fleetshift.io/v1/clusters),\nmatching the pattern used by GCP HCP. This aligns create and delete paths\nso clusters can be deleted without \"has no managed state\" errors.\n\n- Add kind-plugin/api.ts with createKindCluster using createApiClient\n- Remove deployment envelope signing (deployment-specific, not applicable\n  to managed resource path)\n- Remove SettingsStep wizard step (contained only signing toggle and\n  static placement note, both deployment-specific)\n- Remove \"Signed\" and \"Placement\" from ReviewStep\n- Add unit tests for the new API client\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niHUEABYKAB0WIQSoG2zhRLubAWkKO1EKIuJ/MUEv7gUCal/BBQAKCRAKIuJ/MUEv\n7l8pAQDYFD2D3Umr4893flBljHqiHq0biNTKK2qBP1CV3cUOywD/c57SJKx2haQ3\n6irH5+l123LLhFemRzWksc6LzjYecgw=\n=mGDv\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-24T18:02:07Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/273054389?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/platex-rehor-bot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/platex-rehor-bot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/platex-rehor-bot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/platex-rehor-bot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/platex-rehor-bot","id":273054389,"login":"platex-rehor-bot","node_id":"U_kgDOEEZ6tQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/platex-rehor-bot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/platex-rehor-bot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/platex-rehor-bot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/platex-rehor-bot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/platex-rehor-bot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/platex-rehor-bot","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/fleetshift/fleetshift-poc/commit/abb231fd7da90c478a2ed1ec6fe306bdc90bcaf3","node_id":"C_kwDORXFOSdoAKGFiYjIzMWZkN2RhOTBjNDc4YTJlZDFlYzZmZTMwNmJkYzkwYmNhZjM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/fleetshift/fleetshift-poc/commit/4de287196d26e4e7afcac7820506276ccdf98cc0","sha":"4de287196d26e4e7afcac7820506276ccdf98cc0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fleetshift/fleetshift-poc/commits/4de287196d26e4e7afcac7820506276ccdf98cc0"}],"sha":"abb231fd7da90c478a2ed1ec6fe306bdc90bcaf3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fleetshift/fleetshift-poc/commits/abb231fd7da90c478a2ed1ec6fe306bdc90bcaf3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3496559?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alechenninger/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alechenninger/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alechenninger/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alechenninger/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alechenninger","id":3496559,"login":"alechenninger","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0OTY1NTk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alechenninger/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alechenninger/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alechenninger/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alechenninger/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alechenninger/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alechenninger","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fleetshift/fleetshift-poc/commits/853155997e215288a390937e7949bc78f5e1cafe/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-21T15:32:51Z","email":"ahenning@redhat.com","name":"Alec Henninger"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-21T15:32:51Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"OME-212: Add CEL has() and container membership to QueryResources filters (#136)\n\n* OME-212: Add projection-faithful CEL has() and container membership filters\n\nSupport has(select) and \"key\" in field for QueryResources so callers can\nexpress presence without relying on equality against missing paths.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* OME-212: Cover schema-specialized membership descriptor lowering\n\nAdd descriptor classifier and SQL-shape tests so known message/map/list,\nscalar rejection, and open-Struct parity are not only claimed by the\nshared schema-free contract.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* OME-212: Speed up Postgres list membership and cover large-array costs\n\nReplace jsonb_array_elements expansion with @> string containment, and add\nearly/late/missing list-membership benches over 32-element roles arrays.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* OME-212: Reject nested-only hits for dynamic list membership\n\nAssert \"k\" in field does not match when the needle appears only inside\nnested array/object elements, not as a top-level string value.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* Short circuit early on empty scope\n\n* Revert \"Short circuit early on empty scope\"\n\nThis reverts commit 1395948ed5e2c0cf7afe82e59a57b39289e9e651.\n\n* Add comment about why we can''t short circuit empty scopes\n\n* Move QueryResources schema validation and membership orchestration into querysql.\n\nGive Compiler ownership of QuerySchemaProvider and ResolveContext the dialect-neutral path/classify APIs, and narrow FieldResolver to ResolveJSONMembership so postgres/sqlite only render backend SQL.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* Reject container membership on non-string repeated fields.\n\nList-membership SQL only matches JSON string elements; classify\nrepeated message/int/bool fields as invalid instead of silently\nnever matching.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"71a6bf4aa50b7c8175aefea2f14b08ed010efd8f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fleetshift/fleetshift-poc/git/trees/71a6bf4aa50b7c8175aefea2f14b08ed010efd8f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fleetshift/fleetshift-poc/git/commits/853155997e215288a390937e7949bc78f5e1cafe","verification":{"payload":"tree 71a6bf4aa50b7c8175aefea2f14b08ed010efd8f\nparent ee9747af99019bc75c882121ec11596021c71596\nauthor Alec Henninger <ahenning@redhat.com> 1784647971 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784647971 -0400\n\nOME-212: Add CEL has() and container membership to QueryResources filters (#136)\n\n* OME-212: Add projection-faithful CEL has() and container membership filters\n\nSupport has(select) and \"key\" in field for QueryResources so callers can\nexpress presence without relying on equality against missing paths.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* OME-212: Cover schema-specialized membership descriptor lowering\n\nAdd descriptor classifier and SQL-shape tests so known message/map/list,\nscalar rejection, and open-Struct parity are not only claimed by the\nshared schema-free contract.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* OME-212: Speed up Postgres list membership and cover large-array costs\n\nReplace jsonb_array_elements expansion with @> string containment, and add\nearly/late/missing list-membership benches over 32-element roles arrays.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* OME-212: Reject nested-only hits for dynamic list membership\n\nAssert \"k\" in field does not match when the needle appears only inside\nnested array/object elements, not as a top-level string value.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* Short circuit early on empty scope\n\n* Revert \"Short circuit early on empty scope\"\n\nThis reverts commit 1395948ed5e2c0cf7afe82e59a57b39289e9e651.\n\n* Add comment about why we can''t short circuit empty scopes\n\n* Move QueryResources schema validation and membership orchestration into querysql.\n\nGive Compiler ownership of QuerySchemaProvider and ResolveContext the dialect-neutral path/classify APIs, and narrow FieldResolver to ResolveJSONMembership so postgres/sqlite only render backend SQL.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* Reject container membership on non-string repeated fields.\n\nList-membership SQL only matches JSON string elements; classify\nrepeated message/int/bool fields as invalid instead of silently\nnever matching.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqX5EjCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAG/8QAFq6DrDTgBGc90Kbhy1BFOeW\nIf2kC0iwY/ztaXAtE+LAuPEhUjjkXKFq2nkPuKwKXquuwhtzAFpDTe4eCfg22WdV\nYDKGzeFI7X6Wjnp2qREACVRwfq7bkI/yrv/ogjvGNe/hmG9ABLU6G1/YYJlfgLlD\nxE8xqN4s7juPyxxibI7VvHFJmVDwdLM9rkhIaAlP/12YjUy1xj0fE40mr8lUznoj\naQ5aaLMeZT+69wpAPdDs9xUq7Feqfh3tZUNQBM2/gS6OlpAbJpyksoUZB2r3xs8S\ngO/lGXuQMZMTRntuXF9tt3QyD0R0yGxS5lP6YzZu5Vj+JfYDJtWf//yh8hFp7GwD\nlfua+14Ou2Iw9SIi32kBYKgcaCIRNfqFahAuqMMAeuI8e+4S/PlOqQBaeSenqQVi\nuE9dQ4z12TutVmFRGnCVMLWqMs4G25NRDB+L5YNEg9gBUejpsfCyup2x3by9MrVY\nzGQ3BJ3pI7fThGmdeGFS7cC0ZUEEsALKcyJaF6bHJIzmpZQGKtlzm/7cE06685Hc\nVGtTKAgwmFqEcF6HYwEO398hlYQTIyv6KtB91EfeTGbvxL29/E017cEDVqFod8RW\nCzQ1xA+yFKdTsVWeVsHFGfJRimNr+0d5uByW+mY+DB3XDlc1udX0LT9Ibg9D2WkG\ninMgMmyEKQ4TwAi7jeQU\n=6KEj\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-21T15:32:52Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/fleetshift/fleetshift-poc/commit/853155997e215288a390937e7949bc78f5e1cafe",