ld registry, operator\nmap, CEL validator, Orama field index, IDB search history, and unified\nAdvancedSearchBar with auto-executing debounced filter queries, compact\noperator chips, and inline results — all in a single dropdown.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"cdf2cc21fa4bc03b25f73e7ac2b776f46a4bf09b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fleetshift/fleetshift-poc/git/trees/cdf2cc21fa4bc03b25f73e7ac2b776f46a4bf09b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fleetshift/fleetshift-poc/git/commits/a3ad9d14160e78d012d2aacdb3f6517e5e37a53e","verification":{"payload":"tree cdf2cc21fa4bc03b25f73e7ac2b776f46a4bf09b\nparent 33fa943482d0afecc1519e493a9f24c1180676a3\nauthor Martin Marosi <marvusm.mmi@gmail.com> 1784557298 +0200\ncommitter Martin Marosi <marvusm.mmi@gmail.com> 1784619059 +0200\n\nfeat(search): CEL advanced search with unified autocomplete menu (OME-210)\n\nPhase 1 implementation: tokenizer, cursor parser, field registry, operator\nmap, CEL validator, Orama field index, IDB search history, and unified\nAdvancedSearchBar with auto-executing debounced filter queries, compact\noperator chips, and inline results — all in a single dropdown.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niHUEABYKAB0WIQSrWw0pRankAm4CMYLQZ6UySYE0+gUCal8gMwAKCRDQZ6UySYE0\n+tAXAP4yt5vYWF4OyYPk2RuSKFBA8jZl3NqD6jyAi5rq9ldlcwD+PrTa58JpE5DG\n/tcrvuXxEAPW0+UOlqupKMs5SJNo8Qo=\n=4Prl\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-24T18:02:07Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22619452?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hyperkid123/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hyperkid123/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hyperkid123/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hyperkid123/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Hyperkid123","id":22619452,"login":"Hyperkid123","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNjE5NDUy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hyperkid123/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hyperkid123/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hyperkid123/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hyperkid123/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hyperkid123/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hyperkid123","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/fleetshift/fleetshift-poc/commit/a3ad9d14160e78d012d2aacdb3f6517e5e37a53e","node_id":"C_kwDORXFOSdoAKGEzYWQ5ZDE0MTYwZTc4ZDAxMmQyYWFjZGIzZjY1MTdlNWUzN2E1M2U","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/fleetshift/fleetshift-poc/commit/33fa943482d0afecc1519e493a9f24c1180676a3","sha":"33fa943482d0afecc1519e493a9f24c1180676a3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fleetshift/fleetshift-poc/commits/33fa943482d0afecc1519e493a9f24c1180676a3"}],"sha":"a3ad9d14160e78d012d2aacdb3f6517e5e37a53e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fleetshift/fleetshift-poc/commits/a3ad9d14160e78d012d2aacdb3f6517e5e37a53e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22619452?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hyperkid123/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hyperkid123/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hyperkid123/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hyperkid123/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Hyperkid123","id":22619452,"login":"Hyperkid123","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNjE5NDUy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hyperkid123/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hyperkid123/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hyperkid123/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hyperkid123/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hyperkid123/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hyperkid123","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fleetshift/fleetshift-poc/commits/33fa943482d0afecc1519e493a9f24c1180676a3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-20T11:52:53Z","email":"marvusm.mmi@gmail.com","name":"Martin Marosi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-21T07:30:58Z","email":"marvusm.mmi@gmail.com","name":"Martin Marosi"},"message":"docs: add CEL advanced search design document (OME-210)\n\nDesign doc for structured search using CEL expressions with a headless\nquery builder (@react-querybuilder/core) and custom PatternFly UI.\nCovers architecture, API contract, autocomplete UX, field registry,\nsearch history/favorites, and phased implementation plan.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7babb992515e7c1f25b73c8a5556da621df35641","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fleetshift/fleetshift-poc/git/trees/7babb992515e7c1f25b73c8a5556da621df35641"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fleetshift/fleetshift-poc/git/commits/33fa943482d0afecc1519e493a9f24c1180676a3","verification":{"payload":"tree 7babb992515e7c1f25b73c8a5556da621df35641\nparent 4de287196d26e4e7afcac7820506276ccdf98cc0\nauthor Martin Marosi <marvusm.mmi@gmail.com> 1784548373 +0200\ncommitter Martin Marosi <marvusm.mmi@gmail.com> 1784619058 +0200\n\ndocs: add CEL advanced search design document (OME-210)\n\nDesign doc for structured search using CEL expressions with a headless\nquery builder (@react-querybuilder/core) and custom PatternFly UI.\nCovers architecture, API contract, autocomplete UX, field registry,\nsearch history/favorites, and phased implementation plan.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niHUEABYKAB0WIQSrWw0pRankAm4CMYLQZ6UySYE0+gUCal8gMgAKCRDQZ6UySYE0\n+uSKAP9bVs44CCxZumFgV