full\nresource name `\"deployments/<id>\"`. Test vectors regenerated from Go output.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9e9214ec2365c0f8e9391a7ee68069421180efbe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fleetshift/fleetshift-poc/git/trees/9e9214ec2365c0f8e9391a7ee68069421180efbe"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fleetshift/fleetshift-poc/git/commits/19afcdfb2a594aca3e57c3ad47ae9c87fb5bc721","verification":{"payload":"tree 9e9214ec2365c0f8e9391a7ee68069421180efbe\nparent cdf61d0ba64bd7da7e52cc8e45335331881b25e9\nauthor Martin Marosi <marvusm.mmi@gmail.com> 1784540851 +0200\ncommitter Martin Marosi <marvusm.mmi@gmail.com> 1784540851 +0200\n\nfix(signing): align canonical envelope with Go server (field name + resource prefix)\n\nThe Go server uses `\"name\"` (not `\"deployment_id\"`) and expects the full\nresource name `\"deployments/<id>\"`. Test vectors regenerated from Go output.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niHUEABYKAB0WIQSrWw0pRankAm4CMYLQZ6UySYE0+gUCal3uuQAKCRDQZ6UySYE0\n+vjIAQDPH0RPqKY1GFBYkvVQxb40V9i5itENkrkQzkfhGh/IJQEApXjiwB2QLiEe\nIb+AbGeFcZVGFvZxB4Kq7bA0y5o6ags=\n=Xfgs\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-24T18:02:07Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22619452?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hyperkid123/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hyperkid123/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hyperkid123/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hyperkid123/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Hyperkid123","id":22619452,"login":"Hyperkid123","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNjE5NDUy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hyperkid123/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hyperkid123/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hyperkid123/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hyperkid123/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hyperkid123/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hyperkid123","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/fleetshift/fleetshift-poc/commit/19afcdfb2a594aca3e57c3ad47ae9c87fb5bc721","node_id":"C_kwDORXFOSdoAKDE5YWZjZGZiMmE1OTRhY2EzZTU3YzNhZDQ3YWU5Yzg3ZmI1YmM3MjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/fleetshift/fleetshift-poc/commit/cdf61d0ba64bd7da7e52cc8e45335331881b25e9","sha":"cdf61d0ba64bd7da7e52cc8e45335331881b25e9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fleetshift/fleetshift-poc/commits/cdf61d0ba64bd7da7e52cc8e45335331881b25e9"}],"sha":"19afcdfb2a594aca3e57c3ad47ae9c87fb5bc721","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fleetshift/fleetshift-poc/commits/19afcdfb2a594aca3e57c3ad47ae9c87fb5bc721"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22619452?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hyperkid123/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hyperkid123/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hyperkid123/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hyperkid123/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Hyperkid123","id":22619452,"login":"Hyperkid123","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNjE5NDUy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hyperkid123/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hyperkid123/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hyperkid123/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hyperkid123/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hyperkid123/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hyperkid123","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fleetshift/fleetshift-poc/commits/cdf61d0ba64bd7da7e52cc8e45335331881b25e9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-20T08:54:46Z","email":"marvusm.mmi@gmail.com","name":"Martin Marosi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-20T08:54:46Z","email":"marvusm.mmi@gmail.com","name":"Martin Marosi"},"message":"fix: address PR review — scope events tab, cap events, fix WS leak, fix persist race\n\n- Add optional `service` field to cluster-detail-tab extensions; filter\n  tabs by service so the GCP HCP events tab only shows on GCP HCP clusters\n- Cap in-memory events array at MAX_PERSISTED and use identity-based\n  dedup (deliveryId + timestamp) instead of fragile last-message check\n- Detach onclose/onerror before closing WebSocket on unmount to prevent\n  reconnect leak when tab uses mountOnEnter/unmountOnExit\n- Merge persist/reload effects into single transition-aware effect to\n  prevent stale events overwriting a new cluster''s localStorage entry\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4ed3403e90895cb7b53f77ec10783619e2ae8cd5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fleetshift/fleetshift-poc/git/trees/4ed3403e90895cb7b53f77ec10783619e2ae8cd5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fleetshift/fleetshift-poc/git/commits/cdf61d0ba64bd7da7e52cc8e45335331881b25e9","verification":{"payload":"tree 4ed3403e90895cb7b53f77ec10783619e2ae8cd5\nparent 1d684e9a809d6575f4639faef7382acca081f9b6\nauthor Martin Marosi <marvusm.mmi@gmail.com> 1784537686 +0200\ncommitter Martin Marosi <marvusm.mmi@gmail.com> 1784537686 +0200\n\nfix: address PR review — scope events tab, cap events, fix WS leak, fix persist race\n\n- Add optional `service` field to cluster-detail-tab extensions; filter\n  tabs by service so the GCP HCP events tab only shows on GCP HCP clusters\n- Cap in-memory events array at MAX_PERSISTED and use identity-based\n  dedup (deliveryId + timestamp) instead of fragile last-message check\n- Detach onclose/onerror before closing WebSocket on unmount to prevent\n  reconnect leak when 