":"https://api.github.com/repos/fleetshift/fleetshift-poc/git/trees/adf573f9a767cde41ce02d572d900f719e653419"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fleetshift/fleetshift-poc/git/commits/1d684e9a809d6575f4639faef7382acca081f9b6","verification":{"payload":"tree adf573f9a767cde41ce02d572d900f719e653419\nparent 20c2a1569be6eb0d82f301c77a9c0e886fb36ec2\nauthor Martin Marosi <marvusm.mmi@gmail.com> 1784536669 +0200\ncommitter Martin Marosi <marvusm.mmi@gmail.com> 1784536669 +0200\n\nfeat(core,gcphcp): inventory-based cluster detail page + custom events log (OME-192)\n\nClusterDetailPage rewritten to fetch from inventory API with typed cluster\nstate derivation. GcpHcpDeliveryEventsTab replaced with a custom terminal-like\nlog component — no flicker, WebSocket reconnection with backoff, localStorage\npersistence, and search highlighting.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niHUEABYKAB0WIQSrWw0pRankAm4CMYLQZ6UySYE0+gUCal3eZQAKCRDQZ6UySYE0\n+ssoAP9Kp3SRmc0ODECe+sTghBbUgIlnZUfwJ49OnSpLHZjIJAD/W0JOq2L4KSxU\nTkcrllosiTNmR/bXPYXlxdxdF0+PYQU=\n=xXDd\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-24T18:02:07Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22619452?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hyperkid123/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hyperkid123/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hyperkid123/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hyperkid123/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Hyperkid123","id":22619452,"login":"Hyperkid123","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNjE5NDUy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hyperkid123/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hyperkid123/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hyperkid123/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/use