gned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3496559?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alechenninger/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alechenninger/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alechenninger/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alechenninger/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alechenninger","id":3496559,"login":"alechenninger","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0OTY1NTk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alechenninger/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alechenninger/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alechenninger/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alechenninger/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alechenninger/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alechenninger","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/fleetshift/fleetshift-poc/commit/77b5b66a9ae1121c324f052bf61c34f86cb61c9a","node_id":"C_kwDORXFOSdoAKDc3YjViNjZhOWFlMTEyMWMzMjRmMDUyYmY2MWMzNGY4NmNiNjFjOWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/fleetshift/fleetshift-poc/commit/99e2be52a0d6ab35b10e2a2c58deab5ebb4db3c5","sha":"99e2be52a0d6ab35b10e2a2c58deab5ebb4db3c5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fleetshift/fleetshift-poc/commits/99e2be52a0d6ab35b10e2a2c58deab5ebb4db3c5"}],"sha":"77b5b66a9ae1121c324f052bf61c34f86cb61c9a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fleetshift/fleetshift-poc/commits/77b5b66a9ae1121c324f052bf61c34f86cb61c9a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3496559?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alechenninger/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alechenninger/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alechenninger/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alechenninger/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alechenninger","id":3496559,"login":"alechenninger","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0OTY1NTk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alechenninger/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alechenninger/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alechenninger/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alechenninger/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alechenninger/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alechenninger","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fleetshift/fleetshift-poc/commits/99e2be52a0d6ab35b10e2a2c58deab5ebb4db3c5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-17T13:50:30Z","email":"ahenning@redhat.com","name":"Alec Henninger"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-17T13:50:30Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Add all-in-one fleetshift image assembly (#132)\n\n* Add all-in-one fleetshift image assembly Dockerfile.\n\nLayers published server and web images so CI can publish a single\nquay.io/stolostron/fleetshift image for podman run without the compose\nweb-builder init path.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* Run all-in-one fleetshift image as non-root.\n\nCreate a dedicated uid 1000 account with ownership of /data and /srv/web\nso the assembled image does not need to start as root.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* Base all-in-one image on fleetshift-server-local for kind.\n\nThe published fleetshift image is meant to support privileged kind runs\nwith the host container socket; that requires the local tooling image,\nnot the bare server image. Document the kind podman run invocation.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* Assemble all-in-one image from fleetshift-server, not -local.\n\nThe kind addon uses the Go library against a mounted container socket; it\ndoes not need the kind/kubectl CLIs that Dockerfile.local adds.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* Base all-in-one image on fleetshift-server-local for kind.\n\nKind''s library still needs a container runtime CLI against the host\nsocket; -local provides podman. Document that the privileged kind run\nis a trusted local/dev path.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"a63882d749965e09dd9c22712cb4dbacbfc1cf14","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fleetshift/fleetshift-poc/git/trees/a63882d749965e09dd9c22712cb4dbacbfc1cf14"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fleetshift/fleetshift-poc/git/commits/99e2be52a0d6ab35b10e2a2c58deab5ebb4db3c5","verification":{"payload":"tree a63882d749965e09dd9c22712cb4dbacbfc1cf14\nparent 03f2102894c6a33eb7f43650855ce78bbeb04c79\nauthor Alec Henninger <ahenning@redhat.com> 1784296230 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784296230 -0400\n\nAdd all-in-one fleetshift image assembly (#132)\n\n* Add all-in-one fleetshift image assembly Dockerfile.\n\nLayers published server and web images so CI can publish a single\nquay.io/stolostron/fleetshift image for podman run without the compose\nweb-builder init path.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* Run all-in-one fleetshift image as non-root.\n\nCreate a dedicated uid 1000 account with ownership of /data and /srv/web\nso the assembled image does not need to start as root.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* Base all-in-one image on fleetshift-server-local for kind.\n\nThe published fleetshift image is meant to support privileged kind runs\nwith the host container socket; that requires the local tooling image,\nnot the bare server image. Document the kind podman run invocation.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* Assemble all-in-one image from fleetshift-server, not -local.\n\nThe kind addon uses the Go library against a mounted container socket; it\ndoes not need the kind/kubectl CLIs that Dockerfile.local adds.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* Base all-in-one image on fleetshift-server-local for kind.\n\nKind''s library still needs a container runtime CLI against the host\nsocket; -local provides podman. Document that the privileged kind run\nis a trusted local/dev path.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqWjMmCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAdVYQAJ/YwN7CvnmPjwU+9SzImO0m\nCQ3m1gKK2XSraT69rVEczK6eYRIGiqEgyG/4YywwN0pdo6ibxWgfAtVuSvtDTT3z\n9jlaKZhgV6+LXSfsO2HUVAvIKcWYP2yL8ER4KtJ8ZWSmM4zvC33urA5jxpmASCXw\n+ICQdKJ+UqtcgwXEI68AI++jjrE4oBXPnyaZZ8nvlRRFttfTpZOMpIesy9+0lPzX\nKH3hz/9h2c9X9y5TIhFtUXYt1ONgje0d0+GzfppLsgl4hsfSfvSjY+rNT1rERJtX\n/vjx0p6VYzX2aVQ7OLP3uSpmfgPf1/Fwirav01h7gxS6dSCgrsIz4bk1/fa+NkFm\n7e1TWqv44dCIf/0APFKyFzg3mUKotRvn4N+UUdbwtITLWNnGJGp+BroedQSCq6cU\nS9pcM3/X6TyBjKXQRHRwUMCF1H9Dm00f/44nBCKbYW19Dfjh6uTLnJxUfWj6iHpf\nikI2YUkzXkASOp8ytZcXi2AjSGwUSBdCJdKhuJS980Oyqnxu/7vewFgBUsrovKbQ\nqJgmH5lhl87kiC9hwLb0hzIa78s+sFtpe+l57pYxG6onjn/wkZFMFb1QDFm8JMKg\nSgocqO0Sfqx3usQPg0WR/mQoDvgb+d/kG135YsHV1tv5jME7ylDYQTAA3NIEZc4A\nv+ZVWdlTYj/vIzq43gBe\n=lao2\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-17T13:50:30Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https:/