123/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hyperkid123/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hyperkid123/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hyperkid123/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hyperkid123","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fleetshift/fleetshift-poc/commits/95744882eb5d253cb28c4ace220120c21e4a8a02/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-15T08:44:28Z","email":"marvusm.mmi@gmail.com","name":"Martin Marosi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-15T08:44:28Z","email":"marvusm.mmi@gmail.com","name":"Martin Marosi"},"message":"feat(addon-demo): consolidated mock plugin with category-grouped checklist\n\nReplaces security-plugin and observability-plugin stubs with a single\naddon-demo-plugin providing 15 extensions: 4 cluster providers (EKS, AKS,\nROSA, vSphere), 8 onboarding actions, and 3 module pages (Security with\nfull CVE table mock, Observability and Compliance placeholders).\n\nAdds `category` field to onboarding action extensions using the existing\nFleetshiftExtensionType values. The overview \"Getting started\" checklist\ngroups provider actions into one \"Configure a cluster provider\" row\n(complete when any provider is configured) and hides module actions.\nThe extensions page supports ?category= filtering.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5f09d92392f4a91cd2a6beb4a4b759047514198c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fleetshift/fleetshift-poc/git/trees/5f09d92392f4a91cd2a6beb4a4b759047514198c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fleetshift/fleetshift-poc/git/commits/95744882eb5d253cb28c4ace220120c21e4a8a02","verification":{"payload":"tree 5f09d92392f4a91cd2a6beb4a4b759047514198c\nparent 18b30f2a88e9b48f0cce25031e5151bed1070251\nauthor Martin Marosi <marvusm.mmi@gmail.com> 1784105068 +0200\ncommitter Martin Marosi <marvusm.mmi@gmail.com> 1784105068 +0200\n\nfeat(addon-demo): consolidated mock plugin with category-grouped checklist\n\nReplaces security-plugin and observability-plugin stubs with a single\naddon-demo-plugin providing 15 extensions: 4 cluster providers (EKS, AKS,\nROSA, vSphere), 8 onboarding actions, and 3 module pages (Security with\nfull CVE table mock, Observability and Compliance placeholders).\n\nAdds `category` field to onboarding action extensions using the existing\nFleetshiftExtensionType values. The overview \"Getting started\" checklist\ngroups provider actions into one \"Configure a cluster provider\" row\n(complete when any provider is configured) and hides module actions.\nThe extensions page supports ?category= filtering.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niHUEABYKAB0WIQSrWw0pRankAm4CMYLQZ6UySYE0+gUCaldIcgAKCRDQZ6UySYE0\n+kM3AQCFZ37GPzUrLACZkWx9Hfobg7EZBblBuhnRuygPtMU6fwD/XXWA1EWMZtoK\nOXiVivZtGvmWnh7TX7DTB97RMAf2QQI=\n=F19v\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-24T18:02:07Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22619452?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hyperkid123/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hyperkid123/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hyperkid123/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hyperkid123/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Hyperkid123","id":22619452,"login":"Hyperkid123","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNjE5NDUy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hyperkid123/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hyperkid123/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hyperkid123/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hyperkid123/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hyperkid123/subscriptions