url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeffrey2423/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeffrey2423/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeffrey2423","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeffrey2423/coding-standards/commits/d867e11fea02ada89e59eb82478342c81389cf4b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-09T17:04:00Z","email":"37357913+jeffrey2423@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Jeffrey Rios Muñoz"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-09T17:04:00Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(web): add spacing, radii, elevation and component tokens (#25)\n\nFill the token gap in design-system-ux: a 4px spacing scale with a\ndensity rule, a radii scale (full reserved for pills/avatars), a\nthree-step elevation model (tone over shadow in dark mode), and\ntoken-bound component rules (button/pill/input/card/modal/toast/table\nwith contrast, focus-ring and 24-44px target rules). Accessibility and\nperformance budgets were already present; this adds the layout/shape\nprimitives that were missing.\n\nAuthored as generic, token-named guidance — no brand colors or\nproduct-specific components.","tree":{"sha":"59fafb28da9f910956a531295c8ccf9c5d14db4a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeffrey2423/coding-standards/git/trees/59fafb28da9f910956a531295c8ccf9c5d14db4a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeffrey2423/coding-standards/git/commits/d867e11fea02ada89e59eb82478342c81389cf4b","verification":{"payload":"tree 59fafb28da9f910956a531295c8ccf9c5d14db4a\nparent b0a5a679fa072428678008cda1bba3ecea9bc874\nauthor Jeffrey Rios Muñoz <37357913+jeffrey2423@users.noreply.github.com> 1783616640 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1783616640 -0500\n\nfeat(web): add spacing, radii, elevation and component tokens (#25)\n\nFill the token gap in design-system-ux: a 4px spacing scale with a\ndensity rule, a radii scale (full reserved for pills/avatars), a\nthree-step elevation model (tone over shadow in dark mode), and\ntoken-bound component rules (button/pill/input/card/modal/toast/table\nwith contrast, focus-ring and 24-44px target rules). Accessibility and\nperformance budgets were already present; this adds the layout/shape\nprimitives that were missing.\n\nAuthored as generic, token-named guidance — no brand colors or\nproduct-specific components.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqT9SACRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA8SEQAJqLZmzkUi12+NizNIG2CfFY\nTOforEJA8f6XImtXYfWcicZkp3k3s0OBHhi4cNzXKGk2iXDJiEyw/idyCgfuPHBg\nhv37k9S3rN4OqXQujpJdEq5lTReOYpY6k0QTZobwRwf6gBfJdffgAjX0VEE5wlEP\nCy2nNCtWhG6rP2VO3133M3msWWQb/+JI5uT8He4teQyGi2e2Z45rgq9Dq93Ew/69\nBty5qnX7wgjR9DEobBCLgpkN5+3yuNWU7Dvs9/74vp3E/tP6nPHyOFVL7zc05x7I\nUXwr9m9MzzfKUE8ATPbVdu6/dh94JEs8sgPBcXFtPYehzqeMlJozDDrXnrKdIMbN\nE78uCwiyle/G7BDSW1yy4AlVqMdifTPnqP4ZoV0o+MVwpGvfeoH3EtuR97R8/g7j\ntZ63bXKN9PIHNo+cVZSYsCljvhBsFsEoICStISNXyBv9erTTbke76ta4hdcOrc72\nDW0vkfBQwnjEoKQNmsNe/N+yxs4F4pQ6364cNTjUYN/Z+yme4soCKmXWzRNJX/wl\nn8n4lEn5G0z6MKa1cV4Xn+dlv1Ix/qauWKdRp0ZZCdh0AT8s+7Nfb7pN1RA/gNM6\n2RP6uipC6F6XdELKBpVxQ3VViVyXQ0usHzIXMvgBq6WO9v5wkAAHk1cpu1M8xVBb\nIqxtGbDuXmFPa9TkLuFX\n=68Eq\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-09T17:04:01Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/jeffrey2423/coding-standards/commit/d867e11fea02ada89e59eb82478342c81389cf4b","node_id":"C_kwDORXXHc9oAKGQ4NjdlMTFmZWEwMmFkYTg5ZTU5ZWI4MjQ3ODM0MmM4MTM4OWNmNGI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/jeffrey2423/coding-standards/commit/b0a5a679fa072428678008cda1bba3ecea9bc874","sha":"b0a5a679fa072428678008cda1bba3ecea9bc874","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeffrey2423/coding-standards/commits/b0a5a679fa072428678008cda1bba3ecea9bc874"}],"sha":"d867e11fea02ada89e59eb82478342c81389cf4b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeffrey2423/coding-standards/commits/d867e11fea02ada89e59eb82478342c81389cf4b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/37357913?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeffrey2423/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeffrey2423/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeffrey2423/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeffrey2423/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jeffrey2423","id":37357913,"login":"jeffrey2423","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3MzU3OTEz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeffrey2423/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeffrey2423/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeffrey2423/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeffrey2423/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeffrey2423/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeffrey2423","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeffrey2423/coding-standards/commits/b0a5a679fa072428678008cda1bba3ecea9bc874/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-09T17:03:56Z","email":"37357913+jeffrey2423@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Jeffrey Rios Muñoz"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-09T17:03:56Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(core): add security/quality rules and code-review checklist (#24)\n\nAdd two always-installed core standards distilled from real\nstatic-analysis (SonarQube) findings and an adversarial review process,\nplus enrich the testing strategy:\n\n- security-quality-rules.md: secrets handling, HTTPS/CORS, regex ReDoS\n  timeouts, container hardening, .NET code hygiene, code smells, and a\n  \"keep the rules alive\" quality-gate governance loop. The .NET-specific\n  section is wrapped in a when:backend marker so web/mobile-only installs\n  don''t carry C# rules.\n- code-review-checklist.md: verify-claims-against-reality stance,\n  per-facet checklist, a severity rubric, and a done/not-done gate.\n- testing-strategy.md: coverage targets, risk-based prioritization\n  (R = Impact x Probability with P0-P3 bands), and test-design\n  heuristics (techniques, data buckets, adversarial personas, edge-case\n  quota, traceability).\n\nDe-branded and translated from an internal SIESA rule set; no company\nnames, tools, or Spanish-only mandates carried over.","tree":{"sha":"7be37d327994c5c802f6fbbfcf59db7f4abd0e0e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeffrey2423/coding-standards/git/trees/7be37d327994c5c802f6fbbfcf59db7f4abd0e0e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeffrey2423/coding-standards/git/commits/b0a5a679fa072428678008cda1bba3ecea9bc874","verification":{"payload":"tree 7be37d327994c5c802f6fbbfcf59db7f4abd0e0e\nparent f480657a044ff2b801ed54ee84f1878a5f258eb5\nauthor Jeffrey Rios Muñoz <37357913+jeffrey2423@users.noreply.github.com> 1783616636 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1783616636 -0500\n\nfeat(core): add security/quality rules and code-review checklist (#24)\n\nAdd two always-installed core standards distilled from real\nstatic-analysis (SonarQube) findings and an adversarial review process,\nplus enrich the testing strategy:\n\n- security-quality-rules.md: secrets handling, HTTPS/CORS, regex ReDoS\n  timeouts, container hardening, .NET code hygiene, code smells, and a\n  \"keep the rules alive\" quality-gate governance loop. The .NET-specific\n  section is wrapped in a when:backend marker so web/mobile-only installs\n  don''t carry C# rules.\n- code-review-checklist.md: verify-claims-against-reality stance,\n  per-facet checklist, a severity rubric, and a done/not-done gate.\n- testing-strategy.md: coverage targets, risk-based prioritization\n  (R = Impact x Probability with P0-P3 bands), and test-design\n  heuristics (techniques, data buckets, adversarial personas, edge-case\n  quota, traceability).\n\nDe-branded and translated from an internal SIESA rule set; no company\nnames, tools, or Spanish-only mandates carried over.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqT9R8CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAE00QAIkfqJrS2ak5VZ71hV5BnAZK\nzAjCUsYBchEGDCResdNiWIpqf4z2jhNHtgejl/N+fcdhM8EKJUUM4aS3i2TDA9Cv\nb2AcnKTW/dU0Dmq57ogdYqjzYgF6MK9sEsriAeJMi8hs2rmbcnavU9Niy4pFrRo2\n+dz3faG9oupyz7giGy7cbIZc9nvqLaVcGE2Dm7+sEsbZttfMqXl/wl2JezdaZdhU\n1qZBdVZQwmkVxqy3CoOngh/zmTNOkYE8f3+LdkhqyrmqkD3LXiLrGp9WAfubjYSO\nBET7EgWBIi5wBFXupVLu+T67aXPqWDCWA9Wb0VJ4mHJENMUU54cyRil0c8NGdHQ/\nayvQ1tjlV0ETRHQPFkDM2RrSZwaTdHeufo5EybokUBIbmYfbCgcJISj5Urrp0J4w\nia3If8dgi7/mp9hUOI2c6TcLZzNOWlTo8nk3Sp8LZ+3Z406am5ehhxReOMImtzz6\nIYf1Y4b8SdNNqjF17TIZZY456/HSAwRhQZpm3T1GjjVDVO9Hljfa6PQGFOA1YrBN\n0dxd4/ys8C1PJxpxPlCR+xJ/yktCBZ+3Ha5GtR4MlaVnGLahN+V30ziS1jIFXkSP\nMmnWLBe1MTKyFydNAyi9N/pjbv55vH+zZtgKveD9lONAwCpjPayXRXWgsKxQwk0M\nORDPNmEBeor8kUcH4kYF\n=GxSj\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-09T17:03:56Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/