,"sha":"5ad887184ef1607670220b098f69dce760b22325","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeffrey2423/coding-standards/commits/5ad887184ef1607670220b098f69dce760b22325"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/37357913?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeffrey2423/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeffrey2423/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeffrey2423/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeffrey2423/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jeffrey2423","id":37357913,"login":"jeffrey2423","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3MzU3OTEz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeffrey2423/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeffrey2423/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeffrey2423/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeffrey2423/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeffrey2423/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeffrey2423","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeffrey2423/coding-standards/commits/09f507e56f86eaab53e6686cb1ba0442c6fdee33/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-24T20:43:57Z","email":"37357913+jeffrey2423@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Jeffrey Rios Muñoz"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-24T20:43:57Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(web): WCAG 2.2, MF package publishing, Inter-variable & Node 24 (2.7.0) (#20)\n\nBack-port the generic, reusable improvements made downstream in a\nconsuming project (turnify-docs) into the source package, keeping the\ntemplate brand-neutral and decision-aware — project-specific styling\n(brand palette, domain status colors, locale formatting) was\ndeliberately left out so the installer keeps baking consistent docs.\n\n- web/_base/technology-stack.md: pin Node.js 24 LTS as the toolchain\n  runtime (clears Vite 7''s 20.19+/22.12+ floor).\n- web/microfrontends/module-federation-standard.md: add a \"Package\n  publishing (private registry)\" section — Verdaccio vs GitHub Packages\n  (with the scope-equals-org caveat), token-free committed .npmrc, semver\n  with major-on-break backed by MF 2.0 dts + contract tests.\n- web/_base/design-system-ux.md: raise the accessibility baseline to\n  WCAG 2.2 AA (adds §2.5.8 Target Minimum, §2.5.7 Dragging Movements) with\n  a generic accessibility floor; switch typography to the Inter variable\n  font with real 400/500/600/700 weights (was a degenerate mapping that\n  collapsed medium->400 and semibold->700); add a hard tabular-nums rule;\n  add Design-system package & Storybook guidance.\n- Align the remaining WCAG references to 2.2 AA for cross-doc consistency\n  (frontend-architecture.md, frontend-standards.md §8.1, README principle 9).\n\nBump 2.6.1 -> 2.7.0 (additive) with a Keep-a-Changelog entry.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ded15ae29a965ac08afd6194f91ff25d47ba0df1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeffrey2423/coding-standards/git/trees/ded15ae29a965ac08afd6194f91ff25d47ba0df1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeffrey2423/coding-standards/git/commits/09f507e56f86eaab53e6686cb1ba0442c6fdee33","verification":{"payload":"tree ded15ae29a965ac08afd6194f91ff25d47ba0df1\nparent 536eca0400cd969175774df7470b85c0f93f93cd\nauthor Jeffrey Rios Muñoz <37357913+jeffrey2423@users.noreply.github.com> 1782333837 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1782333837 -0500\n\nfeat(web): WCAG 2.2, MF package publishing, Inter-variable & Node 24 (2.7.0) (#20)\n\nBack-port the generic, reusable improvements made downstream in a\nconsuming project (turnify-docs) into the source package, keeping the\ntemplate brand-neutral and decision-aware — project-specific styling\n(brand palette, domain status colors, locale formatting) was\ndeliberately left out so the installer keeps baking consistent docs.\n\n- web/_base/technology-stack.md: pin Node.js 24 LTS as the toolchain\n  runtime (clears Vite 7''s 20.19+/22.12+ floor).\n- web/microfrontends/module-federation-standard.md: add a \"Package\n  publishing (private registry)\" section — Verdaccio vs GitHub Packages\n  (with the scope-equals-org caveat), token-free committed .npmrc, semver\n  with major-on-break backed by MF 2.0 dts + contract tests.\n- web/_base/design-system-ux.md: raise the accessibility baseline to\n  WCAG 2.2 AA (adds §2.5.8 Target Minimum, §2.5.7 Dragging Movements) with\n  a generic accessibility floor; switch typography to the Inter variable\n  font with real 400/500/600/700 weights (was a degenerate mapping that\n  collapsed medium->400 and semibold->700); add a hard tabular-nums rule;\n  add Design-system package & Storybook guidance.\n- Align the remaining WCAG references to 2.2 AA for cross-doc consistency\n  (frontend-architecture.md, frontend-standards.md §8.1, README principle 9).\n\nBump 2.6.1 -> 2.7.0 (additive) with a Keep-a-Changelog entry.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqPEGNCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA3hgQACjjvbQMYPHwGfjWZAwWLDzD\nvIW/S58jBGEPwHdrwWRPHwArjHuPUCNz6i4K84puTNNJWBV+qVvittEcpccS4GFm\nkj0FpR4ACaAzdIwS0x/TbIULbpJKe57Jbr7Lv0VUYI07yB1X4/sdZu/6kH6iMgMU\nCEohLKcRIB4YRvVDxK3FG4do0to0wO4JUg0qZG4XZ7KBYqI5WVzwsvZa2C8ThWE/\nvWpP8r/dDSQHK7b1qruCac1S59e6e/iuZh3/rKSQLnghgVhy1wOQYAIw0m6RsozT\nZfUFs58LFFAMOeLzamuVbUG2Q5yLUYKD52a8ldpjOS9IrpLW1UYq8SOEnLgLKbFx\nmXCuJZt7PYUXlKG7BXRc2Yx3b9YlFKfqhYSWiBhF3zUkYGTpU/ErXtfCDRDD08zW\nrMf70tMIt+V3jkQXvAv7fa0MgrCx4QhxT9PeiTMD32POBkaYYDkCoVnhpf0FEKHq\nTk/jj2Nm3uNQ95/OkkWTm7ZKAPmaqWUnw6cIQlEQECAOPpFia/8vwH3pYL+9EBrS\n5kjx+IL9/n4GyxsvuQ6S5jfVIwYGZlKXfn99QN4CsrNg8VuD0CAoEriz0PBt55Pd\nYwakoBivPtLY13qdrUsHimn5WWSnGP2lA4/7sXSQ6GXoo/e/5eW8SisQCdzBD4Yz\ne+ljiizGWNUS7Mz0OIS/\n=PtLz\n-----