thub.com/users/jeffrey2423/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jeffrey2423","id":37357913,"login":"jeffrey2423","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3MzU3OTEz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeffrey2423/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeffrey2423/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeffrey2423/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeffrey2423/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeffrey2423/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeffrey2423","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeffrey2423/coding-standards/commits/536eca0400cd969175774df7470b85c0f93f93cd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-24T01:03:22Z","email":"37357913+jeffrey2423@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Jeffrey Rios Muñoz"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-24T01:03:22Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(standards): align language rule to i18n (2.6.1) (#19)\n\ncore/coding-conventions.md and core/ai-collaboration.md (both always\ninstalled) and the README key-principles list still mandated \"user-facing\ntext in Spanish\", contradicting frontend-standards.md §13, which has been\nlocale-agnostic since 2.3.0. An install therefore shipped a Spanish-only UI\nmandate next to a locale-agnostic frontend standard.\n\nRestate all three with the same rule: user-facing text is routed through the\ni18n layer to the product''s configured locale; code, identifiers, comments,\nlogs and docs are always English. Docs-only consistency fix; bump to 2.6.1\nso the corrected README/standards republish.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"97167bf8026492043b61ab6ee39b46196259c4bd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeffrey2423/coding-standards/git/trees/97167bf8026492043b61ab6ee39b46196259c4bd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeffrey2423/coding-standards/git/commits/536eca0400cd969175774df7470b85c0f93f93cd","verification":{"payload":"tree 97167bf8026492043b61ab6ee39b46196259c4bd\nparent 188d9e3668eada3ef09347c4dff7b8a2dcfb11db\nauthor Jeffrey Rios Muñoz <37357913+jeffrey2423@users.noreply.github.com> 1782263002 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1782263002 -0500\n\nfix(standards): align language rule to i18n (2.6.1) (#19)\n\ncore/coding-conventions.md and core/ai-collaboration.md (both always\ninstalled) and the README key-principles list still mandated \"user-facing\ntext in Spanish\", contradicting frontend-standards.md §13, which has been\nlocale-agnostic since 2.3.0. An install therefore shipped a Spanish-only UI\nmandate next to a locale-agnostic frontend standard.\n\nRestate all three with the same rule: user-facing text is routed through the\ni18n layer to the product''s configured locale; code, identifiers, comments,\nlogs and docs are always English. Docs-only consistency fix; bump to 2.6.1\nso the corrected README/standards republish.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqOyzaCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAzRcQAEQbM8ABZzpIJTfSk8EMnGNA\nZJVGMTJNoCRfyn3qjJoJzG8xyxjSE4DCILuNCFrAh1zwpKHQoeJSqYJGCvbRHqFW\nyLiqNjS3JXHdfbz7onvoZKydyYqZxPQ84sAoj48DmLf6SrwTWRW2KfX1Aq7IqbR4\n/Pnnnt6tJzh13tysOFFbxW0BUHXf2TtePNxGP4RzczhaLSfag5ujNmLF6N4QJTWL\n8DWwX41qF1ENPlT900rrRtWCMruS5niJKeywN299wEToBS+EP+Ry81JJGBi3bWbC\nfARhMJXXAhrmBZ5Q4jRHciQgo76XMKGditlXN+CpeLMkejGOldCqUtlKarL2708N\nVvvm9I/hzb2xCBj0UqPeeCkuJX1jIkCXs8WGhWGfIQsnZYyDtV8jyrAmKBIHFjhT\ne/XRhEjgsnvwtprXW8NNEzEVWtjLLYDFj+u9LB8115BThwm2xxLBJBOBaXE9vTnX\n0Qno1dmWXRChLs4XIjZ3d1aG3MN0oPUU6YfabEkOQe8MPx2HkSLNeaxmX5vaEDBy\nM67YFtwxR0xTxGld5gi1yO/1aCSGviIdKSP+24UG1xZy3pm19OYE2DjlWT2JV4D4\nHe1WJ7NHHnULdsQPE+/WHGe/cz4NRAEEt34kBC9JqhB/kFtqgk8M42qyUZSOh1dP\nu9z/N9G82l85xlAOlJfu\n=5BmI\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,