'how to pick a web track'' from frontend-architecture''s load_when.\n\n* chore(release): 2.5.2","tree":{"sha":"9b9df986a1befb22f425626ff798060cc379a2b4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeffrey2423/coding-standards/git/trees/9b9df986a1befb22f425626ff798060cc379a2b4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeffrey2423/coding-standards/git/commits/f2a96c0a5e8f5b4f7b164f9efd52d2dad1508f98","verification":{"payload":"tree 9b9df986a1befb22f425626ff798060cc379a2b4\nparent a7585344dea0ddbdf11368a5a671373e84d68be4\nauthor Jeffrey Rios Muñoz <37357913+jeffrey2423@users.noreply.github.com> 1782001713 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1782001713 -0500\n\ndocs: neutralize choice-implying titles/load_when (2.5.2) (#17)\n\n* docs: neutralize choice-implying titles and load_when triggers\n\nFront-matter load_when (which feeds INDEX.md) and titles aren''t processed by the conditional engine, so they still implied an open decision in committed installs. Retitle the distributed-architecture doc to ''Distributed Architecture'' with a map-style load_when, and drop ''how to pick a web track'' from frontend-architecture''s load_when.\n\n* chore(release): 2.5.2","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqNzAxCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA3BAQACJF/0VN3YW28F9CBvxaTHyf\n1VmnLwmhfuIk1Qh/++jgTSeQaD19o9Is9Ra8KCzCJ8uNDEIiHdXIJ6cOlXa0K34g\n14HmS0LT2UcZmQBLexXrS0o11gfdg3P8mjdUxvfFM3AlrSjTtgVmnSo0XMBAf48l\nt0SGDgDnTwHzooyfTbLNRu27VaZxs6tlWd71ko+TT0MHeV3vrFuWrWf/Y8nAKvxW\nMawYHfhAaJ6y0zk/foIScq+8cv08Y4goNRsjoMgP2KdLYi6hRRQeeMUF18rvuLVC\nEAOLbiaLDwp/f90jZ9T0PogyhouzAm7k1kJ8XvqLrnciljsDFdANxWhjyjG4AsJS\nHJv7AJUlnqdvhRRz9Cdo7gCPKll7bukuCe46zJZQrJLQndWJ/tTFUMezekCqI4PH\nOQ2hnc/ViELNIOPoMNggCs9UlI3MqnEofFiJEYrnh71AcnDgQ9gC+herrCwFqNOV\nPbpz80JVELQobbeeJezjFuKaBrLLFfsK2fJaOsmFZklP9doMpXd9EqwlfcqyVoE2\nC43UQVksVXhE7F16yTx+5x3zfbJ01X0AS/rPAzLVY+pa5tBZq9jCK3eZ/waLWn73\nTRXc/bo+vNyx5lGQ3DM54b4DyGFCsiIuAIAMqac+n58IoCdF012Luj9HCuNg2JGW\nJNBHyGdfdYCMkbAiUMh/\n=DFUs\n-----END PGP 