:"https://api.github.com/users/jeffrey2423/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeffrey2423","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeffrey2423/coding-standards/commits/fe2c99b2b0db48ddd3128fd5c2e21150d9665775/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-20T22:57:12Z","email":"37357913+jeffrey2423@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Jeffrey Rios Muñoz"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-20T22:57:12Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(backend): align Problem Details to RFC 9457 (2.3.1) (#13)\n\n* fix(backend): align Problem Details to RFC 9457\n\nbackend-standards.md cited RFC 7807 while public-api-facade.md and microservice-anatomy.md use RFC 9457 (which obsoletes 7807). Unify on 9457 so the Problem Details reference is consistent across the package.\n\n* chore(release): 2.3.1","tree":{"sha":"1c35e681a0aa0b39e1de71f16bdde1878eca5eee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeffrey2423/coding-standards/git/trees/1c35e681a0aa0b39e1de71f16bdde1878eca5eee"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeffrey2423/coding-standards/git/commits/fe2c99b2b0db48ddd3128fd5c2e21150d9665775","verification":{"payload":"tree 1c35e681a0aa0b39e1de71f16bdde1878eca5eee\nparent 094e6086799a1bae2fa36d4ec38f632d2136be0d\nauthor Jeffrey Rios Muñoz <37357913+jeffrey2423@users.noreply.github.com> 1781996232 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1781996232 -0500\n\nfix(backend): align Problem Details to RFC 9457 (2.3.1) (#13)\n\n* fix(backend): align Problem Details to RFC 9457\n\nbackend-standards.md cited RFC 7807 while public-api-facade.md and microservice-anatomy.md use RFC 9457 (which obsoletes 7807). Unify on 9457 so the Problem Details reference is consistent across the package.\n\n* chore(release): 2.3.1","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqNxrICRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAz/IQABcIuYSTP9OKhQEPBb5RuEYq\nYbd1Gw1gd1o8Q2fxRroPyf9srfuELhlwi0aoh1b2eteKUSyHcma9QUfYebIl