, React 19.2) and note the Expo Router fork from React Navigation. Architecture/library choices were already current. Also translate every remaining Spanish string literal in the mobile examples to English so the standards docs are 100% English reference material; the example ARB is now app_en.arb to stay consistent.\n\n* chore(release): 2.2.1","tree":{"sha":"6b349ef379ba6581581509edb9f78bd5894fc02c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeffrey2423/coding-standards/git/trees/6b349ef379ba6581581509edb9f78bd5894fc02c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeffrey2423/coding-standards/git/commits/1ea2e7780835b2510404ddd7da5f15ea69948cca","verification":{"payload":"tree 6b349ef379ba6581581509edb9f78bd5894fc02c\nparent 5e599ce700ffb0234c0365ddd8377d7b768c9fb5\nauthor Jeffrey Rios Muñoz <37357913+jeffrey2423@users.noreply.github.com> 1781993693 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1781993693 -0500\n\ndocs(mobile): refresh 2026 versions + fully English (2.2.1) (#10)\n\n* docs(mobile): refresh 2026 versions and make docs fully English\n\nBump to current 2026 releases (Flutter 3.44 / Dart 3.8, React Native 0.85, Expo SDK 56, React 19.2) and note the Expo Router fork from React Navigation. Architecture/library choices were already current. Also translate every remaining Spanish string literal in the mobile examples to English so the standards docs are 100% English reference material; the example ARB is now app_en.arb to stay consistent.\n\n* chore(release): 2.2.1","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqNxDdCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAyYoQAEEZVk+DoRNeXBgXhTq+FgWt\nUmf/QIsg5s02eVUKnUSR/m1CAVOa5pxXgtmn1xLgbsBjGISa4oHWF35UriVLhbWs\n4Esvv6bKYHa3ZCHPGi1BJlYZCZWkaXR13BrTTrWbubUnM8IbURdeOBURBDyMH1fO\nj2vOC3PhcADHEUZQC2IaBsVxLcIa2a5gV/hXGJbkKNZJjvLcF+BMMxmtt2fg/5sk\nPQ1EU5R3XE7sTpuZWH8n4J+5Nm7OQs7xb6QilcdEF8yJsEBu8jXrY+nWSIaQERFs\nQsyA/UIl8paDGnGVEEvzVvc//rD6DvEJWIB+6eAHX+Gk/dIfVEyVd15KrSXQpn5c\n6M6eQXNCCXOjW+WepR7IgPUC2Phm6nSphkJ8vtvQwzvGhl5++CWoD1h5