k matches the current installer output shown on the npm page.\n\n* chore(release): 2.1.1","tree":{"sha":"9bba01cdbbb0b65934d3acf7a107442e5f0e42a7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeffrey2423/coding-standards/git/trees/9bba01cdbbb0b65934d3acf7a107442e5f0e42a7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeffrey2423/coding-standards/git/commits/01f711a1efbdbed5846b45e9ee98056958e7f0be","verification":{"payload":"tree 9bba01cdbbb0b65934d3acf7a107442e5f0e42a7\nparent dc2caed343d21ba278f3940cd17278eed1c526e6\nauthor Jeffrey Rios Muñoz <37357913+jeffrey2423@users.noreply.github.com> 1781988835 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1781988835 -0500\n\ndocs: refresh quick-start sample for BFF (2.1.1) (#8)\n\n* docs: refresh quick-start installer sample for BFF\n\nThe interactive sample omitted the new BFF arch option and showed a stale copied-file count (14). Add the BFF tick and correct the count to 19 so the mock matches the current installer output shown on the npm page.\n\n* chore(release): 2.1.1","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqNv3jCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAsZ4QAHsNjvjQgerr626rDHR5eZdX\ne+XicpnVxnnX1PMgJDCw/4m390fTijzW961B9y5HUtNfFcBIL2kwxi5fKZc/8uCQ\nTuzAqfUd+5924kUN29tYx/TFUUdhqeG6tQYMujPsOYPI3R6XsDYEEaDkJrpO7ta7\n5DAZAGHcM3ukA1J1rV0NTbmPc3wWQ+LLmX4GoOl4rnv8JzA6tY/tAqinUdqE7ss7\n70v7IPI5Ba57cf0P6nmjKnvHSQRO6o7fRA6DlBTc1F8Y/U4Ca/u4xh6EAK6Y1dCV\nIZ2BnPjr/n47vTN3waMmzq5zGlpK8PZ7NqEoh2Qzs0YGrFX1P0F+PB5nKLLCAuGE\nM2icW25u0IcasoN5ePoH+5mgp55obYgp0hBt+SfMWy0eYvk440O9EjbpV7gjLXi0\nfzTLvp7x+KjpN0HI/jgwuahmGL+9zSHjxmkpIOq47t6hRrrazaxloR5pKz2QgoNw\nPvmDCiAn8HDiH0HnkC1QB96qaCsADBEUTvx/fPawr49LxApGv3aR3pRVhZijT0Jg\nOv859t1QgDwdXqc/5BZQsFnhu8Oqp6Nx3UIvxswpMSB8HwPpTWksFBiFJDscQzPZ\nJiqka8YG8SkEZRmtxlDnzK24X/15fJEId+yH1GKHXLbyqaKNvvd/c0IQidw8xQRF\nHqxv09eMlYdnrm5sGr37\n=fZqe\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-20T20:53:56Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","e