dynamic redirect on the dynamic stale bound; isolate regenerations from the probe sink\n\n* refactor(app-router): fold the static redirect stale stamp into the early response policy\n\n* fix(cache): keep an unstable_cache background refresh out of the request''s cache life\n\n* fix(cache): run an unstable_cache background refresh detached like a use cache regeneration\n\n* test(cache): assert the unstable_cache background refresh completed","tree":{"sha":"5b71fa55b6df50324d78a1e2f6de18d2ef623708","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cloudflare/vinext/git/trees/5b71fa55b6df50324d78a1e2f6de18d2ef623708"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cloudflare/vinext/git/commits/329b1810c1d548b2c2c381cd43cfd64429fa22cd","verification":{"payload":"tree 5b71fa55b6df50324d78a1e2f6de18d2ef623708\nparent 602579a4851288eb6728a58e2e9888fe630b9da8\nauthor James Anderson <james@eli.cx> 1791453077 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791453077 +0100\n\nfix(app-router): bound a prefetched layout redirect by the probe''s cacheLife (#3754)\n\n* fix(app-router): bound a prefetched layout redirect by the probe''s cacheLife stale time\n\n* fix(app-router): keep a known-dynamic redirect on the dynamic stale bound; isolate regenerations from the probe sink\n\n* refactor(app-router): fold the static redirect stale stamp into the early response policy\n\n* fix(cache): keep an unstable_cache background refresh out of the request''s cache life\n\n* fix(cache): run an unstable_cache background refresh detached like a use cache regeneration\n\n* test(cache): assert the unstable_cache background refresh completed","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqx2eVCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAASGgQAKjkzTCTYJvVVDDzOOE+FIgW\n+iG70cA+XhWToOYoUN7ZfIlTknVYWJbBfe+n3mzhOYEySAjtxweP0qaswBWnEuUw\nVKxS8u+cvw3ElwHCIiUzJ4heGSOe336P+NddDDYOhgQ5IOLINLhT4NGakssc9W1P\n+MaBq/5we8774+GLbKQi2WxElmD9wN4x/jBkeAurkQHFgjwJ+MqU3p5fpkEMyQXy\nRliOIinWqW/cfw43+itERqEfmOwVXpHFQL85PtgmF3Om97BxpHvRb0A6HmTh