repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AhmedElBanna80/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AhmedElBanna80/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AhmedElBanna80","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cloudflare/vinext/commits/78a29cdb9411fcb3ee9e617d52a1ed2e997301a2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T14:52:37Z","email":"111243485+AhmedElBanna80@users.noreply.github.com","name":"AhmedElBanna80"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T14:52:37Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(pages): pass the original data URL as req.url in the Worker request stage (#3472)\n\n* fix(pages): pass the original data URL as req.url in the Worker request stage\n\nFor `/_next/data/<buildId>/<page>.json` requests, the Worker/Nitro request\nstage replaced the request with the normalized page URL before dispatching\nthe response stage, and did not forward the pre-normalization URL. Pages\n`req.url` (in `_app.getInitialProps` and `getServerSideProps`) was therefore\n`/<page>` instead of the data URL. prod-server already passes it as\n`originalUrl`, and Next.js exposes the original URL.\n\nForward the pathname + search from before data normalization as\n`renderOptions.originalUrl` for data requests. The value is fully determined\nby the stage URL, build ID and `isDataReq`, so it does not change the shared\nresponse-stage cache partitioning.\n\n* test(pages): cover the original data URL as req.url on Workers\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: James <james@eli.cx>","tree":{"sha":"36705184e1a79ede9ba2398f2dc3f386baf816ff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cloudflare/vinext/git/trees/36705184e1a79ede9ba2398f2dc3f386baf816ff"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cloudflare/vinext/git/commits/78a29cdb9411fcb3ee9e617d52a1ed2e997301a2","verification":{"payload":"tree 36705184e1a79ede9ba2398f2dc3f386baf816ff\nparent 8aecbe322ad9fed7e1f954c6d873a8181e7d764c\nauthor AhmedElBanna80 <111243485+AhmedElBanna80@users.noreply.github.com> 1791298357 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791298357 +0100\n\nfix(pages): pass the original data URL as req.url in the Worker request stage (#3472)\n\n* fix(pages): pass the original data URL as req.url in the Worker request stage\n\nFor `/_next/data/<buildId>/<page>.json` requests, the Worker/Nitro request\nstage replaced the request with the normalized page URL before dispatching\nthe response stage, and did not forward the pre-normalization URL. Pages\n`req.url` (in `_app.getInitialProps` and `getServerSideProps`) was therefore\n`/<page>` instead of the data URL. prod-server already passes it as\n`originalUrl`, and Next.js exposes the original URL.\n\nForward the pathname + search from before data normalization as\n`renderOptions.originalUrl` for data requests. The value is fully determined\nby the stage URL, build ID and `isDataReq`, so it does not change the shared\nresponse-stage cache partitioning.\n\n* test(pages): cover the original data URL as req.url on Workers\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: James <james@eli.cx>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxQs1CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAzokQAKNNk7XgvLPXa0CuYa9KUhs9\nJ4aF4kJGXr461JAjk/MYTso2QJJOXE3mibouHFjPHT3ksH5M1VX2FWZDPxSkZwQq\nwAtwrLpmkbTTtaCHFG3C3QV3Bwqocp4bJSqixdPTiO93zdOJwcMiPjuce5Yqx/zV\nyXO013JXkE+36T4l1jhwhi3kxdIijYdWjPj680T3N5dMt68FUxsm8m5rq7CSm+7I\nm9etRJlQOysw/frGJCz/wQAat318Ey1GBJAEgs3JFN5g4JCtZZZSk66CJC6wdwB0\nsydvdULGovvc+K2k18ND13FQfMd2xlK/mZh8uBaKNFjipLaUsFnEYxRjcsd4XsfU\nAkwR1vW5BIDGUKlHI1SR/3XdZlzac20tAIxwwmAz1sQc4P1If/2IqGroKwNGocxM\naOuh8+G3IK5W1t3nE0brsC746mvebFvjjbXIU1Dwa3ShPgagSJ7HYlNzu+CClHaW\n6sFn4ejJ9EJJij8ZDQ6pHlOesiaRZJxsZkOXiaCIi9GnsGoiPSJhlt1etowmHznv\noyPpc1jzV78ZI9Plj+p9bbpHG1nl/m45nvuzYmJMA5meG2t1M4sIoLjLJgtfe/tA\nq5I1bZOtruVf79jJ7ulqCW6Uf0WGCJlTgFHlZJ4BbmLCgzxdWaAjSCvJ3kJTP+us\nMRjJ1CH2UUK87u8E1H5u\n=YAoq\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE