ic"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cloudflare/vinext/commit/8aecbe322ad9fed7e1f954c6d873a8181e7d764c","node_id":"C_kwDORXYnQNoAKDhhZWNiZTMyMmFkOWZlZDdlMWY5NTRjNmQ4NzNhODE4MWU3ZDc2NGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cloudflare/vinext/commit/f6963308742d6d209a3a7bd10cc797c8b66be080","sha":"f6963308742d6d209a3a7bd10cc797c8b66be080","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cloudflare/vinext/commits/f6963308742d6d209a3a7bd10cc797c8b66be080"}],"sha":"8aecbe322ad9fed7e1f954c6d873a8181e7d764c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cloudflare/vinext/commits/8aecbe322ad9fed7e1f954c6d873a8181e7d764c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10815538?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/james-elicx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/james-elicx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/james-elicx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/james-elicx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/james-elicx","id":10815538,"login":"james-elicx","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwODE1NTM4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/james-elicx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/james-elicx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/james-elicx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/james-elicx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/james-elicx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/james-elicx","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cloudflare/vinext/commits/f6963308742d6d209a3a7bd10cc797c8b66be080/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T11:51:28Z","email":"james@eli.cx","name":"James Anderson"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T11:51:28Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"perf(web): index and rewrite slow D1 dashboard queries (#3724)\n\n- Index performance_measurements.profile_object_key so the hourly profile\n  sweep and profile-object deletes stop scanning every measurement (31.8s on\n  D1, hitting the 30s query limit).\n- Index pull-request runs by base_sha.\n- Compat trend: replace the out-of-scope VALUES CTE join with a NOT IN flag\n  (4.67M -> 753k rows read, 626 -> 398ms).\n- Compat latest files: keep SQLite on the run_id index (372 -> 5ms).\n- Perf commit lookups use the (kind, commit_sha) index; the run list stops\n  selecting legacy flame_graph_json blobs.","tree":{"sha":"5d12acb58cbc9c981eb25e09551f0429eefe0a20","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cloudflare/vinext/git/trees/5d12acb58cbc9c981eb25e09551f0429eefe0a20"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cloudflare/vinext/git/commits/f6963308742d6d209a3a7bd10cc797c8b66be080","verification":{"payload":"tree 5d12acb58cbc9c981eb25e09551f0429eefe0a20\nparent f11606d2ada429dbb014f6751fb7381c97e57670\nauthor James Anderson <james@eli.cx> 1791287488 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791287488 +0100\n\nperf(web): index and rewrite slow D1 dashboard queries (#3724)\n\n- Index performance_measurements.profile_object_key so the hourly profile\n  sweep and profile-object deletes stop scanning every measurement (31.8s on\n  D1, hitting the 30s query limit).\n- Index pull-request runs by base_sha.\n- Compat trend: replace the out-of-scope VALUES CTE join with a NOT IN flag\n  (4.67M -> 753k rows read, 626 -> 398ms).\n- Compat latest files: keep SQLite on the run_id index (372 -> 5ms).\n- Perf commit lookups use the (kind, commit_sha) index; the run list stops\n  selecting legacy flame_graph_json blobs.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxODACRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAdd0QAGja0SjjpBBaWXEkJj/JJHts\nOMOtyVGIA6+zgG1dwjPzvK/GuZr75T8LrfeWq5sBecsuFuo8vcRNERcX0pRK/X1j\nb2WbZsqDZTWnRj78aF4l1tZhf+CEu065NiP1oiLDQfSu+DcckhJMtoDkjkm/HGuR\nmWwOdFs9Mg9qgZ3zA5Op3s1/hHKgNhDLYvv09LO9Fv8pyfBAOXYOfhyZDFgVRMGQ\nDhTX/NZwWajoY8PdjaB6wwQ5VMIsp