://api.github.com/repos/cloudflare/vinext/commits/f6963308742d6d209a3a7bd10cc797c8b66be080"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10815538?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/james-elicx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/james-elicx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/james-elicx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/james-elicx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/james-elicx","id":10815538,"login":"james-elicx","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwODE1NTM4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/james-elicx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/james-elicx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/james-elicx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/james-elicx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/james-elicx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/james-elicx","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cloudflare/vinext/commits/f11606d2ada429dbb014f6751fb7381c97e57670/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T11:15:27Z","email":"james@eli.cx","name":"James Anderson"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T11:15:27Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"chore(perf): add a large Pages Router dev cold start scenario (#3715)\n\n* chore(perf): add a large Pages Router dev cold start scenario\n\nThe existing dev cold start uses a 33-route App Router app with no\npackages. This adds a generated Pages Router app with 40 local packages\nlinked through node_modules and imported through barrel files (3,200\ncomponents, 800 CSS modules, 30 pages). It is measured with Next.js\nTurbopack, Next.js webpack and vinext.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* chore(perf): correct the component count in the scenario description\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* chore(perf): give each large Pages Router copy its own tsconfig\n\nThe Next.js copy took the vinext tsconfig, which Next.js rewrites on the\nfirst dev start and which references vinext/types. Repeated random picks\nin a page are now dropped so they can never become duplicate imports;\nthe generated sources are unchanged.\n\n* 1 actionable finding posted\n\nCo-authored-by: james-elicx <james-elicx@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* chore: revert unrelated pnpm-lock.yaml whitespace churn\n\nThis reverts commit f75900dea014b205f8e22388373a59dc6767922d.\n\n* chore(perf): resolve large Pages Router paths with fileURLToPath\n\nURL.pathname stays percent-encoded, so a checkout path with spaces\nresolved to the wrong benchmark root and Turbopack root.\n\n* 1 finding; prior path issue fixed\n\nCo-authored-by: james-elicx <james-elicx@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Revert \"1 finding; prior path issue fixed\"\n\nThis reverts commit 513a65e1d6c6895af605dba5290edabf877d38cd.\n\n* chore(perf): let the accepted cold-start request run to the deadline\n\nEach fetch was aborted after 2 s, shorter than the large Pages Router\napp''s first compile, so a sample measured a chain of cancelled,\noverlapping requests rather than one cold request. Connection refusals\nbefore the server listens still fail fast and retry.\n\n* 1 resolved, 1 new finding\n\nCo-authored-by: james-elicx <james-elicx@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Revert \"1 resolved, 1 new finding\"\n\nThis reverts commit 6a5182364155647754bdd95d6a4d1330bcf5bbb4.\n\n* chore(perf): link large Pages Router dependencies as junctions on Windows\n\nDirectory symlinks need elevated rights on Windows; junctions do not.\nOther platforms ignore the link type.\n\n* 1 resolved, none open. LGTM!\n\nCo-authored-by: james-elicx <james-elicx@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Revert \"1 resolved, none open. LGTM!\"\n\nThis reverts commit 313b169efecef164b734ed6ad9399d816abeba76.\n\n* perf(bench): drop the webpack large-app pairing and run the large scenario for 3 rounds\n\nEach large Pages Router sample takes 22-28 s, so six paired rounds per\nimplementation plus the paired webpack comparison made the perf job take\nover 20 minutes. Keep Turbopack as the Next.js reference and let a\nscenario lower its own round count.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Jan Nicklas <j.nicklas@me.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nCo-authored-by: ask-bonk[bot] <ask-bonk[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: james-elicx <james-elicx@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"100c7ebbdef274c358a6c5ef9b60ce52b1408118","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cloudflare/vinext/git/trees/100c7ebbdef274c358a6c5ef9b60ce52b1408118"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cloudflare/vinext/git/commits/f11606d2ada429dbb014f6751fb7381c97e57670","verification":{"payload":"tree 100c7ebbdef274c358a6c5ef9b60ce52b1408118\nparent 290e630df89fdeb8f9e50b80e0c06d96fb5f3c48\nauthor James Anderson <james@eli.cx> 1791285327 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791285327 +0100\n\nchore(perf): add a large Pages Router dev cold start scenario (#3715)\n\n* chore(perf): add a large Pages Router dev cold start scenario\n\nThe existing dev cold start uses a 33-route App Router app with no\npackages. This adds a generated Pages Router app with 40 local packages\nlinked through node_modules and imported through barrel files (3,200\ncomponents, 800 CSS modules, 30 pages). It is measured with Next.js\nTurbopack, Next.js webpack and vinext.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* chore(perf): correct the component count in the scenario description\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* chore(perf): give each large Pages Router copy its own tsconfig\n\nThe Next.js copy took the vinext tsconfig, which Next.js rewrites on the\nfirst dev start and which references vinext/types. Repeated random picks\nin a page are now dropped so they can never become duplicate imports;\nthe generated sources are unchanged.\n\n* 1 actionable finding posted\n\nCo-authored-by: james-elicx <james-elicx@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* chore: revert unrelated pnpm-lock.yaml whitespace churn\n\nThis reverts commit f75900dea014b205f8e22388373a59dc6767922d.\n\n* chore(perf): resolve large Pages Router paths with fileURLToPath\n\nURL.pathname stays percent-encoded, so a checkout path with spaces\nresolved to the wrong benchmark root and Turbopack root.\n\n* 1 finding; prior path issue fixed\n\nCo-authored-by: james-elicx <james-elicx@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Revert \"1 finding; prior path issue fixed\"\n\nThis reverts commit 513a65e1d6c6895af605dba5290edabf877d38cd.\n\n* chore(perf): let the accepted cold-start request run to the deadline\n\nEach fetch was aborted after 2 s, shorter than the large Pages Router\napp''s first compile, so a sample measured a chain of cancelled,\noverlapping requests rather than one cold request. Connection refusals\nbefore the server listens still fail fast and retry.\n\n* 1 resolved, 1 new finding\n\nCo-authored-by: james-elicx <james-elicx@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Revert \"1 resolved, 1 new finding\"\n\nThis reverts commit 6a5182364155647754bdd95d6a4d1330bcf5bbb4.\n\n* chore(perf): link large Pages Router dependencies as junctions on Windows\n\nDirectory symlinks need elevated rights on Windows; junctions do not.\nOther platforms ignore the link type.\n\n* 1 resolved, none open. LGTM!\n\nCo-authored-by: james-elicx <james-elicx@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Revert \"1 resolved, none open. LGTM!\"\n\nThis reverts commit 313b169efecef164b734ed6ad9399d816abeba76.\n\n* perf(bench): drop the webpack large-app pairing and run the large scenario for 3 rounds\n\nEach large Pages Router sample takes 22-28 s, so six paired rounds per\nimplementation plus the paired webpack comparison made the perf job take\nover 20 minutes. Keep Turbopack as the Next.js reference and let a\nscenario lower its own round count.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Jan Nicklas <j.nicklas@me.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nCo-authored-by: ask-bonk[bot] <ask-bonk[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: james-elicx <james-elicx@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxNhPCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAPykQAIDOi7YAWvAUbWFBnrhTlNha\nlFO9Gw+bfprKFqXBUuUl1aZ562VNv+HX1oIu4KUrYmYJws5jWGitfmgTXeRNIRlq\n35Hc1ivPAHUWwgcABsLQfZZ6/Zw6NXduHaNQ8GWWicGwXMx2VGn74bwcYvJr0309\nCiw7cQAbR2LW6AzUfieUm7vhdHU8+WAm6lVe/MbcsHIdWOMNH/OS69MF5uaNIfdG\nMKllRLGTikXiATC2iPlmplpuCgVFhdtNuAxuOS494i3x/gUw92Fy1Qd/iopJFwcX\nlP3tRNG/MC5POK0EvHKojTtzx2/ZlzZXXVAnG40RXN5OjKHCd9ePhpENLADCdgiz\nhOouX7oGFDcoX990LP95gsH5UzD5ugAgiyULl6mDrfijDI86Fo383fQQm53OjLaV\njnUEUs7n1ZvNsHSl3JB/N+JE0FEnKfpqAD3zBAxhmfHFmsit+x7RX7xOGte8xDZS\neS7Kd3ZjvAfv+u8Yh2WQylSrkv9hoadQHWbQUT0FqJtuS3IWTHyJhTZEtbP2a4BU\nv4X/SuFtwVpISR94myylhlhBCdEm1lacEXYGy2e4tl2Xn0sMOWLeqt6PK4yyP/0P\n09jI3GYZ1bCZVRmmUkKyiJ0AsBb3NQvqEPvI/6yE567seyYzMIO7S8r8YBltiA9y\nmpNx7CrghtP5m3Fk58xo\n=gRMj\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-06T11:15:27Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions