o e2e\n\n* test(nitro): match exact Set-Cookie values in the Nitro e2e","tree":{"sha":"dfb6bd329a5ef2b9183061c1477d9619108c9245","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cloudflare/vinext/git/trees/dfb6bd329a5ef2b9183061c1477d9619108c9245"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cloudflare/vinext/git/commits/175b92f5a3658138d063970710c760344f6635e9","verification":{"payload":"tree dfb6bd329a5ef2b9183061c1477d9619108c9245\nparent 4faf3ce8428fd96913fd4553c00d697288b821e3\nauthor James Anderson <james@eli.cx> 1790847118 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790847118 +0100\n\ntest(nitro): cover middleware, navigation, server actions and route handlers (#3647)\n\n* test(nitro): cover middleware, navigation, server actions and route handlers in the Nitro e2e\n\n* test(nitro): match exact Set-Cookie values in the Nitro e2e","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqviiOCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAV20QAGD5oouisKsWDXhwG4ny25NC\n1GQkWcLKibqWaM1cy2bAyKL81u5AX68q9sXEB2IUmiHjBPctEyg57NtAk9xHvt63\nlFuMIyYbzj6WnIuAe5AZG51uRHjlaoiWQx+WAlpey832epSV1r7pFO1re8+Ua3HB\nmxI+R8a3p0XdI2Y+mj1jMeCFcHkibKj9YjfmrD5mt8GoJAiCa8tRqfHHWpUBUuN0\nU9dSEr1QXBuab9ZnMw7sek7mfjIztTBSxPiWy1bXqeMKFT4u8mY4i3kyDFJ0BfmG\n5YFsv6EwCrbfOotFOX7lB398aPFPMt9Z5jy3FNiCv00eupZr5oa8erHS+yXeT5Lr\njKccsPCkep5DZ4UMK/ZcpQq51wUuw4v1I6m0mzrjb7VUoWIqndiZLB3phk0c6DmP\nV2NGymSEvDmCNSUjoylNWBhWGoLOrOc7RGg1l73cRlvkCI7/CJN06xf32CIf0fne\n2A0q6/G6Ef58cRymQ78CCOErqRYLs2SNUgo4Ui7gfXEe3BqvODjVLNRDxZuIBnvA\nSdU6u5tGB6S4ZVSn3SyQgurbfkV76W8kKJ4dEkyLInmT5oWFpO59zia0bBeEnCoE\nav5NWqSdwu/xfOiM9M5JWmUrSsL82E3INXu/77MuCxNKsTPkj/fZGovHqU4A2rYY\nIIRVtIokfQBVVPotSJQl\n=yB6A\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-01T09:31:59Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web