udflare/vinext/commits/4faf3ce8428fd96913fd4553c00d697288b821e3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/179739256?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SammyTourani/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SammyTourani/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SammyTourani/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SammyTourani/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SammyTourani","id":179739256,"login":"SammyTourani","node_id":"U_kgDOCraaeA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SammyTourani/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SammyTourani/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SammyTourani/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SammyTourani/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SammyTourani/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SammyTourani","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cloudflare/vinext/commits/531696cb9ac469d38fe3999da17e03a689e2674d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T09:09:12Z","email":"sammytourani@gmail.com","name":"Sammy Tourani"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T09:09:12Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(nitro): serve App Router apps in Nitro dev and preview (#3608)\n\n* fix(nitro): disable plugin-rsc''s server handler in dev and preview\n\nNitro replaces the rsc dev environment with its own environment, which has\nno module runner, and serves requests through its dev worker.\n@vitejs/plugin-rsc''s server handler still ran for requests Nitro passed on\n(for example /favicon.ico or a missing image) and failed in\nenvironment.runner.import() with a 500. In `vite preview` it imported\ndist/server/index.js, which a Nitro build never writes, so the preview\nserver did not start.\n\nvinext registers rsc() for the user, so pass `serverHandler: false` through\n`config.rsc` when Nitro is present. Nitro''s Vite RSC example sets the same\noption, and @cloudflare/vite-plugin passes it the same way.\n\n* test(nitro): add dev and preview e2e against examples/app-router-nitro\n\n* test(nitro): replace the stand-in integration test with the fixture e2e\n\n* fix(nitro): keep next in Vite''s pipeline in Nitro dev environments\n\nNitro leaves the rsc and ssr dev environments with plugin-rsc''s noExternal\nlist, so Vite externalized next/navigation and next/error before vinext''s\nresolveId hook could shim them whenever next was installed.\n\n* test(nitro): wait for the document, not remote images, before hydration\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: James <james@eli.cx>","tree":{"sha":"452d63c046c3852a51a6cfb93e25af5f0a69f801","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cloudflare/vinext/git/trees/452d63c046c3852a51a6cfb93e25af5f0a69f801"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cloudflare/vinext/git/commits/531696cb9ac469d38fe3999da17e03a689e2674d","verification":{"payload":"tree 452d63c046c3852a51a6cfb93e25af5f0a69f801\nparent 0589467e240ebc9852a61529f446809619d0ebe6\nauthor Sammy Tourani <sammytourani@gmail.com> 1790845752 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790845752 +0100\n\nfix(nitro): serve App Router apps in Nitro dev and preview (#3608)\n\n* fix(nitro): disable plugin-rsc''s server handler in dev and preview\n\nNitro replaces the rsc dev environment with its own environment, which has\nno module runner, and serves requests through its dev worker.\n@vitejs/plugin-rsc''s server handler still ran for requests Nitro passed on\n(for example /favicon.ico or a missing image) and failed in\nenvironment.runner.import() with a 500. In `vite preview` it imported\ndist/server/index.js, which a Nitro build never writes, so the preview\nserver did not start.\n\nvinext registers rsc() for the user, so pass `serverHandler: false` through\n`config.rsc` when Nitro is present. Nitro''s Vite RSC example sets the same\noption, and @cloudflare/vite-plugin passes it the same way.\n\n* test(nitro): add dev and preview e2e against examples/app-router-nitro\n\n* test(nitro): replace the stand-in integration test with the fixture e2e\n\n* fix(nitro): keep next in Vite''s pipeline in Nitro dev environments\n\nNitro leaves the rsc and ssr dev environments with plugin-rsc''s noExternal\nlist, so Vite externalized next/navigation and next/error before vinext''s\nresolveId hook could shim them whenever next was installed.\n\n* test(nitro): wait for the document, not remote images, before hydration\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: James <james@eli.cx>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqviM4CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAj3YQAD6aGgOKoQV9eMggtZzeMpv7\nFsIjkAHGJyxb9BtUjUD21QPZWo63XH8QKekTwPL3yGxXAzOj6LGZZh3J5z6SKQbT\nKx+aFqZpbO4XC/RX4r6USTzWVCC7iEybBSmgxdeiALl0BhQs37bc8xfTwjGTnuQu\nunEIVgEjZuWlrOqEKcS4MyVdy/VwDz0RAJjbjRc0uy+zQUZlicSZsfCiDoRg8dZw\nk4SUrAVLsJO6+0qMR/0FOqUnIg0HVboEZmdCBjYhVC2sUJwDqTTuRGThm5vNjsvW\nVOu2KwuKjquSAXlJiAOheBO0c7aeI47rluWOhhxRxtGN0QBE2UV8DFvmocKEOr5/\nLaISTyriB8LH2yq8WchngWflcc/in+PqBMV+XusCIXWlOxHvLLrzEyTOfzUv8Ttx\nfahM0vuFxnWKilvOHUHe5PdsJBs3nF74wm0+4RmoYoUT57KdAqo2kBCxtagg1KCR\nkZOSVnKfr979KhMciBnSz+u2moTjyrpwPzSsHs1HRuSaCBrGdMhTu1mKAUOk4Tmw\nYjsqBBT1gOAs66itjmAM1qKVrkTcZIjF0jmJ0Cd40xyD60d27YQNNTZquVJT7USp\nRugKCTjrlGONwvYcdRjt6v9RRW9ynlk+psvDBUYFNFOHmHhlJwrZjVgW0sRY2g3x\n6XcbWOQKTFCtBG0D5azL\n=BAQN\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-01T09:09:13Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":198