/james-elicx","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cloudflare/vinext/commits/4a753b1321e99dec82473ce81b51c2bd607c5d89/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T22:12:56Z","email":"james@eli.cx","name":"James Anderson"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T22:12:56Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"perf(build): skip vite-plugin-commonjs for modules it never rewrites (#3594)\n\n* perf(build): skip vite-plugin-commonjs for modules it never rewrites\n\nvite-plugin-commonjs strips comments from every module with a regex and\noften parses it with acorn before it consults its filter. Apply the same\nfilter decision in vinext''s wrapper first, then skip modules that contain\nno require call and no member access on module/exports, which are the\nonly constructs its analyzer rewrites.\n\n* perf(build): filter vite-plugin-commonjs transforms natively\n\nMove the CommonJS syntax prefilter into the transform hook''s code filter so\nskipped modules never cross into JavaScript, and check that a native Rolldown\nfilter selects the same modules. Also let knip resolve vite-plugin-commonjs\nfrom vinext''s install for the new test.","tree":{"sha":"22da11f8fd68524f1c6c320a95a11fd03faab93a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cloudflare/vinext/git/trees/22da11f8fd68524f1c6c320a95a11fd03faab93a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cloudflare/vinext/git/commits/4a753b1321e99dec82473ce81b51c2bd607c5d89","verification":{"payload":"tree 22da11f8fd68524f1c6c320a95a11fd03faab93a\nparent a8263b49a02b870ab5f92d839bea02008d532f1c\nauthor James Anderson <james@eli.cx> 1790806376 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790806376 +0100\n\nperf(build): skip vite-plugin-commonjs for modules it never rewrites (#3594)\n\n* perf(build): skip vite-plugin-commonjs for modules it never rewrites\n\nvite-plugin-commonjs strips comments from every module with a regex and\noften parses it with acorn before it consults its filter. Apply the same\nfilter decision in vinext''s wrapper first, then skip modules that contain\nno require call and no member access on module/exports, which are the\nonly constructs its analyzer rewrites.\n\n* perf(build): filter vite-plugin-commonjs transforms natively\n\nMove the CommonJS syntax prefilter into the transform hook''s code filter so\nskipped modules never cross into JavaScript, and check that a native Rolldown\nfilter selects the same modules. Also let knip resolve vite-plugin-commonjs\nfrom vinext''s install for the new test.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqvYloCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAvWQQAFQN3MGfGBRFu6Yb87BVbdl2\nctamQo8kxX2wjyf0J7rA50YHrJHa0LxrNx3tqfpRB5d6xQaSCF6xCiGK96zqCAsr\nHkO7N/4c1WhKCv8TH7Zc/qSHlxnmV2gbs0gDDOaMK9Fthz5iPy+pBeWqN1qyYPkp\nzppWkNUgXYze7Ufzmj3vgtOlQ5Ccv8CfUoC/f1gVqWsFkwFwshVd1hV42NufRe1K\nMCgU/nmjY0ABZAcnHuCcfuQWsH65CYwN9wcWxrQuEOBdd0M3TaCLLEJKovztR4Zl\n3soxRlHHq9C2msbBuEdSKp/tdXVhCSZl6wo+qctW/wcwOTMKJmszVepIKBCgBhkC\nx9a5CqwfBEhpJE1M7nRcRYSOXxDwRASWCFA7QXWk/mLH8iyoRY0XSWB0XO4ShqxX\nOhlGB0+eR/GzlUZoKtTQKmt2WjOLoVbvP2fnVVMgZRyD82f/YHlc/Jhl+zCg+w4i\neOxyDrtwpQXchsFBU4yWCCeOplAUdytfflQEIdxmd8iOcCQGc95a9RiKFYGkKWWh\nusmB5y8Xus3N2fXMkwVR7k790sdRlG/5ZboYAadQe5VRWu4uTl6Kw3aYiTwipZU5\nHmqyJoZZJT62Qt8NuiSCO8iL1vgf015/Yo1MUEyuGXRshXqMPit2OzWYB8fov3up\nemuYYsv5Ph9VmPQ2dXh6\n=0gWA\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-30T22:12:56Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cloudflare/vinext/commit/4a753b1321e99dec82473ce81b51c2bd607c5d89","node_id":"C_kwDORXYnQNoAKDRhNzUzYjEzMjFlOTlkZWM4MjQ3M2NlODFiNTFjMmJkNjA3YzVkODk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cloudflare/vinext/commit/a8263b49a02b870ab5f92d839bea02008d532f1c","sha":"a8263b49a02b870ab5f92d839bea02008d532f1c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cloudflare/vinext/commits/a8263b49a02b870ab5f92d839bea02008d532f1c"}],"sha":"4a753b1321e99dec82473ce81b51c2bd607c5d89","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cloudflare/vinext/commits/4a753b1321e99dec82473ce81b51c2bd607c5d89"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5855137?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ash1day/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ash1day/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ash1day/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ash1day/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ash1day","id":5855137,"login":"ash1day","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU4NTUxMzc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ash1day/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ash1day/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ash1day/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ash1day/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ash1day/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ash1day","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cloudflare/vinext/commits/a8263b49a02b870ab5f92d839bea02008d532f1c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T21:50:08Z","email":"ashida@wantedly.com","name":"Yoshihiro Ashida"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T21:50:08Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(shims): keep a Request init''s method, headers and body in NextRequest (#3612)\n\n`new NextRequest(url, request)` spread `init` to strip `nextConfig`. A Request\nkeeps method, headers and body as accessors on Request.prototype, so the spread\ncopied none of them: a rebased POST arrived as a bodyless GET without cookies\n(Auth.js''s reqWithEnvURL does exactly this). Next.js passes `init` to the\nRequest constructor unchanged; do the same when `init` is a Request. Internal\ncall sites pass plain objects and are unaffected.","tree":{"sha":"06d8cb5c3e9dce99bfc1ce73b2486cb6d1ec7db1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cloudflare/vinext/git/trees/06d8cb5c3e9dce99bfc1ce73b2486cb6d1ec7db1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cloudflare/vinext/git/commits/a8263b49a02b870ab5f92d839bea02008d532f1c","verification":{"payload":"tree 06d8cb5c3e9dce99bfc1ce73b2486cb6d1ec7db1\nparent 1365501070846f094c39b94938cfad478d4817ab\nauthor Yoshihiro Ashida <ashida@wantedly.com> 1790805008 +0900\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790805008 +0000\n\nfix(shims): keep a Request init''s method, headers and body in NextRequest (#3612)\n\n`new NextRequest(url, request)` spread `init` to strip `nextConfig`. A Request\nkeeps method, headers and body as accessors on Request.prototype, so the spread\ncopied none of them: a rebased POST arrived as a bodyless GET without cookies\n(Auth.js''s reqWithEnvURL does exactly this). Next.js passes `init` to the\nRequest constructor unchanged; do the same when `init` is a Request. Internal\ncall sites pass plain objects and are unaffected.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqvYQQCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA0CkQAD0WG1MlzgLEbhZl2HeaRP5e\n6jdwO9Mb4xlRl