606)\n\n* perf(pages): stop the export-all transform filter from backtracking\n\nThe vinext:validate-page-exports filter /\\bexport\\b[\\s\\S]*\\*/ ran on every\nmodule and backtracked quadratically on files with many exports and no\nlater `*`. Match only what hasExportAllCandidate can accept.\n\nRepro: https://github.com/jantimon/repro-vinext-slow-dev-startup-exports\n\n* test(pages): cover the validate-page-exports filter wiring and multiplication rejection\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: James <james@eli.cx>","tree":{"sha":"da06856b3df472568bfab568b9ffcabe683a3804","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cloudflare/vinext/git/trees/da06856b3df472568bfab568b9ffcabe683a3804"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cloudflare/vinext/git/commits/92927287cb992f32c4b9d9b87dd89d3dba4671ac","verification":{"payload":"tree da06856b3df472568bfab568b9ffcabe683a3804\nparent 48c00aafd3211703113ccb6bf9a773f8aee1627b\nauthor Jan Nicklas <j.nicklas@me.com> 1790803240 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790803240 +0000\n\nperf(pages): stop the export-all transform filter from backtracking (#3606)\n\n* perf(pages): stop the export-all transform filter from backtracking\n\nThe vinext:validate-page-exports filter /\\bexport\\b[\\s\\S]*\\*/ ran on every\nmodule and backtracked quadratically on files with many exports and no\nlater `*`. Match only what hasExportAllCandidate can accept.\n\nRepro: https://github.com/jantimon/repro-vinext-slow-dev-startup-exports\n\n* test(pages): cover the validate-page-exports filter wiring and multiplication rejection\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: James <james@eli.cx>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqvX0oCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAYVUQAIhG/qil/XKgnyIdiv7Klpoc\nf6VZK2+6r7jx04hnXc340KKTbYBJkFpS6dS+4ur0s2n9pPaag5UoDPUVbeoUPOGA\n3p7kNLylja6H1JCiyk1PWA2580rDZjJwlAS0yWX8fa4xjs2A5YHAwKlaClfm/vQW\nE0pRSfBDjZFd8V3Hr77APxc4kRHmk0m38cVOTfSIu2zT3fe0zL5elZdBYi3kKqqv\nulzEAro+DHGmmmTpw7scaZM+sQtOFud8haXYpU6hNX7j7U0CYP/vfLWzA