5a12609bb590cad740d21c25a5cc4eb4bc6673b","node_id":"C_kwDORXYnQNoAKDM1YTEyNjA5YmI1OTBjYWQ3NDBkMjFjMjVhNWNjNGViNGJjNjY3M2I","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cloudflare/vinext/commit/e3f0a37799c4de47d79716630ed1d1d89fb67304","sha":"e3f0a37799c4de47d79716630ed1d1d89fb67304","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cloudflare/vinext/commits/e3f0a37799c4de47d79716630ed1d1d89fb67304"}],"sha":"35a12609bb590cad740d21c25a5cc4eb4bc6673b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cloudflare/vinext/commits/35a12609bb590cad740d21c25a5cc4eb4bc6673b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10815538?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/james-elicx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/james-elicx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/james-elicx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/james-elicx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/james-elicx","id":10815538,"login":"james-elicx","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwODE1NTM4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/james-elicx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/james-elicx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/james-elicx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/james-elicx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/james-elicx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/james-elicx","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cloudflare/vinext/commits/e3f0a37799c4de47d79716630ed1d1d89fb67304/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T10:39:09Z","email":"james@eli.cx","name":"James Anderson"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T10:39:09Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"perf(build): reuse OG HarfBuzz patch and jsx-in-js transforms across passes (#3590)\n\n* perf(build): reuse OG HarfBuzz patch and jsx-in-js transforms across passes\n\nEach server environment transforms modules in both the plugin-rsc scan and\nthe real build, and several environments often transform the same module.\nThe @vercel/og HarfBuzz patch (a full AST walk over the OG bundle) and the\nvinext:jsx-in-js oxc transform were recomputed every time.\n\nMemoize both with createTransformCache, keyed by id and full source. The\nHarfBuzz cache is build-only and also keyed by the callback module\ndirectory; dev keeps recomputing so missing callback modules are rewritten.\njsx-in-js passes fixed options and no tsconfig, so its output depends only on\nid and source and is shared in dev too.\n\n* test(og): cover per-environment sourcemap omission with a shared HarfBuzz patch\n\nAlso note in the handler why caching a compute that reads hb.wasm and\nwrites callback modules is safe in a build.\n\n* test(og): split HarfBuzz cache test and cut dev recomputations","tree":{"sha":"28b631c456aac1b88b0a77dcf129ea84c777f0d0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cloudflare/vinext/git/trees/28b631c456aac1b88b0a77dcf129ea84c777f0d0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cloudflare/vinext/git/commits/e3f0a37799c4de47d79716630ed1d1d89fb67304","verification":{"payload":"tree 28b631c456aac1b88b0a77dcf129ea84c777f0d0\nparent ae760c509d52872134a379897741b131616ba77f\nauthor James Anderson <james@eli.cx> 1790764749 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790764749 +0100\n\nperf(build): reuse OG HarfBuzz patch and jsx-in-js transforms across passes (#3590)\n\n* perf(build): reuse OG HarfBuzz patch and jsx-in-js transforms across passes\n\nEach server environment transforms modules in both the plugin-rsc scan and\nthe real build, and several environments often transform the same module.\nThe @vercel/og HarfBuzz patch (a full AST walk over the OG bundle) and the\nvinext:jsx-in-js oxc transform were recomputed every time.\n\nMemoize both with createTransformCache, keyed by id and full source. The\nHarfBuzz cache is build-only and also keyed by the callback module\ndirectory; dev keeps recomputing so missing callback modules are rewritten.\njsx-in-js passes fixed options and no tsconfig, so its output depends only on\nid and source and is shared in dev too.\n\n* test(og): cover per-environment sourcemap omission with a shared HarfBuzz patch\n\nAlso note in the handler why caching a compute that reads hb.wasm and\nwrites callback modules is safe in a build.\n\n* test(og): split HarfBuzz cache test and cut dev recomputations","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqvObNCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA5bwQAJDnU3m3snYhlPzqDjAUpwKB\n4wGvx/NXjgLAHWdDn3w0bf7+inPdLPWQzE0i7xe2V1vK+I9ZL1TOa0yN3JO+hHCq\np0Z7OB6C+dmnFrmKAyh7BGbmyc2eO0zqhQ5AbWx5EnDrD7K31wQG4ViCzmMBBtES\nPYbStkAdW4uTDZvTSupChR3fCRTTPPqxnbfAEqxJWeUTYPoVh7VOvpadu3RyTrmt\nfpyxIVXt0tJlQVpOFt4vs9+prMRY20HHiu602bhHl0ZPDUCOQITbKPA7CNFyNhJC\nmeu3kk5MJTgIWCufQKYfqBgAfFZS2YZY11ZVB3n0tCebjzAef1hPi3Ci1ntGkR+o\n385gwUW7+5IM9tacnjGyVeblMBoqSa5+/lPSl/LbwSQqIUeWYlXCcHlE+6yC4vPl\npH1AKkh9w9LSEdYMF72PRYyzGgzUKANtSR6LbAbsEGmlpDwozYHT6wjLVDHuTzAd\n/eWhZtT+qqC3nJTuKFZlEF8kEFQh3RtaAZGktwUdCiCYAWyjQRjfUeC6/z18Chpd\nKY2zYod+Cof1uTQxROPHykUNeuQGunHcq1q3GGAcuyPvplxha7lVbkjQD4tbaA4U\nbAZsgKgUxW1u5D3Flu05F9rOBbXy6oR1Ih/nPHqzaR3Ngop5fMP9sxYCvCF2U8pM\n8cVlBPxGJibnzKEjV8UR\n=v3fc\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-30T10:39:10Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cloudflare/vinext/commit/e3f0a37799c4de47d79716630ed1d1d89fb67304","node_id":"C_kwDORXYnQNoAKGUzZjBhMzc3OTljNGRlNDdkNzk3MTY2MzBlZDFkMWQ4OWZiNjczMDQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cloudflare/vinext/commit/ae760c509d52872134a379897741b131616ba77f","sha":"ae760c509d52872134a379897741b131616ba77f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cloudflare/vinext/commits/ae760c509d52872134a379897741b131616ba77f"}],"sha":"e3f0a37799c4de47d79716630ed1d1d89fb67304","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cloudflare/vinext/commits/e3f0a37799c4de47d79716630ed1d1d89fb67304"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10815538?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/james-elicx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/james-elicx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/james-elicx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/james-elicx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/james-elicx","id":10815538,"login":"james-elicx","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwODE1NTM4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/james-elicx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/james-elicx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/james-elicx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/james-elicx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/james-elicx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/james-elicx","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cloudflare/vinext/commits/ae760c509d52872134a379897741b131616ba77f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T10:35:42Z","email":"james@eli.cx","name":"James Anderson"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T10:35:42Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"perf(build): skip stylesheet processing in RSC scan builds (#3589)\n\n* perf(build): skip stylesheet processing in RSC scan builds\n\n@vitejs/plugin-rsc discovers client and server references with two\nwrite-less scan builds whose output is discarded, and rsc:scan-strip\nreduces every module to its import specifiers. A stylesheet cannot\ncontribute a JavaScript import, but every stylesheet still ran through\nPostCSS/Tailwind/Sass in both scans.\n\nAdd vinext:scan-build-css, a pre-ordered transform that empties\nstylesheet sources while plugin-rsc''s manager reports a scan build and\nthe environment is not writing output. It matches the same ids as Vite''s\nvite:css transform (so ?url, ?raw and worker imports, which load as\nJavaScript, are untouched) and skips \\0 virtual modules. Real builds and\ndev are unchanged.\n\n* test(build): cover ?inline and ?url CSS in scan-build-css integration test\n\nAlso use the repo''s \\0 form for the virtual module regex.","tree":{"sha":"a80ff134252de46a900e62cbdf0508246e16d58c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cloudflare/vinext/git/trees/a80ff134252de46a900e62cbdf0508246e16d58c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cloudflare/vinext/git/commits/ae760c509d52872134a379897741b131616ba77f","verification":{"payload":"tree a80ff134252de46a900e62cbdf0508246e16d58c\nparent 6bb8f580019eb95a1671a7bc92feddfec21375b1\nauthor James Anderson <james@eli.cx> 1790764542 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790764542 +0100\n\nperf(build): skip stylesheet processing in RSC scan builds (#3589)\n\n* perf(build): skip stylesheet processing in RSC scan builds\n\n@vitejs/plugin-rsc discovers client and server references with two\nwrite-less scan builds whose output is discarded, and rsc:scan-strip\nreduces every module to its import specifiers. A stylesheet cannot\ncontribute a JavaScript import, but every stylesheet still ran through\nPostCSS/Tailwind/Sass in both scans.\n\nAdd vinext:scan-build-css, a pre-ordered transform that empties\nstylesheet sources while plugin-rsc''s manager reports a scan build and\nthe environment is not writing output. It matches the same ids as Vite''s\nvite:css transform (so ?url, ?raw and worker imports, which load as\nJavaScript, are untouched) and skips \\0 virtual modules. Real builds and\ndev are unchanged.\n\n* test(build): cover ?inline and ?url CSS in scan-build-css integration test\n\nAlso use the repo''s \\0 form for the virtual module regex.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqvOX+CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAygMQAH4HTAis2Ob7ODt3Tm/+XmHD\nzsCYXn8HyfhKvX0GnUN1DE+ON62kLdnZAHhtvC1lB9b9YajZxuZGQEiWfFc6Cw9x\n6wwVvM28qT6HlTXZmJqwhLf4C5HyKcSr4ElKDTqUne0c37/hNb4BWT/8wZNzLtzi\nffTSpHwhqyv/zckvccenAlWhK94gcU8+aM03vDc9aQXFuvXo7YVpYLVetp4mFfTL\nblsXt620qu20sfv0K0wcfxYGOKyTEGuYkdK9XHFG1nkQQjk49X594k+ZuMBJkBu5\nAh3gvOc7HMc06rujosLwpYXZyD0Iu+qr8n3fPrQyq1YzyQXMtA4aXdGV5dacklIO\nxX4mErhQmRDCn/MgSinq6fJADcE37oUaX4bxQrTrtj/sr1iCom9xQjWE3dTE4R57\nbb3x7zCKpDhyNlo5d6Yo+E7q7vjowGQBDcJTI27z2L4BZnhwMKyuxrJqqOaLSjZR\nSFBDpVGLS7S9nrK5G6mMXFhU/2xy4Uq/LnJ9IJyTu50IZGod0aAA46x/3K5l8XNr\nCukevMezYhn0NHzmLLwFEspjutHZSYC5wMoPtsxsebNdosC0yBfxv/p9s/Dvy8Gh\nXAC4Iq6hDA18Y157i8DogPS/Y1xKKf3BuWfDPPCMg07u9Q1CCA40GPDTu+WEOsQc\nFSupi7+YBMR0NeVv7LAr\n=yDNz\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-30T10:35:43Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cloudflare/vinext/commit/ae760c509d52872134a379897741b131616ba77f","node_id":"C_kwDORXYnQNoAKGFlNzYwYzUwOWQ1Mjg3MjEzNGEzNzk4OTc3NDFiMTMxNjE2YmE3N2Y","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cloudflare/vinext/commit/6bb8f580019eb95a1671a7bc92feddfec21375b1","sha":"6bb8f580019eb95a1671a7bc92feddfec21375b1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cloudflare/vinext/commits/6bb8f580019eb95a1671a7bc92feddfec21375b1"}],"sha":"ae760c509d52872134a379897741b131616ba77f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cloudflare/vinext/commits/ae760c509d52872134a379897741b131616ba77f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10815538?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/james-elicx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/james-elicx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/james-elicx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/james-elicx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/james-elicx","id":10815538,"login":"james-elicx","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwODE1NTM4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/james-elicx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/james-elicx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/james-elicx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/james-elicx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/james-elicx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/james-elicx","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cloudflare/vinext/commits/6bb8f580019eb95a1671a7bc92feddfec21375b1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T10:32:33Z","email":"james@eli.cx","name":"James Anderson"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T10:32:33Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"perf(og): speed up OG asset readFileSync scan and package-root lookups (#3588)\n\n* perf(og): speed up OG asset readFileSync scan and package-root lookups\n\nvinext:og-inline-fetch-assets matched\n/[a-zA-Z_$][a-zA-Z0-9_$]*\\.readFileSync\\(.../g over every module that\ncontains \"readFileSync(\". The regex retries the identifier prefix at every\nidentifier character, which is slow on large bundles such as typescript.js.\nFind `.readFileSync(` with indexOf, recover the identifier by scanning\nbackwards, and match the rest with a hoisted sticky regex. The matches are\nthe same, in the same order, as the original regex.\n\nOgAssetOwnership.recordResolvedImport repeated the realpath and\npackage.json walk for every resolved import of a tracked dependency, though\nthe same import recurs across many importers. Memoise the lookup by\nspecifier and resolved id, cleared with the linked package roots in reset()\nand on configure().\n\n* test(og): make package-root memo test start from a cached miss","tree":{"sha":"8de326e4e9029966e6c0cd71965a003cdb9af8d3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cloudflare/vinext/git/trees/8de326e4e9029966e6c0cd71965a003cdb9af8d3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cloudflare/vinext/git/commits/6bb8f580019eb95a1671a7bc92feddfec21375b1","verification":{"payload":"tree 8de326e4e9029966e6c0cd71965a003cdb9af8d3\nparent 149c319cb202cdeaade73718b8bcbdb650989b15\nauthor James Anderson <james@eli.cx> 1790764353 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790764353 +0100\n\nperf(og): speed up OG asset readFileSync scan and package-root lookups (#3588)\n\n* perf(og): speed up OG asset readFileSync scan and package-root lookups\n\nvinext:og-inline-fetch-assets matched\n/[a-zA-Z_$][a-zA-Z0-9_$]*\\.readFileSync\\(.../g over every module that\ncontains \"readFileSync(\". The regex retries the identifier prefix at every\nidentifier character, which is slow on large bundles such as typescript.js.\nFind `.readFileSync(` with indexOf, recover the identifier by scanning\nbackwards, and match the rest with a hoisted sticky regex. The matches are\nthe same, in the same order, as the original regex.\n\nOgAssetOwnership.recordResolvedImport repeated the realpath and\npackage.json walk for every resolved import of a tracked dependency, though\nthe same import recurs across many importers. Memoise the lookup by\nspecifier and resolved id, cleared with the linked package roots in reset()\nand on configure().\n\n* test(og): make package-root memo test start from a cached miss","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqvOVBCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA0PsQAIg5yfPB7bZutH8TFGGyJ++e\nr5j1Z9tahxLIEURemWi6gwuFp1mEBWCw6DdH6ILPffm4idmAoHrKR5ke9AQmyNZy\nt9TNW+36idkf+bmkv/N9om/wc3ZAvNmQekmDMwl5G46hkBNoouCwRWflPf9xUOWD\nd8Uk8AmAUMcaH/pzYdUuY6tCg0CQoeJaqWNDf32lo7NoHVJLjs0ofNeD6HL6MibD\nJ6KyN6ARD+sg3MMcneIxnKAaLjwcxRiNh9b7pURQTe6GKpoqLX53Pd+1Vd5+gH0g\nqH7WPRb45pMSJMGd3xALvi7ogvQGbMbSs2f5P/AE7R4tSwV5YXuIKPGPWV3ASVeg\ndby2ASn0xFiaNA5MYmBLFiC4FGSLjmts0iBDfSvNpqy07z278HTYpBYuSKZy+Ece\nVnAKo+SCegtTteL/1uHrAZ/GlnlU48SIjptJWdQbcB0t5mIS1RZRXxATy5iB6YIQ\nVQ7vr6I77FP52oKTI+1wDpPyMxRONevi+j/preqGmHDss2UHFUc94UidLpl82aBI\n0HYeN4/80BsaUM7j93mBaJK8GerX3uvvipicNmeX8IvlCahdmAyrj6l/oaCe0yMi\nhqZoTz9aZu4M7HliJNMu1I3T+P1/eci/dzFeHd0J0lAO/cO5SZaKT49tDB6/BCEc\nwUpHhWL3MYsHACwuww/L\n=NQ5D\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-30T10:32:34Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cloudflare/vinext/commit/6bb8f580019eb95a1671a7bc92feddfec21375b1","node_id":"C_kwDORXYnQNoAKDZiYjhmNTgwMDE5ZWI5NWExNjcxYTdiYzkyZmVkZGZlYzIxMzc1YjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cloudflare/vinext/commit/149c319cb202cdeaade73718b8bcbdb650989b15","sha":"149c319cb202cdeaade73718b8bcbdb650989b15","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cloudflare/vinext/commits/149c319cb202cdeaade73718b8bcbdb650989b15"}],"sha":"6bb8f580019eb95a1671a7bc92feddfec21375b1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cloudflare/vinext/commits/6bb8f580019eb95a1671a7bc92feddfec21375b1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/179739256?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SammyTourani/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SammyTourani/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SammyTourani/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SammyTourani/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SammyTourani","id":179739256,"login":"SammyTourani","node_id":"U_kgDOCraaeA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SammyTourani/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SammyTourani/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SammyTourani/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SammyTourani/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SammyTourani/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SammyTourani","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cloudflare/vinext/commits/149c319cb202cdeaade73718b8bcbdb650989b15/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T10:25:23Z","email":"sammytourani@gmail.com","name":"Sammy Tourani"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T10:25:23Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(app-router): release the refresh abort handle once supplemental requests settle (#3572)\n\nA refresh that also refetches retained parallel or intercepted branches kept\nthe navigation abort handle until React committed it. A navigation that\nsuperseded the refresh after those supplemental requests had settled aborted\nthe primary Flight body while React was still rendering it, so its pending\nchunks rejected with \"AbortError: BodyStreamBuffer was aborted\" into the\nerror boundary.\n\nRelease the handle as soon as the supplemental requests settle. They already\nstop listening to the signal at that point, so the only transport it still\nguarded was the body React reads.","tree":{"sha":"0cca33a648c651aba5960d39a0e68fde62ab389f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cloudflare/vinext/git/trees/0cca33a648c651aba5960d39a0e68fde62ab389f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cloudflare/vinext/git/commits/149c319cb202cdeaade73718b8bcbdb650989b15","verification":{"payload":"tree 0cca33a648c651aba5960d39a0e68fde62ab389f\nparent dc2947764aa316a106807b596d1b864d5471b338\nauthor Sammy Tourani <sammytourani@gmail.com> 1790763923 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790763923 +0100\n\nfix(app-router): release the refresh abort handle once supplemental requests settle (#3572)\n\nA refresh that also refetches retained parallel or intercepted branches kept\nthe navigation abort handle until React committed it. A navigation that\nsuperseded the refresh after those supplemental requests had settled aborted\nthe primary Flight body while React was still rendering it, so its pending\nchunks rejected with \"AbortError: BodyStreamBuffer was aborted\" into the\nerror boundary.\n\nRelease the handle as soon as the supplemental requests settle. They already\nstop listening to the signal at that point, so the only transport it still\nguarded was the body React reads.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqvOOTCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAPEUQAGpn2ptKg/tCfDfYA8dGDRm5\nAAsnRQr0dFPCAo7QrQ4gQiZNWmjKSKmhJzVp8E1YbmlM7Q8ejEtexxwEyNIjeRxq\nGeoGRJ5jo+5rJbnQm99sDox3AwOf68Vp0WyqqUcUeuiyfOqOexEodQwvCxY/9Ri6\n0L8XV5ECT/6u5AgqtJlY/eX0uMBVKEL0o0vVjmnVM05IPhwW6esUYxq3/IJYzOtk\n6qCsxcQ7vA8nan2nq704OXTMWbSfuDbzzc3W8o06vBitEgGj5/e0cnBcPycBrEAp\nNyL+QjQWiu8dgyGUJmc6N43vDN9iKuFPvHDOsBJbFgVeh24jVVN3ZW1PWw9iCNAl\noKksbLs06uUWeiyLcF+0FPYWi9noKodnNk9MOy7NElWiHaTqoUs6HxfX92glPMKE\nab5fo+KRnb/t44DRgLLdNEacfLNOoeED3bUZfYKS2sa01paNH+mHixnG2gifNoqd\nv+e8QvKkKf08tjzNgejvFzOBiV6CANSxKHEZNpuIN/ejIm2+qcGM3/rcYOyPnmDa\nkRZj7mXNMb/Wr8RZMpsVKaIbAl4vpoKj0Kp0/d/vGkytq9fye7cqFZKScAsqPXjG\nuQlrdQG2x+0tj96BMwvapnA9LGqbnhbDIuGMHWj3YBX1uH5C89vRzFMZH5qgceKn\n2eJbLbB6WyVevHNiEMEr\n=mlrh\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-30T10:25:23Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cloudflare/vinext/commit/149c319cb202cdeaade73718b8bcbdb650989b15","node_id":"C_kwDORXYnQNoAKDE0OWMzMTljYjIwMmNkZWFhZGU3MzcxOGI4YmNiZGI2NTA5ODliMTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cloudflare/vinext/commit/dc2947764aa316a106807b596d1b864d5471b338","sha":"dc2947764aa316a106807b596d1b864d5471b338","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cloudflare/vinext/commits/dc2947764aa316a106807b596d1b864d5471b338"}],"sha":"149c319cb202cdeaade73718b8bcbdb650989b15","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cloudflare/vinext/commits/149c319cb202cdeaade73718b8bcbdb650989b15"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/153097222?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yi-111-a/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yi-111-a/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yi-111-a/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yi-111-a/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Yi-111-a","id":153097222,"login":"Yi-111-a","node_id":"U_kgDOCSAUBg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yi-111-a/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yi-111-a/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yi-111-a/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yi-111-a/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yi-111-a/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yi-111-a","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cloudflare/vinext/commits/dc2947764aa316a106807b596d1b864d5471b338/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T10:20:02Z","email":"153097222+Yi-111-a@users.noreply.github.com","name":"yi111"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T10:20:02Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(build): prerender before emitting standalone output (#3579)\n\n* fix(build): prerender before emitting standalone output\n\nWith `output: \"standalone\"` the build lifecycle returned from\n`finalizeBuild` right after `emitStandaloneOutput()`, before the\nprerender decision was ever evaluated. `vinext build --prerender-all`\nand `vinext({ prerender: ... })` were therefore silently ignored for\nstandalone builds, and the emitted `dist/standalone` tree never\ncontained the prerendered artifacts.\n\nNext.js runs `writeStandaloneDirectory` after static generation and\npasses it the collected `staticPages`. Move the standalone emission\nbelow the prerender phase so the standalone tree ships the same\nprerendered output instead of dropping it.\n\n* test(build): cover prerendered standalone fixture output\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: James <james@eli.cx>","tree":{"sha":"cfe4c2a2c0441c8bb69f1db8a32a6e13a328ab2e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cloudflare/vinext/git/trees/cfe4c2a2c0441c8bb69f1db8a32a6e13a328ab2e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cloudflare/vinext/git/commits/dc2947764aa316a106807b596d1b864d5471b338","verification":{"payload":"tree cfe4c2a2c0441c8bb69f1db8a32a6e13a328ab2e\nparent 7d2f0d0cd51c1e0cee0d97f3361f91366f4d099a\nauthor yi111 <153097222+Yi-111-a@users.noreply.github.com> 1790763602 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790763602 +0100\n\nfix(build): prerender before emitting standalone output (#3579)\n\n* fix(build): prerender before emitting standalone output\n\nWith `output: \"standalone\"` the build lifecycle returned from\n`finalizeBuild` right after `emitStandaloneOutput()`, before the\nprerender decision was ever evaluated. `vinext build --prerender-all`\nand `vinext({ prerender: ... })` were therefore silently ignored for\nstandalone builds, and the emitted `dist/standalone` tree never\ncontained the prerendered artifacts.\n\nNext.js runs `writeStandaloneDirectory` after static generation and\npasses it the collected `staticPages`. Move the standalone emission\nbelow the prerender phase so the standalone tree ships the same\nprerendered output instead of dropping it.\n\n* test(build): cover prerendered standalone fixture output\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: James <james@eli.cx>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqvOJSCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAfkAQAIMLbWKSyFS/MzTWJn8nmusG\nwMvu/kx4r0kAkw5BGV6iuvMlSTyJfz5D9Fe2M7Q8PqNBB4MMQI912IY/bl8CtGIY\nnCdju5CwQVY2nmHyJbcRzem1D9S64l4RXSwS6HBs5bvkObXafTCJUhz7sS8AJx6O\nVOi+6trW4xzadDtYuZl/yvGlTJRXmkADzuxUavFvnjmvI+uu0O0Gy+Kj9E55Hc0N\nBpAY17GaT1bUJr7ExmO4p0XIylbPxVf9e2pvb2asF1C6t+Dt9SOEa/5xvU9T0FWo\n5NfoAei1zc+u55lsL4bY/xQ+iScv/cTDtKMXDKs7D+sbz395OMm2lG/IbJ4EQIj8\nnPzeGu9Q8SbejaJ8zVp18x3+KlJQ6710+zUk+MPbktvg7AkWLOdkrzbtOfY9iUd6\nySxtIOTQKki+/pcaD/nw7lvRplTHR4t6jsRWPEwwwIrFh4IBXOyxcTQIHgmHajzv\nQtTnDr7SjWWsQ2zwne1Pyy5P8aRAIHqSFmOXbNBVh5i8AJ86id4X5NrlP3mfkwBM\nUpS2u6vnrRcrcgaInnp39JEDVhqG9y2H7HbGCT9tnzk3KuL5A5BLdsnJGrtgM/yG\nOgtoeBLg9gbRpLUWpRjdSvekkW83nor4VnT9m2iOPmCFM2P8V799M88u1+Pxn7O9\nOfauB12sKqgfV+H66EAD\n=JeRs\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-30T10:20:03Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/