ithub.com/cloudflare/vinext/commit/e767f5981affbc4e1ffc6eaef73506cdc335260b","node_id":"C_kwDORXYnQNoAKGU3NjdmNTk4MWFmZmJjNGUxZmZjNmVhZWY3MzUwNmNkYzMzNTI2MGI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cloudflare/vinext/commit/d232674c6471660d517a8b228097124fec3b58cc","sha":"d232674c6471660d517a8b228097124fec3b58cc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cloudflare/vinext/commits/d232674c6471660d517a8b228097124fec3b58cc"}],"sha":"e767f5981affbc4e1ffc6eaef73506cdc335260b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cloudflare/vinext/commits/e767f5981affbc4e1ffc6eaef73506cdc335260b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/179739256?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SammyTourani/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SammyTourani/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SammyTourani/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SammyTourani/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SammyTourani","id":179739256,"login":"SammyTourani","node_id":"U_kgDOCraaeA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SammyTourani/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SammyTourani/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SammyTourani/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SammyTourani/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SammyTourani/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SammyTourani","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cloudflare/vinext/commits/d232674c6471660d517a8b228097124fec3b58cc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-29T17:42:38Z","email":"sammytourani@gmail.com","name":"Sammy Tourani"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T17:42:38Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(router): preserve middleware and rewrites for missing static assets (#3541)\n\n* fix(nitro): return plain-text 404 for missing App Router _next/static assets\n\nUnder Nitro, App Router requests are dispatched through the SSR entry''s\nfetch() export, which passed the RSC handler''s response through unchanged.\nA request for a missing /_next/static/* file therefore returned the\nrendered HTML not-found page, while vinext start and the Worker entries\nreturn Next.js''s plain-text \"Not Found\" 404.\n\nApply the same missing-build-asset finalization the Worker entry uses,\nhonouring basePath and assetPrefix. Middleware still runs first and can\nrewrite or respond to the request.\n\n* fix(router): classify missing static assets after rewrites\n\n* fix(router): preserve asset prefixes and hybrid dev route ownership\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: James <james@eli.cx>","tree":{"sha":"8b5139865e35a13cd29d1a4765abb5b5a89428e8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cloudflare/vinext/git/trees/8b5139865e35a13cd29d1a4765abb5b5a89428e8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cloudflare/vinext/git/commits/d232674c6471660d517a8b228097124fec3b58cc","verification":{"payload":"tree 8b5139865e35a13cd29d1a4765abb5b5a89428e8\nparent 516d2fb172d999cbc63f91c4b8e3c8bd4356d8be\nauthor Sammy Tourani <sammytourani@gmail.com> 1790703758 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790703758 +0100\n\nfix(router): preserve middleware and rewrites for missing static assets (#3541)\n\n* fix(nitro): return plain-text 404 for missing App Router _next/static assets\n\nUnder Nitro, App Router requests are dispatched through the SSR entry''s\nfetch() export, which passed the RSC handler''s response through unchanged.\nA request for a missing /_next/static/* file therefore returned the\nrendered HTML not-found page, while vinext start and the Worker entries\nreturn Next.js''s plain-text \"Not Found\" 404.\n\nApply the same missing-build-asset finalization the Worker entry uses,\nhonouring basePath and assetPrefix. Middleware still runs first and can\nrewrite or respond to the request.\n\n