users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cloudflare/vinext/commit/07692fcf0f24037cbec254d81e0903429fa1505d","node_id":"C_kwDORXYnQNoAKDA3NjkyZmNmMGYyNDAzN2NiZWMyNTRkODFlMDkwMzQyOWZhMTUwNWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cloudflare/vinext/commit/35d978bbd684c5704d1474cb0f91bd6e2cf1e436","sha":"35d978bbd684c5704d1474cb0f91bd6e2cf1e436","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cloudflare/vinext/commits/35d978bbd684c5704d1474cb0f91bd6e2cf1e436"}],"sha":"07692fcf0f24037cbec254d81e0903429fa1505d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cloudflare/vinext/commits/07692fcf0f24037cbec254d81e0903429fa1505d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10815538?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/james-elicx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/james-elicx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/james-elicx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/james-elicx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/james-elicx","id":10815538,"login":"james-elicx","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwODE1NTM4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/james-elicx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/james-elicx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/james-elicx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/james-elicx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/james-elicx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/james-elicx","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cloudflare/vinext/commits/35d978bbd684c5704d1474cb0f91bd6e2cf1e436/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-29T15:30:58Z","email":"james@eli.cx","name":"James Anderson"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T15:30:58Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"perf(plugins): prescan for require.context calls before parsing (#3562)\n\nThe vinext:require-context transform filter admits every module that\nmentions both `require` and `.context`, which includes large dependencies\nsuch as typescript.js and React. Each of those was parsed with parseAst\neven though it can never contain a rewritable call.\n\nGate the parse on a cheap regex that requires a `.context` member call\nwhose first argument is a string literal. The prescan is conservative:\nit allows whitespace (including the U+0085/U+200B the parser accepts),\nparenthesized callees and arguments, optional calls, `\\u` escapes in the\nproperty name, and treats any `<` after `context` (type arguments) or any\ncomment opener in a gap as a possible match. The match starts at\n`context` and looks back for the `.`, so the scan is linear in the input\nand never walks a comment body.","tree":{"sha":"766253d0c8cc7173c4d23de78ccac8e3b4d2c68e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cloudflare/vinext/git/trees/766253d0c8cc7173c4d23de78ccac8e3b4d2c68e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cloudflare/vinext/git/commits/35d978bbd684c5704d1474cb0f91bd6e2cf1e436","verification":{"payload":"tree 766253d0c8cc7173c4d23de78ccac8e3b4d2c68e\nparent 9f78d2205bc5579f657dc45e3bdfe313d199d0f9\nauthor James Anderson <james@eli.cx> 1790695858 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790695858 +0100\n\nperf(plugins): prescan for require.context calls before parsing (#3562)\n\nThe vinext:require-context transform filter admits every module that\nmentions both `require` and `.context`, which includes large dependencies\nsuch as typescript.js and React. Each of those was parsed with parseAst\neven though it can never contain a rewritable call.\n\nGate the parse on a cheap regex that requires a `.context` member call\nwhose first argument is a string literal. The prescan is conservative:\nit allows whitespace (including the U+0085/U+200B the parser accepts),\nparenthesized callees and arguments, optional calls, `\\u` escapes in the\nproperty name, and treats any `<` after `context` (type arguments) or any\ncomment opener in a gap as a possible match. The match starts at\n`context` and looks back for the `.`, so the scan is linear in the input\nand never walks a comment body.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqu9myCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAk7AQAJza05EdEwQM5fA+hWbOuWGl\njccl7Ut0x3yZQfOoswUQ2U+n5FYDa+9gL6Gue8dE/ytrFGLDKTg26XuClgQ37jlY\n8Wq+IzHholrMhoQbXAV9TJKrIvEN7qO/2szjo7fiqE5+s4CCXXvnHg7YeT9c4azm\neOcaXIr/79gYijycLrr2vd66WuQZo3ay7uHNR3BLeO+FqdFSkvuT+Q3Je9bQNlnG\nTguOcHFmhhg4KK/EWjkuMcVTs/+Z9y1/ZZAUnzlmaN1UfnOVIzH6YufPeSmUgR9K\nbbwbdnq5jj2cNnus3vpl02AQnfjodG2GGS2FG+Slq3Qb3kbwlUQNni6gzGjcCJcV\n8uSsrChYD1A09RQKRocNU+P70ub+Fq46YFfv0oVk3s8SAMCQJOpN76NPKe0HuWY6\nGbucRa8rmgeJFCmNpF6NnGX2mP+5xDAK4o2lgXOKhDEW4qzgc8yz7yxZpIvCeyGe\ngzWhBKFq+EGj5XYhoOYYjNCNnkOkHew0M4jlg4DZh/vXHEpokt5CdxrypBFOwM1F\n75I1y9JEbMU8VmTmRJRSUeH3wmquS2K+9H189MB3BOCeKWrBC2j1jWXtRhVFIL2Y\nLCiLKaQe7UHjdZKShWu/9Muz21+N74zpryGS/M65XEcHO2hr6TvGIdDJYMOiqmUc\nun9qpSA4HDIxvXZR9vej\n=VOIP\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-29T15:30:59Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/org