d_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/james-elicx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/james-elicx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/james-elicx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/james-elicx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/james-elicx","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cloudflare/vinext/commits/68e561f1254d873aa273598850e93eb90cb2301e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-29T15:10:05Z","email":"james@eli.cx","name":"James Anderson"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T15:10:05Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"perf(build): prefilter optimize-imports matcher on quoted package source (#3550)\n\n* perf(build): prefilter optimize-imports matcher on quoted package source\n\nCheck that an optimized package name appears as a quoted string before running the backtracking-heavy importFromPattern regex. The quoted pattern is a substring of importFromPattern, so results are unchanged; large modules such as typescript.js are rejected in ~1ms instead of ~100ms+.\n\n* perf(build): explain regex spy in optimize-imports prefilter test","tree":{"sha":"7f45be07549f3e49597ffc07cc60dd0d553a706d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cloudflare/vinext/git/trees/7f45be07549f3e49597ffc07cc60dd0d553a706d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cloudflare/vinext/git/commits/68e561f1254d873aa273598850e93eb90cb2301e","verification":{"payload":"tree 7f45be07549f3e49597ffc07cc60dd0d553a706d\nparent 7c31bb19edd2a30b9b88923348365f33b25dad59\nauthor James Anderson <james@eli.cx> 1790694605 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790694605 +0100\n\nperf(build): prefilter optimize-imports matcher on quoted package source (#3550)\n\n* perf(build): prefilter optimize-imports matcher on quoted package source\n\nCheck that an optimized package name appears as a quoted string before running the backtracking-heavy importFromPattern regex. The quoted pattern is a substring of importFromPattern, so results are unchanged; large modules such as typescript.js are rejected in ~1ms instead of ~100ms+.\n\n* perf(build): explain regex spy in optimize-imports prefilter test","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqu9TNCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA+lIQAFYRKDvxaSVxOhONNOuYRk4T\nAbTe2e3t0K3E0XL9Fy+dfJhrGFcg0xEdmC5QJDK51eJSHTkVD+9l/JGu+GxQzioa\niW71hnxxOiuwthNuxue5pwbUNmr8qHDdLoqVePOgpCcQ1qCnUE+NFp0PfH3CZS6I\nzilDKA+MkY2uFrOjekSOsCYiP3FOTPud6eSgKpkblm796KdRi/PnAYML+hhBW9t4\nHmji4zztTUGrTQyd+LkxNR6ODNbbgcXl6RmW4j6lh6jGTuU5w82tqNPXkuNtpPBR\nH24cR6TuvuAGdzDZCViK5Q0Na5Sj6sEU5jCvGuZB+9/tOsLqQauYTpzW2TNJeyQV\nk/UyJ8RVwUQnQolcOSMKrVCQfbr5RVRcoeLObja5wjsyRWjMmEJMU8Ezsfdf1wEh\nw+a5IKrOiqgc/43r8vxJmbltvSGtjRRfCFx+In4W7paBJyROzFSRdYo6oM+G2Eq6\ny3D5EN7s1dOBrfZZlElzQKpsZnRIpkcmFSPJ1x+PubIDYRV0UljfUT7MNnLWqFHs\n0P7XOfuFoR4pmSApEeLigspxL6pVLAuj5CrByMo2FdgQWetkqAJJq4PDiePvQIS5\nkDzr00TM3ksgBG0RvL7XEVmP+0EtqI0futbB2u+QfN5+GMLZS394weXdPvuiaYTS\nwhKUt7nxOq0MsgwPOnpx\n=HQk8\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-29T15:10:05Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"http