thub.com/users/james-elicx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/james-elicx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/james-elicx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/james-elicx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/james-elicx","id":10815538,"login":"james-elicx","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwODE1NTM4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/james-elicx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/james-elicx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/james-elicx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/james-elicx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/james-elicx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/james-elicx","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cloudflare/vinext/commits/ac71cce7fff25f8d8d6c4458f9f08cdecd935982/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-29T15:07:51Z","email":"james@eli.cx","name":"James Anderson"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T15:07:51Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"perf(plugins): skip parsing modules without rewritable dynamic requests (#3555)\n\nThe ignore-dynamic-requests gate only checks that a module mentions\n`require` or `import(`, so nearly every server dependency was parsed and\nscope-walked even though the transform only rewrites requests with no\nstatic part.\n\nAdd a per-occurrence prescan that skips modules whose `require`/`import`\noccurrences are all provably unchanged: calls with a single-line string\nliteral other than \"/\", static imports, member properties, longer\nidentifiers, and non-callee positions. Escaped identifiers, comments\n(including HTML-like comments), optional calls, TypeScript wrappers, and\nparenthesized callees still go through the AST pass.","tree":{"sha":"63c92591959fe7255aaab87ec4be96842ab0d34e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cloudflare/vinext/git/trees/63c92591959fe7255aaab87ec4be96842ab0d34e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cloudflare/vinext/git/commits/ac71cce7fff25f8d8d6c4458f9f08cdecd935982","verification":{"payload":"tree 63c92591959fe7255aaab87ec4be96842ab0d34e\nparent 3e038ddea7db5cfca83edd901fc1195e549a3fbd\nauthor James Anderson <james@eli.cx> 1790694471 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790694471 +0100\n\nperf(plugins): skip parsing modules without rewritable dynamic requests (#3555)\n\nThe ignore-dynamic-requests gate only checks that a module mentions\n`require` or `import(`, so nearly every server dependency was parsed and\nscope-walked even though the transform only rewrites requests with no\nstatic part.\n\nAdd a per-occurrence prescan that skips modules whose `require`/`import`\noccurrences are all provably unchanged: calls with a single-line string\nliteral other than \"/\", static imports, member properties, longer\nidentifiers, and non-callee positions. Escaped identifiers, comments\n(including HTML-like comments), optional calls, TypeScript wrappers, and\nparenthesized callees still go through the AST pass.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqu9RHCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAACdcQAAB6i5Y7UbVgFbgBTbEawz9p\nNzIEZALnv+VMwVeXH0HZlDVpyOk9wNQNouqTpbepfY0Jv1ZaSezuVC7V51886Piz\n1AynoarazUPPpRg4vClNptXVGqUmIa3949AiRsFbOjHmhozhVSodJg/0vO/eGa1k\n5NzyYc0ktcWS+6u1aerBGg+xVftJGprIItms6utM84XVJlW/ejvbHgJdf9LfEFSo\n/dXOHHZDt4QKvJ7svC/SpGG0PwxxrlVMU6RPQZW0zbNEOXwKv4gYxZH1ItsElwmw\nrND1HkwGvyAAvJeX6XHYjZ0+nmWePN/AcjzvYyLQVv7axNlKeCwncMzOJdCjFr1T\nATIUbRhQS0tSya9ovbR+YPKq7h5O24/n3MyijhYGfIIASXkn32AK7CU3xTmGax4G\nF8nX4Hiby3Lb8zOq6vDEiCq8zO2cUNmvfsc94J3TpCRCFIlht18cF8aGFhvgOeto\nJsdDilpKnyScatvubThYIteajuUv5NVgqKtA4kzY6ZZkaMwd7vTxZ9y7j/0ip2r0\n3S6jM5O4bTWZobXnlonzQ5uMq/DC/R+AE3rANJwdEt/xY2SQz/4huNKBLt7BrFfM\nWvtSOpP23OBNUmtmzGzTWudIOpXcMP3qFyJcqz6T6GGLY0NXLTwHN4D3z5aiVqzH\nYptaw5ceAUuwdPLq6VLz\n=iu59\n-----END 