rs_url":"https://api.github.com/users/james-elicx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/james-elicx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/james-elicx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/james-elicx","id":10815538,"login":"james-elicx","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwODE1NTM4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/james-elicx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/james-elicx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/james-elicx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/james-elicx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/james-elicx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/james-elicx","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cloudflare/vinext/commits/36606eabd8b27a4c963278154768f5381a45573e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-29T14:22:25Z","email":"james@eli.cx","name":"James Anderson"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T14:22:25Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"perf(ssr): stop loading browser runtime modules for shared helpers (#3559)\n\n* perf(ssr): stop loading browser runtime modules for shared helpers\n\n* fix(ssr): keep shared browser globals in the client directory\n\nPages Router client bootstrap imports navigation-runtime, and a server/\nmodule in its graph trips the client-graph guard.\n\n* fix(ssr): import shared browser globals from the client directory\n\n* test(e2e): load the form-state global name without a CommonJS copy\n\nA static import from a Playwright spec loads vinext source as CommonJS in\nthat worker. init-css-modules later imports prod-server as ESM in the same\nworker and got the CommonJS browser-globals copy, whose named exports Node\ndetected only partially.\n\n* refactor(ssr): import the form-state global name from its leaf module","tree":{"sha":"35988e35d5f2e594bdcb9bb93d3fed2bda1e6c66","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cloudflare/vinext/git/trees/35988e35d5f2e594bdcb9bb93d3fed2bda1e6c66"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cloudflare/vinext/git/commits/36606eabd8b27a4c963278154768f5381a45573e","verification":{"payload":"tree 35988e35d5f2e594bdcb9bb93d3fed2bda1e6c66\nparent ca3a5e9b523905697b52b8f2adf39f152c524411\nauthor James Anderson <james@eli.cx> 1790691745 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790691745 +0100\n\nperf(ssr): stop loading browser runtime modules for shared helpers (#3559)\n\n* perf(ssr): stop loading browser runtime modules for shared helpers\n\n* fix(ssr): keep shared browser globals in the client directory\n\nPages Router client bootstrap imports navigation-runtime, and a server/\nmodule in its graph trips the client-graph guard.\n\n* fix(ssr): import shared browser globals from the client directory\n\n* test(e2e): load the form-state global name without a CommonJS copy\n\nA static import from a Playwright spec loads vinext source as CommonJS in\nthat worker. init-css-modules later imports prod-server as ESM in the same\nworker and got the CommonJS browser-globals copy, whose named exports Node\ndetected only partially.\n\n* refactor(ssr): import the form-state global name from its leaf module","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqu8mhCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAvgQQAJISioMGiOULhfkurkRY4+00\nUXdYYI3lvzvD+SEM6wUYTUvu6xVEYzjdJA2ZNcv1xdgQ9tpOUIVv8TuQ7Ys8ie+Z\nGa0C7u5yqt3xGBLI6tVZo+vpPFC2w/yLBtMc3gcmm2+qKi8LVnVRRXzvAXXKVbdp\n2svFgF9YWCSbiDhRHRn7BUoVIM3cR7vXYe13+QMzfl7KZ3miRucHIQRL/5w9HaBB\nIxvu3glTOcF5SIXpobeqvvHPO/aGoFBFBE9ljAS6Jtn+lD1RTxE6a93FlQfU/21o\nxHEeeoE9uHWR7jhl95XeY/3+U4CuzpFXhdblQ2MDz8S36oheUsszWaUSXwTdH8rP\nUkvy/dPa0UdylqqnbCVQfxGh5f8q8klGigWAJcuhq+ZFrH4i6EPaxpjGZCCDGVFz\naI2QQmU6X1yxoEnfXLC09B0xxnRyRbv7rgzaxKzSaNvi6DUe0OUI/u+CaeT7xAmd\nicUGgsW5yV/eoPL9WAtHSU2aAU/nYbBdcGVm1Swq+ulLSHs0jut8c7uktUGzz1D+\nH9HQhKiNV2mRVDkkMj2sCExC1rj+Zum6Y5CxeAlW5daHC4QzV