tps://api.github.com/users/manologargue","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/manologargue/process-mining-charts/commits/add8e690d13a35f12c3b0c8770314cd8c223fb72/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-01T11:23:21Z","email":"65821656+manologargue@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Manuel García"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-01T11:23:21Z","email":"65821656+manologargue@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Manuel García"},"message":"feat: mejoras fase 16 — multi-activity, timestamp opcional, animación, tests y leyenda footer\n\n1. Activity column multi-valor: selector multi-columna en controlPanel;\n   el backend combina columnas con '' + '' para formar el nombre de actividad.\n\n2. Timestamp opcional: campo no requerido en frontend y backend;\n   modo frecuencia funciona sin timestamp, modo rendimiento devuelve 400.\n\n3. Script XES→CSV: datasets/xes_to_csv.py con pm4py.\n\n4. Leyenda PerfLegend movida al footer (franja horizontal inline).\n\n5. Tests (127 en total): nuevas clases TestOptionalTimestamp y\n   TestMultiColumnActivity en test_api.py y test_service.py;\n   conftest actualizado para aceptar timestamp_col=None.\n\n6. Token animation: hook useTokenAnimation + botón ▶/■ por variante\n   en StatsPanel — token ámbar se desplaza nodo a nodo con Cytoscape.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1fc9440305ea15553ab8a8395b9e1e5f3f699370","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/manologargue/process-mining-charts/git/trees/1fc9440305ea15553ab8a8395b9e1e5f3f699370"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/manologargue/process-mining-charts/git/commits/add8e690d13a35f12c3b0c8770314cd8c223fb72","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65821656?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manologargue/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.githu