":"https://api.github.com/users/manologargue/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manologargue/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manologargue/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manologargue/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manologargue/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/manologargue","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/manologargue/process-mining-charts/commits/57e16b1e9b33f4334da8eb7885c416a69065eec5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-01T11:04:22Z","email":"65821656+manologargue@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Manuel García"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-01T11:04:22Z","email":"65821656+manologargue@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Manuel García"},"message":"feat(plugin): add Recipes feature for saving and loading filter combinations\n\nImplements a recipe system (inspired by Disco) that lets users save the current\nactivity filter, threshold sliders, and performance metric as a named recipe,\nthen apply it again in one click.\n\n- RecipeFilters / Recipe types in types.ts\n- useRecipes hook: localStorage persistence, save/remove/export/import\n- RecipePanel overlay: save form, compatibility check against current dataset,\n  apply/export/delete per recipe\n- Chart.tsx: Recipes button in top bar, RecipePanel in graph area\n\nReference-only fields (dfgMode, topKVariants, dates, durations) are stored for\ninformational display but cannot be auto-applied as they are Superset control\npanel state.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"84a98a418c503f0d5d65a31afaf83b1c33376af6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/manologargue/process-mining-charts/git/trees/84a98a418c503f0d5d65a31afaf83b1c33376af6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/manologargue/process-mining-charts/git/commits/57e16b1e9b33f4334da8eb7885c416a69065eec