low exclusivo de dataset, sin subida de ficheros)\n- Añade extension/shared/: tipos DFGData y lógica de renderizado compartida\n  entre el plugin y el backend\n- Backend: nuevo endpoint POST /api/dfg-from-rows (filas SQL → pm4py → DFG)\n- Tests: test_dfg_from_rows.py cubre el nuevo endpoint\n- README: actualiza arquitectura con la Capa 2 del plugin nativo\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"62f1be4f625af8175afbd202710328c67d1bd02d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/manologargue/process-mining-charts/git/trees/62f1be4f625af8175afbd202710328c67d1bd02d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/manologargue/process-mining-charts/git/commits/c2331576105e437f5c71d90d291f94d44632baf2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65821656?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manologargue/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manologargue/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manologargue/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manologargue/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/manologargue","id":65821656,"login":"manologargue","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1ODIxNjU2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manologargue/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manologargue/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manologargue/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manologargue/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manologargue/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/manologargue","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/manologargue/process-mining-charts/commit/c2331576105e437f5c71d90d291f94d44632baf2","node_id":"C_kwDORXy9Q9oAKGMyMzMxNTc2MTA1ZTQzN2Y1YzcxZDkwZD