logargue","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1ODIxNjU2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manologargue/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manologargue/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manologargue/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manologargue/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manologargue/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/manologargue","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/manologargue/process-mining-charts/commits/de1d64afaf4a467c725dcd2e4316e5a3d2993070/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-04T18:05:28Z","email":"65821656+manologargue@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Manuel García"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-04T18:05:28Z","email":"65821656+manologargue@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Manuel García"},"message":"feat(ux): mejoras de usabilidad en frontend y backend\n\nBackend:\n- Extrae _compute_statistics_payload y _compute_variants_payload como helpers\n- /api/filter devuelve statistics y variants del log filtrado (un solo\n  round-trip en lugar de 3 llamadas separadas)\n\nFrontend (funcional):\n- Stats y variantes se actualizan al aplicar filtros (datos siempre\n  consistentes con el DFG mostrado)\n- FiltersPanel sincroniza estado local con prop filters en cualquier cambio\n  externo (fix: revert en error ya no deja UI y datos inconsistentes)\n- DFGViewer muestra mensaje cuando el filtro deja 0 actividades\n- Zoom bidireccional: scroll en el canvas actualiza el slider y viceversa\n  (flag suppressZoomEvent para evitar bucle)\n\nFrontend (UX):\n- Confirmacion inline en Toolbar reemplaza window.confirm (funciona en iframes)\n- Toast de 4s tras upload con resumen de casos/eventos/actividades\n- Indicador de cambios pendientes en boton Aplicar filtros (punto azul)\n- Validacion de rango de fechas en cliente (date_to >= date_from)\n- Checkbox \"All activities\" con estado indeterminate cuando solo algunas\n  estan seleccionadas\n- Zoom label asociado con htmlFor/id (accesibilidad)\n- Mensajes de error de Python mapeados a mensajes amigables para el usuario\n- role=alert en error de upload, role=status en loading y toast\n- Hint de columnas CSV esperadas en pantalla de upload\n- Textos de UI traducidos al español\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f84a4af3fb56bd744a7f25c9f438b2fc2966aa84","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/manologargue/process-mining-charts/git/trees/f84a4af3fb56bd744a7f25c9f438b2fc2966aa84"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/manologargue/process-mining-charts/git/commits/de1d64afaf4a467c725dcd2e4316e5a3d2993070","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65821656?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manologargue/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manologargue/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manologargue/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manologargue/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/manologargue","id":65821656,"login":"manologargue","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1ODIxNjU2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manologargue/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manologargue/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manologargue/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manologargue/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manologargue/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/manologargue","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/manologargue/process-mining-charts/commit/de1d64afaf4a467c725dcd2e4316e5a3d2993070","node_id":"C_kwDORXy9Q9oAKGRlMWQ2NGFmYWY0YT