.github.com/users/manologargue/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manologargue/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manologargue/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/manologargue","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/manologargue/process-mining-charts/commits/ff49089e7c63c76f1486ca16cb6d407a22cd948c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-06T09:31:13Z","email":"manolo.garciaguerrero@alum.uca.es","name":"manologargue"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-06T09:31:13Z","email":"manolo.garciaguerrero@alum.uca.es","name":"manologargue"},"message":"fase-2: Flask Blueprint + extension.json\n\n- Crea extension/backend/src/process_mining/api.py con 5 endpoints:\n  GET  /process-mining/             → sirve frontend SPA / standalone.html\n  POST /process-mining/api/upload   → carga XES, XES.GZ o CSV (session_id)\n  GET  /process-mining/api/dfg      → DFG frecuencia o rendimiento\n  GET  /process-mining/api/statistics → KPIs del proceso\n  GET  /process-mining/api/variants → lista de variantes ordenada\n  POST /process-mining/api/filter   → DFG con filtros (actividades, top-K, fechas)\n- Detección automática de columnas case_id/activity/timestamp\n- Almacén de sesiones en memoria (dict keyed by uuid)\n- Crea extension/extension.json con metadata del plugin\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ec9dbc2d353c8be5ca25231b0798ba4cab96ddce","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/manologargue/process-mining-charts/git/trees/ec9dbc2d353c8be5ca25231b0798ba4cab96ddce"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/manologargue/process-mining-charts/git/commits/ff49089e7c63c76f1486ca16cb6d407a22cd948c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65821656?v=4","events_url":"https://api.g