occe17","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jocce17/mfe-host/commits/bda5d229679bb749d47a36122f63b1d42fa50c9c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-25T01:36:59Z","email":"josejgvc9@gmail.com","name":"Jose Villamizar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-25T01:36:59Z","email":"josejgvc9@gmail.com","name":"Jose Villamizar"},"message":"feat: update package.json and add new dependencies for Module Federation support\n\n- Changed project name to lowercase in package.json\n- Added dependencies: @module-federation/enhanced, @callstack/repack, @rspack/core, @swc/helpers, and sdk-mfe-shared-dependencies\n- Updated existing dependencies to latest versions\n\nfeat: add react-native.config.js for Re.Pack commands integration\n\n- Created react-native.config.js to utilize Re.Pack commands\n\nfeat: create rspack.config.mjs for Rspack configuration\n\n- Added rspack.config.mjs with Re.Pack defaults for React Native\n- Configured Module Federation with remotes and shared dependencies\n\nfeat: implement Test component for loading remote MiniApp\n\n- Created Test component to dynamically load MiniApp using Federated\n\nfeat: add MiniAppLoader component for lazy loading MiniApp\n\n- Implemented MiniAppLoader with fallback UI during loading\n\nfeat: create RemoteComponentWrapper for error handling and loading states\n\n- Added RemoteComponentWrapper to manage remote component loading and errors\n\nfeat: develop Components page to showcase remote components\n\n- Created Components page to demonstrate usage of remote components from CoreComponents\n\nchore: update tsconfig.json for better type definitions\n\n- Enhanced tsconfig.json with clearer structure for types, include, and exclude options","tree":{"sha":"7ae6277c08d71190b77d2acb1a92864f2091a0bb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jocce17/mfe-host/git/trees/7ae6277c08d71190b77d2acb1a92864f2091a0bb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jocce17/mfe-host/git/commits/bda5d229679bb7